# translit_itrans = amRRitasara meM chauka darabAra sAhaba ilAke ke eka saMgaThana ne Apareshana blU sTAra ke daurAna prabhAvita hue logoM kI sampatti ko pahuMche nukasAna ke bhugatAna ke bAre meM Aja pradhAnamaMtrI rAjIva gAMdhI aura vitta maMtrI vishvanAtha pratApa siMha ke hastakShepa kI mAMga kI|
