# text = लुम्बिनी, कपिलवस्तु तथा श्रावस्ती जैसे प्रसिद्ध तीर्थस्थलों की निकटता के कारण बडी संख्या में विदेशी वहा आते-जाते हैं, पीलीभीत, बहराइच, गोंडा, बस्ती, गोरखपुर और देवरियां आदि जिलों में उन्होंने खुले हाथों पैसा लुटाया है, जिसकी प्रतिक्रिया में मुसलमान उन्हें मसीहा मानने लगे हैं, इस क्षेत्र पर हाजी मस्तान की नजर काफी समय से थी।
# translit_iast = lumbinī, kapilavastu tathā śrāvastī jaise prasiddha tīrthasthaloṃ kī nikaṭatā ke kāraṇa baḍī saṃkhyā meṃ videśī vahā āte-jāte haiṃ, pīlībhīta, baharāica, goṃḍā, bastī, gorakhapura aura devariyāṃ ādi jiloṃ meṃ unhoṃne khule hāthoṃ paisā luṭāyā hai, jisakī pratikriyā meṃ musalamāna unheṃ masīhā mānane lage haiṃ, isa kṣetra para hājī mastāna kī najara kāphī samaya se thī|
# translit_itrans = lumbinI, kapilavastu tathA shrAvastI jaise prasiddha tIrthasthaloM kI nikaTatA ke kAraNa baDI saMkhyA meM videshI vahA Ate-jAte haiM, pIlIbhIta, baharAicha, goMDA, bastI, gorakhapura aura devariyAM Adi jiloM meM unhoMne khule hAthoM paisA luTAyA hai, jisakI pratikriyA meM musalamAna unheM masIhA mAnane lage haiM, isa kShetra para hAjI mastAna kI najara kAphI samaya se thI|
# translit_indicxlit = lumbini, kapilavastu tathaa shravasti jaise prasiddh teerthsthalon key nikatata key kaaran buddy sankhya mein videshi wha aate-jaate hain, pilibhit, bahraich, gonda, basti, gorakhpur aur devariyaan aadi jilon mein unhone khule haathon paisa lutaaya hai, jisaki pratikriya mein musalman unhein messiah maanane lagey hain, iss kshetra para haaji mastan key nazar kaafee samay say thee.
# text_en = Due to their proximity to famous pilgrimage sites like Lumbini, Kapilvastu and Shravasti, a large number of foreigners visit them. In the districts of Pilibhit, Bahraich, Gonda, Basti, Gorakhpur and Deoria, they have looted money with open hands. In response, Muslims have started considering them as messiahs. Haji Mastan had his eye on this area for a long time.
