# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot19o.txt_P2_S2
# text = एकाएक हार्टफेल हो जाने से किसी की चन्द मिनटों में ही मृत्यु हो जाये और उसके बाद उसके घर वाले यह कहते पाये जायें कि इन दिनों तो बिल्कुल ठीक-ठाक थे, घर में रुचि ले रहे थे, नियमित सैर को जाते थे, काफी रात तक पढ़ने-लिखने और घर के दूसरे छोटे-मोटे कामों में व्यस्त रहते थे, और आज तो बहुत खुश थे, बस छत पर ऊपर गये, कहने लगे- आज कमरे में, फंखे के नीचे सोने के बजाय ऊपर छत पर ही सोयेंगे, अपना बिस्तर ऊपर लगा आये, नीचे आये तो कहने लगे- मुझे थोड़ा छाती में दर्द है, पत्नी ने बिठाया, सहारा दिया, सोचा- शायद सांस चढ़ गई हो, लेकिन वे तो लेट गये।
# translit_iast = ekāeka hārṭaphela ho jāne se kisī kī canda minaṭoṃ meṃ hī mṛtyu ho jāye aura usake bāda usake ghara vāle yaha kahate pāye jāyeṃ ki ina dinoṃ to bilkula ṭhīka-ṭhāka the, ghara meṃ ruci le rahe the, niyamita saira ko jāte the, kāphī rāta taka par̤hane-likhane aura ghara ke dūsare choṭe-moṭe kāmoṃ meṃ vyasta rahate the, aura āja to bahuta khuśa the, basa chata para ūpara gaye, kahane lage- āja kamare meṃ, phaṃkhe ke nīce sone ke bajāya ūpara chata para hī soyeṃge, apanā bistara ūpara lagā āye, nīce āye to kahane lage- mujhe thor̤ā chātī meṃ darda hai, patnī ne biṭhāyā, sahārā diyā, socā- śāyada sāṃsa car̤ha gaī ho, lekina ve to leṭa gaye|
# translit_itrans = ekAeka hArTaphela ho jAne se kisI kI chanda minaToM meM hI mRRityu ho jAye aura usake bAda usake ghara vAle yaha kahate pAye jAyeM ki ina dinoM to bilkula ThIka-ThAka the, ghara meM ruchi le rahe the, niyamita saira ko jAte the, kAphI rAta taka pa.Dhane-likhane aura ghara ke dUsare ChoTe-moTe kAmoM meM vyasta rahate the, aura Aja to bahuta khusha the, basa Chata para Upara gaye, kahane lage- Aja kamare meM, phaMkhe ke nIche sone ke bajAya Upara Chata para hI soyeMge, apanA bistara Upara lagA Aye, nIche Aye to kahane lage- mujhe tho.DA ChAtI meM darda hai, patnI ne biThAyA, sahArA diyA, sochA- shAyada sAMsa cha.Dha gaI ho, lekina ve to leTa gaye|
# translit_indicxlit = ekaek hartfell how jaane say kissy key chand minutes mein hee mrityu how jaye aur usake baad usake ghar waale yeah kahate paaye jaayen kii inn dino too bilkul theek-thhaak they, ghar mein ruchi lay rahe they, niyamit ser coo jaate they, kaafee raat tuck padhane-likhane aur ghar key dusare chhote-mote kaamon mein vyast rehte they, aur aaj too bahut khush they, bus chhath para oopar gaye, kahane lagey- aaj kamare mein, fankhe key niche sone key bajaay oopar chhath para hee soyenge, apna bistar oopar lagaa aye, niche aye too kahane lagey- mujhe thoda chhaati mein dard hai, patni nay bithaaya, sahaara diya, socha- shayed sans chadh gayee how, lekin way too lait gaye.
# text_en = Suddenly someone dies within a few minutes of heart failure and then his family members can say that these days he was completely fine, he was taking interest in the house, he used to go for regular walks, he used to spend a lot of nights reading and writing and engaged in other small household chores. And today he was very happy. He just went up on the roof. He said - Today, instead of sleeping under the bed in the room, he will sleep on the roof. He put his bed up and came down. He said - I have a little chest pain. His wife sat down and gave him support. He thought - maybe he got breathless but he just lay down.
