# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot19o.txt_P2_S3
# text = एक बच्चा घर में था, पत्नी ने हाथ-पाँव की मालिश की और छोटे बेटे से कहा-हो तो डाक्टर को बुला लाओ, उन्होंने इशारा किया, कोई जरूरत नहीं, अभी ठीक हो जाऊंगा, लेकिन बेटा चला ही गया, जब तक डाक्टर आया, उनके प्राण पखेरू हो चुके थे, बस इतनी-सी बात।
# translit_iast = eka baccā ghara meṃ thā, patnī ne hātha-pā~va kī māliśa kī aura choṭe beṭe se kahā-ho to ḍākṭara ko bulā lāo, unhoṃne iśārā kiyā, koī jarūrata nahīṃ, abhī ṭhīka ho jāūṃgā, lekina beṭā calā hī gayā, jaba taka ḍākṭara āyā, unake prāṇa pakherū ho cuke the, basa itanī-sī bāta|
# translit_itrans = eka bachchA ghara meM thA, patnI ne hAtha-pA.Nva kI mAlisha kI aura ChoTe beTe se kahA-ho to DAkTara ko bulA lAo, unhoMne ishArA kiyA, koI jarUrata nahIM, abhI ThIka ho jAUMgA, lekina beTA chalA hI gayA, jaba taka DAkTara AyA, unake prANa pakherU ho chuke the, basa itanI-sI bAta|
# translit_indicxlit = ack bachcha ghar mein tha, patni nay haath-paanv key maalish key aur chhote bete say kahaa-how too doctor coo bulaa lao, unhone ishara kiya, koi zaroorat nahin, abhi theek how jaaoonga, lekin beta chalaa hee gaya, jab tuck doctor aaya, unake pran pakheru how chuke they, bus itani-see baat.
# text_en = A child was in the house and the wife massaged his hands and legs and said to the younger son,'Go, call the doctor '. He indicated that there was no need, he would be fine now. But the son was gone. By the time the doctor arrived, his life had been shattered.
