# text = यह सब होता रहा और आप चुपचाप देखते रहे,बयान पर बिहार लोकदल के आध्यक्ष विनायक यादव, अनूपलाल यादव(केन्द्रीय संसदीय बोर्ड के सदस्य) मंगनीलाल मंडल(महामंत्री प्रदेश लोकदल), मोहम्मद मुश्ताक(प्रदेश महामंत्री),अशोक सिंह और दिवंगत कर्पूरी ठाकुर के पुत्र रामनाथ ठाकुर।
# translit_iast = yaha saba hotā rahā aura āpa cupacāpa dekhate rahe,bayāna para bihāra lokadala ke ādhyakṣa vināyaka yādava, anūpalāla yādava(kendrīya saṃsadīya borḍa ke sadasya) maṃganīlāla maṃḍala(mahāmaṃtrī pradeśa lokadala), mohammada muśtāka(pradeśa mahāmaṃtrī),aśoka siṃha aura divaṃgata karpūrī ṭhākura ke putra rāmanātha ṭhākura|
# translit_itrans = yaha saba hotA rahA aura Apa chupachApa dekhate rahe,bayAna para bihAra lokadala ke AdhyakSha vinAyaka yAdava, anUpalAla yAdava(kendrIya saMsadIya borDa ke sadasya) maMganIlAla maMDala(mahAmaMtrI pradesha lokadala), mohammada mushtAka(pradesha mahAmaMtrI),ashoka siMha aura divaMgata karpUrI ThAkura ke putra rAmanAtha ThAkura|
# translit_indicxlit = yeah sub hota raha aur aap chupchaap dekhate rahe,bayaan para bihaar lokdal key aadhyaksh vinaayak yadav, anuplal yadav(kendriya sansadiya board key sadasya) manganilal mandal(mahamantri pradesh lokdal), mohammad mushtaq(pradesh mahamantri),ashok singh aur divangat karpuri thakur key putra ramnath thakur.
# text_en = All this happened and you watched silently : Bihar Lok Dal president Vinayak Yadav, Anuplal Yadav ( member of the Central Parliamentary Board ), Mangani Lal Mandal ( chief minister of the state Lok Dal ), Mohammad Mushtaq ( state general secretary ), Ashok Singh and Ramnath Thakur, son of the late Karpoori Thakur, on the bus.
