# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot19av.txt_P2_S3
# text = यह कहनाहै आशीषनंदी का हालांकि ठीक यही बात अमेरिकी राष्ट्रपतियों के साथ प्रेस के रिश्ते के बारे में दशकों से कही जाती रही है, लेकिन देश के मौजूदा प्रधानमंत्री राजीव गांधी पर आशीषनंदी की यह बात इस मायने में कहीं ज्यादा फिट इसलिए बैठती है कि न तो इतना हैरतअंगेज आगमनऔर न महान ग्रीक त्रासदियों के नायक जैसा इतना हैरतअंगेज पतन पहले किसी प्रधानमंत्री का हुआ था.
# translit_iast = yaha kahanāhai āśīṣanaṃdī kā hālāṃki ṭhīka yahī bāta amerikī rāṣṭrapatiyoṃ ke sātha presa ke riśte ke bāre meṃ daśakoṃ se kahī jātī rahī hai, lekina deśa ke maujūdā pradhānamaṃtrī rājīva gāṃdhī para āśīṣanaṃdī kī yaha bāta isa māyane meṃ kahīṃ jyādā phiṭa isalie baiṭhatī hai ki na to itanā hairataaṃgeja āgamanaaura na mahāna grīka trāsadiyoṃ ke nāyaka jaisā itanā hairataaṃgeja patana pahale kisī pradhānamaṃtrī kā huā thā.
# translit_itrans = yaha kahanAhai AshIShanaMdI kA hAlAMki ThIka yahI bAta amerikI rAShTrapatiyoM ke sAtha presa ke rishte ke bAre meM dashakoM se kahI jAtI rahI hai, lekina desha ke maujUdA pradhAnamaMtrI rAjIva gAMdhI para AshIShanaMdI kI yaha bAta isa mAyane meM kahIM jyAdA phiTa isalie baiThatI hai ki na to itanA hairataaMgeja Agamanaaura na mahAna grIka trAsadiyoM ke nAyaka jaisA itanA hairataaMgeja patana pahale kisI pradhAnamaMtrI kA huA thA.
# translit_indicxlit = yeah kahanaahai ashishnandi kaa halanki theek yahee baat american rashtrapatiyon key saath press key rishte key baare mein dashakon say kahee jaati rahee hai, lekin desh key maujooda pradhaanmantri rajeev gandhi para ashishnandi key yeah baat iss mayane mein kahin zyada fit isaliye baithati hai kii naa too itna hairatangej aagamnaur naa mahaan greek traasdiyon key naayak jaisa itna hairatangej patan pehle kissy pradhaanmantri kaa hua tha.
# text_en = This is to say that while the same thing has been said for decades about the press's relationship with American presidents, the blessing of the country's current prime minister, Rajiv Gandhi, fits the bill better in the sense that neither such a stunning arrival nor such a stunning downfall of a hero of the great Greek tragedies had ever happened to a prime minister before.
