# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot19av.txt_P2_S6
# text = लेकिन ढाई साल बाद श्रीमती गांधी को जो राजनैतिक दुर्दिन देखने पड़े अलोकप्रियता और कलंक काल की जिन चुनौतियां से गुजरना पड़ा, राजीव गांधी तीन- बार पहले 1969 में सिंडीकेट के बुजुर्ग और ताकतवर नेताओं को हरा कर, दूसरी बार 1980 में जनता पार्टी को परास्त करके और बार 1980 में जनता पार्टी को परास्त करके और तीसरी बार 1984 में अपने सिख अंगरक्षकों की बंदूक से शहीद होकर - एक विजेता की तरह अपने दुर्दिन और संकट काल से उबरने में कामयाब रहीं.
# translit_iast = lekina ḍhāī sāla bāda śrīmatī gāṃdhī ko jo rājanaitika durdina dekhane par̤e alokapriyatā aura kalaṃka kāla kī jina cunautiyāṃ se gujaranā par̤ā, rājīva gāṃdhī tīna- bāra pahale 1969 meṃ siṃḍīkeṭa ke bujurga aura tākatavara netāoṃ ko harā kara, dūsarī bāra 1980 meṃ janatā pārṭī ko parāsta karake aura bāra 1980 meṃ janatā pārṭī ko parāsta karake aura tīsarī bāra 1984 meṃ apane sikha aṃgarakṣakoṃ kī baṃdūka se śahīda hokara - eka vijetā kī taraha apane durdina aura saṃkaṭa kāla se ubarane meṃ kāmayāba rahīṃ.
# translit_itrans = lekina DhAI sAla bAda shrImatI gAMdhI ko jo rAjanaitika durdina dekhane pa.De alokapriyatA aura kalaMka kAla kI jina chunautiyAM se gujaranA pa.DA, rAjIva gAMdhI tIna- bAra pahale 1969 meM siMDIkeTa ke bujurga aura tAkatavara netAoM ko harA kara, dUsarI bAra 1980 meM janatA pArTI ko parAsta karake aura bAra 1980 meM janatA pArTI ko parAsta karake aura tIsarI bAra 1984 meM apane sikha aMgarakShakoM kI baMdUka se shahIda hokara - eka vijetA kI taraha apane durdina aura saMkaTa kAla se ubarane meM kAmayAba rahIM.
# translit_indicxlit = lekin dhaaee saal baad shrimati gandhi coo zoo rajnaitik durdin dekhane padey alokpriyata aur kalank call key jinn chunautiyan say gujarna padaa, rajeev gandhi teen- baar pehle 1969 mein syndicate key bujurg aur taakatvar netaaon coo haraa cur, doosri baar 1980 mein janata party coo paraast karke aur baar 1980 mein janata party coo paraast karke aur teesari baar 1984 mein apane sikh angrakshakon key bandook say shaheed hocker - ack vijeta key tarah apane durdin aur sankat call say ubarane mein kamyab raheen.
# text_en = But two and a half years later, Mrs Gandhi had to face the challenges of unpopularity and the period of stigma that she had to face : Rajiv Gandhi managed to overcome her period of adversity and crisis like a victor, three times - first by defeating the old and powerful leaders of the Syndicate in 1969, second by defeating the Janata Party in 1980, and again by defeating the Janata Party in 1980, and third by being killed by the guns of her Sikh bodyguards in 1984.
