# text = फिर 1985 में 14 अगस्त की आधी रात असम गणपरिषद के नेता प्रफुल्ल कुमार महंत के साथ उन्होंने समझौते पर उसी तरह दस्तक किये जैसे 32 साल पहले 14 अगस्त 1947 में आधी रात के शून्य घंटे में उनके नाना पंडित जवाहर लाल नेहरू ने अंग्रेज वायसराय माउंटबेटन के साथ सत्ता के हस्तांतरण पर दस्तखत किये थे.
# translit_iast = phira 1985 meṃ 14 agasta kī ādhī rāta asama gaṇapariṣada ke netā praphulla kumāra mahaṃta ke sātha unhoṃne samajhaute para usī taraha dastaka kiye jaise 32 sāla pahale 14 agasta 1947 meṃ ādhī rāta ke śūnya ghaṃṭe meṃ unake nānā paṃḍita javāhara lāla neharū ne aṃgreja vāyasarāya māuṃṭabeṭana ke sātha sattā ke hastāṃtaraṇa para dastakhata kiye the.
# translit_itrans = phira 1985 meM 14 agasta kI AdhI rAta asama gaNapariShada ke netA praphulla kumAra mahaMta ke sAtha unhoMne samajhaute para usI taraha dastaka kiye jaise 32 sAla pahale 14 agasta 1947 meM AdhI rAta ke shUnya ghaMTe meM unake nAnA paMDita javAhara lAla neharU ne aMgreja vAyasarAya mAuMTabeTana ke sAtha sattA ke hastAMtaraNa para dastakhata kiye the.
# translit_indicxlit = fir 1985 mein 14 agast key aadhi raat assam ganparishad key neta prafulla kumar mahant key saath unhone samjhaute para usee tarah dastak kiye jaise 32 saal pehle 14 agast 1947 mein aadhi raat key shunya ghante mein unake nana pandit jawahar laal nehru nay angrez vaaysaraay mountbatten key saath satta key hastaantaran para dastakhat kiye they.
# text_en = Then, on the midnight of 14 August 1985, he struck a deal with Prafulla Kumar Mahanta, leader of the Asom Gana Parishad, just as his grandfather Pandit Jawaharlal Nehru had signed the transfer of power with British Viceroy Mountbatten 32 years earlier, on 14 August 1947, at the zero hour of midnight.
