# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot19av.txt_P2_S49
# text = तीसरी रणनीति जो जरा जोखिम भरी है लेकिन जिसके बारे में गंभीरता से सोचा जारहा है कि वह यह है कि किसी भी प्रधानमंत्री की छवि से पार्टी की छवि को अलग रखा जाए नेहरू के जमाने में कांग्रेस अध्यक्ष कामराज नाडार का भी यही मानना था कि और पिछले दिनों अर्जुन सिंह - कमलापति त्रिपाठी विवाद के दौरान बनारस के इस बूढे राजनैतिक पंडे ने भी यही बात दोहराई थी, बोफर्स कांड और राजीव गांधी की असली छवि या असली सूरत को जानता है.
# translit_iast = tīsarī raṇanīti jo jarā jokhima bharī hai lekina jisake bāre meṃ gaṃbhīratā se socā jārahā hai ki vaha yaha hai ki kisī bhī pradhānamaṃtrī kī chavi se pārṭī kī chavi ko alaga rakhā jāe neharū ke jamāne meṃ kāṃgresa adhyakṣa kāmarāja nāḍāra kā bhī yahī mānanā thā ki aura pichale dinoṃ arjuna siṃha - kamalāpati tripāṭhī vivāda ke daurāna banārasa ke isa būḍhe rājanaitika paṃḍe ne bhī yahī bāta doharāī thī, bopharsa kāṃḍa aura rājīva gāṃdhī kī asalī chavi yā asalī sūrata ko jānatā hai.
# translit_itrans = tIsarI raNanIti jo jarA jokhima bharI hai lekina jisake bAre meM gaMbhIratA se sochA jArahA hai ki vaha yaha hai ki kisI bhI pradhAnamaMtrI kI Chavi se pArTI kI Chavi ko alaga rakhA jAe neharU ke jamAne meM kAMgresa adhyakSha kAmarAja nADAra kA bhI yahI mAnanA thA ki aura piChale dinoM arjuna siMha - kamalApati tripAThI vivAda ke daurAna banArasa ke isa bUDhe rAjanaitika paMDe ne bhI yahI bAta doharAI thI, bopharsa kAMDa aura rAjIva gAMdhI kI asalI Chavi yA asalI sUrata ko jAnatA hai.
# translit_indicxlit = teesari ranneeti zoo zara jokhim bhari hai lekin jisake baare mein gambhirta say socha jaraha hai kii wah yeah hai kii kissy bhi pradhaanmantri key chhavi say party key chhavi coo alag rakhaa jaye nehru key jamaane mein congress adhyaksh kamraj nadar kaa bhi yahee manna tha kii aur pichhale dino arjun singh - kamalapati tripathi vivaad key dauran banaras key iss boodhe rajnaitik pandey nay bhi yahee baat dohrai thee, boffers kaand aur rajeev gandhi key asli chhavi yaa asli soorat coo janta hai.
# text_en = The third strategy, which is a little risky but is seriously thought of is to keep the party's image separate from that of any prime minister, something that Kamaraj Nadar, the Congress president in Nehru's time, also believed in and which the old political pundit from Benares repeated during the Arjun Singh-Kamalapati Tripathi controversy recently : Bofors scandal and Rajiv Gandhi's real image.
