# text = निश्चित ही मध्यावधि चुनाव कोई भी सांसद नहीं चाहता, इंकाई तो बिल्कुल भी नहीं, इसमें दुबारा न चुने जाने का ड़र तो है ही, जिंदगी भर 800 रुपये की पेंशन की उम्मीद से भी हाथ धो बैठने का खतरा है.
# translit_iast = niścita hī madhyāvadhi cunāva koī bhī sāṃsada nahīṃ cāhatā, iṃkāī to bilkula bhī nahīṃ, isameṃ dubārā na cune jāne kā r̤ara to hai hī, jiṃdagī bhara 800 rupaye kī peṃśana kī ummīda se bhī hātha dho baiṭhane kā khatarā hai.
# translit_itrans = nishchita hI madhyAvadhi chunAva koI bhI sAMsada nahIM chAhatA, iMkAI to bilkula bhI nahIM, isameM dubArA na chune jAne kA .Dara to hai hI, jiMdagI bhara 800 rupaye kI peMshana kI ummIda se bhI hAtha dho baiThane kA khatarA hai.
# translit_indicxlit = nishchit hee madhyaavadhi chunaav koi bhi saansad nahin chaahata, inkai too bilkul bhi nahin, isamen dubara naa chune jaane kaa darr too hai hee, jindagi bhar 800 rupaye key pension key ummid say bhi haath dho baithane kaa khatra hai.
# text_en = Of course, no MP wants a mid-term poll, and there is no danger of not being re-elected, and the hope of a lifetime pension of Rs 800 is also in danger of being lost.
