# translit_indicxlit = usa avsar para thodi dair upasthit rahane key lie usane badey bhaiya say jab anurodh kiya, tab unhone yahee jawab diya, raadhe, yeah sir ab dinn-raat khuda key saamane jhukane kaa aadee how gaya hai, ab mujhe iss janjal mein mutt fansaao.
