# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ah_P2_S57
# text = यह तुम्हारी सचाई है कि दरिंदे जब कानून को लात मारकर अधर्म करते हैं, सांप्रदायिकता फैलाते हैं, अपने-अपने मजहब के लिए एक दूसरे का खून कर देते हैं तो इसे तुम उसी नागदंत पर टांग देते हो, यानी कलियुग पर. क्या अपने को जनता का सेवक कहलाने वाले जब नीच से नीच बर्बर हिंसा का समर्थन करते हैं, तब तुम उनकी तानाशाही को छिपाने के लिये धर्मनिरपेक्षता का नकाब लगाते हो.
# translit_iast = yaha tumhārī sacāī hai ki dariṃde jaba kānūna ko lāta mārakara adharma karate haiṃ, sāṃpradāyikatā phailāte haiṃ, apane-apane majahaba ke lie eka dūsare kā khūna kara dete haiṃ to ise tuma usī nāgadaṃta para ṭāṃga dete ho, yānī kaliyuga para. kyā apane ko janatā kā sevaka kahalāne vāle jaba nīca se nīca barbara hiṃsā kā samarthana karate haiṃ, taba tuma unakī tānāśāhī ko chipāne ke liye dharmanirapekṣatā kā nakāba lagāte ho.
# translit_itrans = yaha tumhArI sachAI hai ki dariMde jaba kAnUna ko lAta mArakara adharma karate haiM, sAMpradAyikatA phailAte haiM, apane-apane majahaba ke lie eka dUsare kA khUna kara dete haiM to ise tuma usI nAgadaMta para TAMga dete ho, yAnI kaliyuga para. kyA apane ko janatA kA sevaka kahalAne vAle jaba nIcha se nIcha barbara hiMsA kA samarthana karate haiM, taba tuma unakI tAnAshAhI ko ChipAne ke liye dharmanirapekShatA kA nakAba lagAte ho.
# translit_indicxlit = yeah tumhari sachaai hai kii darinde jab kanoon coo laat marker adharma karate hain, sampradayikta failaate hain, apane-apane majhab key lie ack dusare kaa khoon cur dete hain too ise tum usee nagdant para tang dete how, yaani kaliyug para. kya apane coo janata kaa sevak kahalaane waale jab neech say neech barber hinsa kaa samarthan karate hain, tab tum unaki tanashahi coo chhipaane key liye dharmnirpekshata kaa nakaab lagaate how.
# text_en = It is your truth that when the beasts kick the law and commit iniquity, when they spread sectarianism, when they shed blood for their religion, you hang it on that serpent, that is, on Kali Yuga. When those who call themselves servants of the people support the worst barbaric violence, you put on the mask of secularism to hide their dictatorship.
