# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ah_P2_S80
# text = नतीजा हुआ कि हर पुराण के अंत में चाहे वह सतयुग हो, त्रेस्ता हो, द्वापर हो, मुझ गरीब के सिर पर गुनाहों का इतना बोझ लाद दिया है कि उनके अनुसरण करने वाले यत्किंचित् बुद्धि का भी प्रयोग न करके सारे दगैर्धित चोलों, चादरों, पसीने से भीगी बनियानों और स्नान से शुद्ध होकर अपवित्र वस्त्रों को कलि की खूंटी पर लटकाते जा रहे हैं.
# translit_iast = natījā huā ki hara purāṇa ke aṃta meṃ cāhe vaha satayuga ho, trestā ho, dvāpara ho, mujha garība ke sira para gunāhoṃ kā itanā bojha lāda diyā hai ki unake anusaraṇa karane vāle yatkiṃcit buddhi kā bhī prayoga na karake sāre dagairdhita coloṃ, cādaroṃ, pasīne se bhīgī baniyānoṃ aura snāna se śuddha hokara apavitra vastroṃ ko kali kī khūṃṭī para laṭakāte jā rahe haiṃ.
# translit_itrans = natIjA huA ki hara purANa ke aMta meM chAhe vaha satayuga ho, trestA ho, dvApara ho, mujha garIba ke sira para gunAhoM kA itanA bojha lAda diyA hai ki unake anusaraNa karane vAle yatkiMchit buddhi kA bhI prayoga na karake sAre dagairdhita choloM, chAdaroM, pasIne se bhIgI baniyAnoM aura snAna se shuddha hokara apavitra vastroM ko kali kI khUMTI para laTakAte jA rahe haiM.
# translit_indicxlit = natija hua kii hear puran key ant mein chaahe wah satyug how, tresta how, dwapar how, mujh garib key sir para gunaahon kaa itna bojh laud diya hai kii unake anusaran karane waale yatkinchit buddhi kaa bhi prayog naa karke saare dagairdhit cholon, chadaron, paseene say bheegi baniyaanon aur snan say shuddh hocker apavitra vastron coo kali key khoonti para latakaate jaa rahe hain.
# text_en = The result is that at the end of every Purana, be it Satyuga, Tresta, Dvapara, I have so heavily burdened the poor man's head with sins that his followers, without the slightest application of their intellect, are going about hanging all the soiled cholas, the sheets, the sweat-soaked vestments, and the impure clothes, purified by bathing, on the pegs of the Kali.
