# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ah_P2_S114
# text = बताओ दोनों का अतर. बोलो परीक्षित. मैं नैमित्तिक की बात करुंगा तो तुम दोनों मेरा उपहास करोगे क्योंकि नैमित्तिक के लिए ईश्वर की इच्छा को, लीला को, आधार बताया है व्यास देव ने. व्यास देव को कटु सत्य की अनुभूति थी, वे जानते थे कि ईश्वर को आधार मानकर जीने वालों को उस वक्त बड़ी निराशा होगी जब उन्हें पता चलेगा कि मानव विनाश का कारण ईश्वर नहीं लोलुप, तानाशाह, युद्धों के सौदागर और हथियारों को बेच कर अतुलनीय धन लुटने वाले उनके सहोदर ही हैं.
# translit_iast = batāo donoṃ kā atara. bolo parīkṣita. maiṃ naimittika kī bāta karuṃgā to tuma donoṃ merā upahāsa karoge kyoṃki naimittika ke lie īśvara kī icchā ko, līlā ko, ādhāra batāyā hai vyāsa deva ne. vyāsa deva ko kaṭu satya kī anubhūti thī, ve jānate the ki īśvara ko ādhāra mānakara jīne vāloṃ ko usa vakta bar̤ī nirāśā hogī jaba unheṃ patā calegā ki mānava vināśa kā kāraṇa īśvara nahīṃ lolupa, tānāśāha, yuddhoṃ ke saudāgara aura hathiyāroṃ ko beca kara atulanīya dhana luṭane vāle unake sahodara hī haiṃ.
# translit_itrans = batAo donoM kA atara. bolo parIkShita. maiM naimittika kI bAta karuMgA to tuma donoM merA upahAsa karoge kyoMki naimittika ke lie Ishvara kI ichChA ko, lIlA ko, AdhAra batAyA hai vyAsa deva ne. vyAsa deva ko kaTu satya kI anubhUti thI, ve jAnate the ki Ishvara ko AdhAra mAnakara jIne vAloM ko usa vakta ba.DI nirAshA hogI jaba unheM patA chalegA ki mAnava vinAsha kA kAraNa Ishvara nahIM lolupa, tAnAshAha, yuddhoM ke saudAgara aura hathiyAroM ko becha kara atulanIya dhana luTane vAle unake sahodara hI haiM.
# translit_indicxlit = bataao dono kaa attar. bolo pareekshit. main naimittik key baat karunga too tum dono mera upahaas karoge kyonki naimittik key lie ishwar key ichcha coo, leela coo, aadhar bataaya hai vyaas dew nay. vyaas dew coo katu satya key anubhooti thee, way jaanate they kii ishwar coo aadhar mankar jeene vaalon coo usa vakt badee nirasha hogi jab unhein patta chalega kii maanav vinash kaa kaaran ishwar nahin lolup, tanashah, yuddhon key saudagar aur hathiyaron coo bech cur atulaniya dhan lutane waale unake sahodar hee hain.
# text_en = Tell me both of them. Speak up, Parikshit. If I speak of Naimikit, you will both ridicule me, because I have cited Leela as the basis of God's will for Naimikit. Vyas Dev knew that those who live by God as the basis of bitter truth will be greatly disappointed when they learn that God is not the cause of human destruction.
