# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ah_P2_S117
# text = यह है नैमित्तिक. ले दे कर तुम्हारे पिता के मातुल ही अवतार माने जायेंगे क्योंकि तुम्हारे पितामह से कहा था-- मयैवैते निहता: पूर्वमेव निमित्तमात्रं भव सव्यसाचिन. तेरे पितामह युद्ध न चाहते हुए भी, उनके आदेश पर युद्ध में शामिल हुए और पार्थसारथी कुरुक्षेत्र के प्रथम विश्वयुद्ध में संहारकर्ता की भूमिका में उतरे.
# translit_iast = yaha hai naimittika. le de kara tumhāre pitā ke mātula hī avatāra māne jāyeṃge kyoṃki tumhāre pitāmaha se kahā thā-- mayaivaite nihatā: pūrvameva nimittamātraṃ bhava savyasācina. tere pitāmaha yuddha na cāhate hue bhī, unake ādeśa para yuddha meṃ śāmila hue aura pārthasārathī kurukṣetra ke prathama viśvayuddha meṃ saṃhārakartā kī bhūmikā meṃ utare.
# translit_itrans = yaha hai naimittika. le de kara tumhAre pitA ke mAtula hI avatAra mAne jAyeMge kyoMki tumhAre pitAmaha se kahA thA-- mayaivaite nihatA: pUrvameva nimittamAtraM bhava savyasAchina. tere pitAmaha yuddha na chAhate hue bhI, unake Adesha para yuddha meM shAmila hue aura pArthasArathI kurukShetra ke prathama vishvayuddha meM saMhArakartA kI bhUmikA meM utare.
# translit_indicxlit = yeah hai naimittik. lay dei cur tumhare pita key matul hee avatar maane jayenge kyonki tumhare pitamah say kahaa tha-- mayaivaite nihata: purvamev nimittamaatram bhava savyasachin. there pitamah yuddh naa chahte hue bhi, unake aadesh para yuddh mein shamil hue aur parthsarthi kurukshetra key pratham vishvayuddh mein samharkarta key bhoomika mein utare.
# text_en = This is Naimitika. in turn, your father's uncle will be considered as an incarnation because your grandfather was told---Maiyavaithe Nihata : Purvameva Nimitamatt Bhava Savyasachin. Your grandfather joined the war on his orders even though he did not want war and Parthasarathy landed in the role of a destroyer in the First World War of Kurukshetra.
