# text = यानी एक तो भौतिक पत्नी होती है दैनदिन कार्यों के बीच पति को प्यारी लगने वाली पत्नी होती है पर दूसरी भी होती है जो प्राणों से भी अधिक प्रिय लगने वाली अपनी अंतरंग सखी. कृष्णा का रुदन देख कर वे गंभीर हो गये.
# translit_iast = yānī eka to bhautika patnī hotī hai dainadina kāryoṃ ke bīca pati ko pyārī lagane vālī patnī hotī hai para dūsarī bhī hotī hai jo prāṇoṃ se bhī adhika priya lagane vālī apanī aṃtaraṃga sakhī. kṛṣṇā kā rudana dekha kara ve gaṃbhīra ho gaye.
# translit_itrans = yAnI eka to bhautika patnI hotI hai dainadina kAryoM ke bIcha pati ko pyArI lagane vAlI patnI hotI hai para dUsarI bhI hotI hai jo prANoM se bhI adhika priya lagane vAlI apanI aMtaraMga sakhI. kRRiShNA kA rudana dekha kara ve gaMbhIra ho gaye.
# translit_indicxlit = yaani ack too bhautik patni hoti hai daindin karyon key beach pati coo pyaari lagane waali patni hoti hai para doosri bhi hoti hai zoo praanon say bhi adhik priya lagane waali apni antarang sakhi. krishna kaa rudan dekh cur way gambhir how gaye.
# text_en = That is, one is the material wife, the wife who is dear to the husband in the midst of daily chores, but there is also the other who is the intimate friend who is dearer than life.
