# translit_itrans = bAdake adhyAyoM meM pAnIpatakI tIsarI la.DAI, usakI pRRiShTha-bhUmi, sUrajamalakA marAThA kaimpa meM AnA aura phira bhAU sAhaba ke vyavahAra, uddhata AcharaNa aura mUrkhatAke kAraNa usake alaga hone kA vivaraNa dekhakara bhAgate marAThoM ke prati jAToMkI sadAshayatAkA vivechana kiyA gayAhai|
# translit_indicxlit = baadke adhyaayon mein panipataki teesari ladaai, usaki prishth-bhoomi, surajmalka maratha camp mein aana aur fir bhaau sahab key vyavhaar, uddhat aacharan aur moorkhtaake kaaran usake alag honey kaa vivaran dekhkar bhaagate marathon key prati jatonki sadashaytaka vivechan kiya gayaahai.
