# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ay_P2_S160
# text = किन्तु 1917 की अमृतसर के होते हुए भी मैं सहयोग और माण्टेगू चेम्सफोर्ड सुधार को काम में लाने के पक्ष में लड़ा, इस आशा से कि ब्रिटिश प्रधानमंत्री हिन्दुस्तान के मुसलमानों को दिया हुआ वचन पूरा करेंगे, पंजाब के घावों पर मलहम लगेगा और सुधार यद्यपि अपूर्ण और असन्तोषजनक है, तो हिन्दुस्तान के जीवन में आशा के नवीन युग के चिन्ह-स्वरुप होंगे ।
# translit_iast = kintu 1917 kī amṛtasara ke hote hue bhī maiṃ sahayoga aura māṇṭegū cemsaphorḍa sudhāra ko kāma meṃ lāne ke pakṣa meṃ lar̤ā, isa āśā se ki briṭiśa pradhānamaṃtrī hindustāna ke musalamānoṃ ko diyā huā vacana pūrā kareṃge, paṃjāba ke ghāvoṃ para malahama lagegā aura sudhāra yadyapi apūrṇa aura asantoṣajanaka hai, to hindustāna ke jīvana meṃ āśā ke navīna yuga ke cinha-svarupa hoṃge |
# translit_itrans = kintu 1917 kI amRRitasara ke hote hue bhI maiM sahayoga aura mANTegU chemsaphorDa sudhAra ko kAma meM lAne ke pakSha meM la.DA, isa AshA se ki briTisha pradhAnamaMtrI hindustAna ke musalamAnoM ko diyA huA vachana pUrA kareMge, paMjAba ke ghAvoM para malahama lagegA aura sudhAra yadyapi apUrNa aura asantoShajanaka hai, to hindustAna ke jIvana meM AshA ke navIna yuga ke chinha-svarupa hoMge |
# translit_indicxlit = kintu 1917 key amritsar key hote hue bhi main sahyog aur mantegu chamesford sudhaar coo kaam mein lane key paksh mein ladaa, iss aashaa say kii british pradhaanmantri hindustan key musalmaanon coo diya hua vachan pura karenge, punjab key ghaavon para malham lagega aur sudhaar yadyapi apoorna aur asantoshjanak hai, too hindustan key jeevan mein aashaa key naveen yug key chinh-swarup honge .
# text_en = But despite the Amritsar of 1917, I fought for cooperation and the implementation of the Montagu Chelmsford Reforms, hoping that the British Prime Minister would fulfil his promise to the Muslims of India ; that the wounds of Punjab would be healed ; and that the Reforms, though incomplete and unsatisfactory, would mark a new era of hope in the life of India.
