# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot19q.txt_P1_S21
# text = इसके मुख्य कारण थे इस बल का दुरुपयोग और अति उपयोग, जवानों के प्रशिक्षण तथा अधिकारियों द्वारा नियंत्रण के मामलों में उनकी समस्याओं पर ध्यान न दिया जाना और सरकारी कर्मचारियों द्वारा हड़ताल तथा हिंसा किए जाने पर उनके विरुद्ध किसी प्रकार की अनुशासनात्मक कार्रवाई किए बिना उनकी सेवा-शर्तों तथा स्थितियों में सुधार होने से पी. ए. सी. पर पड़ा प्रभाव।22 मई 1973 को केन्द्र ने इस झूठी सूचना पर कि पी. ए. सी. ने लखनऊ विश्वविद्यालय के भवन में आग लगा दी है, सेना को पी. ए. सी. के हथियार छीनने के लिए भेज दिया।
# translit_iast = isake mukhya kāraṇa the isa bala kā durupayoga aura ati upayoga, javānoṃ ke praśikṣaṇa tathā adhikāriyoṃ dvārā niyaṃtraṇa ke māmaloṃ meṃ unakī samasyāoṃ para dhyāna na diyā jānā aura sarakārī karmacāriyoṃ dvārā har̤atāla tathā hiṃsā kie jāne para unake viruddha kisī prakāra kī anuśāsanātmaka kārravāī kie binā unakī sevā-śartoṃ tathā sthitiyoṃ meṃ sudhāra hone se pī. e. sī. para par̤ā prabhāva|22 maī 1973 ko kendra ne isa jhūṭhī sūcanā para ki pī. e. sī. ne lakhanaū viśvavidyālaya ke bhavana meṃ āga lagā dī hai, senā ko pī. e. sī. ke hathiyāra chīnane ke lie bheja diyā|
# translit_itrans = isake mukhya kAraNa the isa bala kA durupayoga aura ati upayoga, javAnoM ke prashikShaNa tathA adhikAriyoM dvArA niyaMtraNa ke mAmaloM meM unakI samasyAoM para dhyAna na diyA jAnA aura sarakArI karmachAriyoM dvArA ha.DatAla tathA hiMsA kie jAne para unake viruddha kisI prakAra kI anushAsanAtmaka kArravAI kie binA unakI sevA-shartoM tathA sthitiyoM meM sudhAra hone se pI. e. sI. para pa.DA prabhAva|22 maI 1973 ko kendra ne isa jhUThI sUchanA para ki pI. e. sI. ne lakhanaU vishvavidyAlaya ke bhavana meM Aga lagA dI hai, senA ko pI. e. sI. ke hathiyAra ChInane ke lie bheja diyA|
# translit_indicxlit = isake mukhya kaaran they iss ball kaa durupyog aur ati upayog, javaanon key prashikshan tathaa adhikaariyon dwara niyantran key mamalon mein unaki samasyaon para dhyan naa diya jaanaa aur sarkari karmchaariyon dwara hadtaal tathaa hinsa kiye jaane para unake viruddh kissy prakaar key anushasanatmak kaarravaai kiye binaa unaki seva-sharton tathaa sthitiyon mein sudhaar honey say pie. ae. see. para padaa prabhaav.22 maee 1973 coo kendra nay iss jhoothi soochana para kii pie. ae. see. nay lakhanau vishvavidyalaya key bhawan mein aug lagaa dee hai, sena coo pie. ae. see. key hathiyar chheenane key lie bheja diya.
# text_en = The main reasons were the misuse and overuse of this force, the lack of attention to the training of jawans and their problems in matters of control by officers, and the impact on the PAC of the improvement of their conditions of service without any disciplinary action against them when government employees went on strike and resorted to violence. On 22 May 1973, the Centre sent the army to seize the weapons of the PAC on the false information that the PAC had set fire to the Lucknow University building.
