# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ai1_P2_S20
# text = उनकी फिल्म के मुहूर्त शाट का निर्देशन करने के लिए अमिताभ बच्चन राजी हो गये, यह बहुत बड़ी बात थी, क्योंकि आज तक अमिताभ पर जब जब `शराबी या `मर्द के निर्देशन में टांग अड़ाने की अफवाहें उड़ती थीं, वे यही सफाई दे कर साफ बच निकलते थे कि मैं तो अभिनेता हूं, निर्देशन से मेरा क्या वास्ता?
# translit_iast = unakī philma ke muhūrta śāṭa kā nirdeśana karane ke lie amitābha baccana rājī ho gaye, yaha bahuta bar̤ī bāta thī, kyoṃki āja taka amitābha para jaba jaba `śarābī yā `marda ke nirdeśana meṃ ṭāṃga ar̤āne kī aphavāheṃ ur̤atī thīṃ, ve yahī saphāī de kara sāpha baca nikalate the ki maiṃ to abhinetā hūṃ, nirdeśana se merā kyā vāstā?
# translit_itrans = unakI philma ke muhUrta shATa kA nirdeshana karane ke lie amitAbha bachchana rAjI ho gaye, yaha bahuta ba.DI bAta thI, kyoMki Aja taka amitAbha para jaba jaba `sharAbI yA `marda ke nirdeshana meM TAMga a.DAne kI aphavAheM u.DatI thIM, ve yahI saphAI de kara sApha bacha nikalate the ki maiM to abhinetA hUM, nirdeshana se merA kyA vAstA?
# translit_indicxlit = unaki film key muhurat shaat kaa nirdeshan karane key lie amitabh bachchan raaji how gaye, yeah bahut badee baat thee, kyonki aaj tuck amitabh para jab jab `sharabi yaa `mard key nirdeshan mein tang adaane key afavaahen udatee thee, way yahee safai dei cur saaf batch nikalate they kii main too abhineta hoon, nirdeshan say mera kya vaasta?
# text_en = Amitabh Bachchan agreed to direct the muhurat shot of his film and it was a big deal because till today, whenever there were rumours of Amitabh stepping into the direction of Jagdishrabi or Jagmard, he would just walk away with the clarification that I am an actor and what is my connection with direction.
