# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ai1_P2_S21
# text = मुहूर्त शाट में किरणकुमार, चंकी पांडे, अनिल कपूर अनुपम खेर, माधुरी दीक्षित और फिर अनिल कपूर की लंबी डायलागबाजी हुई, अंधेरा हुआ, ओवरब्रिज पर रेल के गुजरने की आवाज उभरी, रोशनी हुई, तालियां बजीं और एन. एन. सिप्पी से ले कर गुलजार तक तमाम फिल्मी लोग शहद की मक्खी की तरह अमिताभ बच्चन की तरफ इर्द गिर्द घूने लगे - निर्देशक बनने और कमाल का निर्देशन देने की बधाई गाने के लिए !
# translit_iast = muhūrta śāṭa meṃ kiraṇakumāra, caṃkī pāṃḍe, anila kapūra anupama khera, mādhurī dīkṣita aura phira anila kapūra kī laṃbī ḍāyalāgabājī huī, aṃdherā huā, ovarabrija para rela ke gujarane kī āvāja ubharī, rośanī huī, tāliyāṃ bajīṃ aura ena. ena. sippī se le kara gulajāra taka tamāma philmī loga śahada kī makkhī kī taraha amitābha baccana kī tarapha irda girda ghūne lage - nirdeśaka banane aura kamāla kā nirdeśana dene kī badhāī gāne ke lie !
# translit_itrans = muhUrta shATa meM kiraNakumAra, chaMkI pAMDe, anila kapUra anupama khera, mAdhurI dIkShita aura phira anila kapUra kI laMbI DAyalAgabAjI huI, aMdherA huA, ovarabrija para rela ke gujarane kI AvAja ubharI, roshanI huI, tAliyAM bajIM aura ena. ena. sippI se le kara gulajAra taka tamAma philmI loga shahada kI makkhI kI taraha amitAbha bachchana kI tarapha irda girda ghUne lage - nirdeshaka banane aura kamAla kA nirdeshana dene kI badhAI gAne ke lie !
# translit_indicxlit = muhurat shaat mein kirankumar, chunky pandey, anil kapoor anupam khair, madhuri deekshit aur fir anil kapoor key lambi dialogbazi hui, andhera hua, overbridge para rail key gujarane key aavaaj ubhari, roshni hui, taaliyan bajin aur ain. ain. sippy say lay cur gulzar tuck tamaam filmy log shahad key makkhi key tarah amitabh bachchan key taraf ird gird ghoone lagey - nirdeshak banane aur kamal kaa nirdeshan dene key badhaai gaane key lie !
# text_en = The muhurat shot had Kirankumar, Chunky Pandey, Anil Kapoor, Anupam Kher, Madhuri Dixit and then Anil Kapoor's long dialogue delivery, it was dark, the sound of the train passing on the overbridge was bright, the lights were on, the applause was deafening and all the film people from N. N. Sippy to Gulzar started to sing congratulations to Amitabh Bachchan like a honey bee - for being a director and giving a wonderful direction!
