# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ai1_P2_S22
# text = उस दिन फिल्मालय स्टूडियो में `जो होगा देखा जायेगा का मुहूर्त शाट देने के लिए अनीता राज आ खड़ी हुई और निर्देशक के. पप्पू ने धर्मेंद्र के हाथ में क्लैप थमा दिया, मगर धर्मेंद्र ने इधर उधर देखते हुए पूछा, निर्माता किधर है इस फिल्म का?
# translit_iast = usa dina philmālaya sṭūḍiyo meṃ `jo hogā dekhā jāyegā kā muhūrta śāṭa dene ke lie anītā rāja ā khar̤ī huī aura nirdeśaka ke. pappū ne dharmeṃdra ke hātha meṃ klaipa thamā diyā, magara dharmeṃdra ne idhara udhara dekhate hue pūchā, nirmātā kidhara hai isa philma kā?
# translit_itrans = usa dina philmAlaya sTUDiyo meM `jo hogA dekhA jAyegA kA muhUrta shATa dene ke lie anItA rAja A kha.DI huI aura nirdeshaka ke. pappU ne dharmeMdra ke hAtha meM klaipa thamA diyA, magara dharmeMdra ne idhara udhara dekhate hue pUChA, nirmAtA kidhara hai isa philma kA?
# translit_indicxlit = usa dinn filmalaya studio mein `zoo hoga dekhaa jayega kaa muhurat shaat dene key lie aneeta raja aa khadi hui aur nirdeshak key. pappu nay dharmendra key haath mein clap thamaa diya, mugger dharmendra nay idhar udhar dekhate hue poochha, nirmaata kidhar hai iss film kaa?
# text_en = That day, Anita Raj came to give the muhurat shot of'Jogjo Hoga Dekha Jayega'in Filmalaya Studios and director K. Pappu gave clap to Dharmendra's hand. But Dharmendra looked around and asked,'Where is the producer of this film? '
