# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ai1_P2_S43
# text = इतनी फिल्मों में हीरो का मान मिल गया, फिर भी बचपना नहीं गया अब तक. . . बड़ी सी मूंछ, तेल से चुपड़े हुए बाल, ढीली सी धोती, कुरता, नेता कट बंड़ी और पहलवान छाप गमछा-- ये थे भोजपुरी मिश्रित हिंदी के लच्छेदार संवादों के साथ बिहारी अखाड़े के दांव दिखावे शत्रुघ्न सिन्हा.
# translit_iast = itanī philmoṃ meṃ hīro kā māna mila gayā, phira bhī bacapanā nahīṃ gayā aba taka. . . bar̤ī sī mūṃcha, tela se cupar̤e hue bāla, ḍhīlī sī dhotī, kuratā, netā kaṭa baṃr̤ī aura pahalavāna chāpa gamachā-- ye the bhojapurī miśrita hiṃdī ke lacchedāra saṃvādoṃ ke sātha bihārī akhār̤e ke dāṃva dikhāve śatrughna sinhā.
# translit_itrans = itanI philmoM meM hIro kA mAna mila gayA, phira bhI bachapanA nahIM gayA aba taka. . . ba.DI sI mUMCha, tela se chupa.De hue bAla, DhIlI sI dhotI, kuratA, netA kaTa baM.DI aura pahalavAna ChApa gamaChA-- ye the bhojapurI mishrita hiMdI ke lachChedAra saMvAdoM ke sAtha bihArI akhA.De ke dAMva dikhAve shatrughna sinhA.
# translit_indicxlit = itani films mein hiro kaa maan mill gaya, fir bhi bachpana nahin gaya ab tuck. . . badee see moonchh, tell say chupade hue ball, dheeli see dhoti, kurta, neta cut bandi aur pehalwan chaap gamcha-- yeye they bhojpuri mishrit hindi key lachhedaar samvaadon key saath bihaari akhaade key daanv dikhaave shatrughan sinha.
# text_en = So many films were made in the name of hero, yet childhood was not lost till now... big moustache, oil-coated hair, loose dhoti, kurta, neta, cut bandi and pehalwan, chhap gamcha... these were the Bhojpuri mixed Hindi with loose dialogues and the Bihari Akhada's playing style of Shatrughan Sinha.
