# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ai1_P2_S61
# text = डिंपल कापड़िया, किरण ठाकुर खेर, दिव्या राणा, अंजू महेंद्रू, सोनी राजदान आदि. तालियों से उनका उत्साह बढ़ा रहे थे डैनी, अनुपम खेर, सुरेश ओबेराय, जरीना बहाव, विनोद खन्न, जैकी श्राफ, महेश भट्ट आदि. कभी `झूठ बोले कौवा काटे हवा में गूंजता तो कभी `मेरे पैरों मे घुंघरु बंधा दे और कभी `खईके पान बनारस वाला.
# translit_iast = ḍiṃpala kāpar̤iyā, kiraṇa ṭhākura khera, divyā rāṇā, aṃjū maheṃdrū, sonī rājadāna ādi. tāliyoṃ se unakā utsāha bar̤hā rahe the ḍainī, anupama khera, sureśa oberāya, jarīnā bahāva, vinoda khanna, jaikī śrāpha, maheśa bhaṭṭa ādi. kabhī `jhūṭha bole kauvā kāṭe havā meṃ gūṃjatā to kabhī `mere pairoṃ me ghuṃgharu baṃdhā de aura kabhī `khaīke pāna banārasa vālā.
# translit_itrans = DiMpala kApa.DiyA, kiraNa ThAkura khera, divyA rANA, aMjU maheMdrU, sonI rAjadAna Adi. tAliyoM se unakA utsAha ba.DhA rahe the DainI, anupama khera, suresha oberAya, jarInA bahAva, vinoda khanna, jaikI shrApha, mahesha bhaTTa Adi. kabhI `jhUTha bole kauvA kATe havA meM gUMjatA to kabhI `mere pairoM me ghuMgharu baMdhA de aura kabhI `khaIke pAna banArasa vAlA.
# translit_indicxlit = dimple kapadiya, kiran thakur khair, divya raanaa, anju mahendru, soney rajdan aadi. taaliyon say unakaa utsaah badha rahe they danny, anupam khair, suresh oberai, jarina bhaav, vinod khanna, jackie shroff, mahesh bhatt aadi. kabhi `jhooth bole kauva kaate hawa mein goonjata too kabhi `mere pairon may ghunghru bandha dei aur kabhi `khaeeke paan banaras walla.
# text_en = Dimple Kapadia, Kirron Thakur Kher, Divya Rana, Anju Mahendru, Soni Razdan, etc., cheered them on with applause. Danny, Anupam Kher, Suresh Oberoi, Zarina Wahab, Vinod Khanna, Jackie Shroff, Mahesh Bhatt, etc.
