# text = मुहूर्त का क्लैप देने की रस्म गोविंदा के भाई कीर्ति के जिम्मे सौंपी गयी और वे शर्म से लाल हो उठ, इन लोगों ने अच्छा फंसाया. . . अभी मेरी हस्ती ही क्या है कि मुहूर्त क्लैप दूं. . . पीछे से चिड़िया हमारे पैर में चोंच मार कर कहने लगी, यही तो फायदा होता है हीरो हीरोइन का भाई होने का.
# translit_iast = muhūrta kā klaipa dene kī rasma goviṃdā ke bhāī kīrti ke jimme sauṃpī gayī aura ve śarma se lāla ho uṭha, ina logoṃ ne acchā phaṃsāyā. . . abhī merī hastī hī kyā hai ki muhūrta klaipa dūṃ. . . pīche se cir̤iyā hamāre paira meṃ coṃca māra kara kahane lagī, yahī to phāyadā hotā hai hīro hīroina kā bhāī hone kā.
# translit_itrans = muhUrta kA klaipa dene kI rasma goviMdA ke bhAI kIrti ke jimme sauMpI gayI aura ve sharma se lAla ho uTha, ina logoM ne achChA phaMsAyA. . . abhI merI hastI hI kyA hai ki muhUrta klaipa dUM. . . pIChe se chi.DiyA hamAre paira meM choMcha mAra kara kahane lagI, yahI to phAyadA hotA hai hIro hIroina kA bhAI hone kA.
# translit_indicxlit = muhurat kaa clap dene key rasm govinda key bhaai keerti key jimme saunpi gayee aur way sherm say laal how uthh, inn logon nay achcha fansaaya. . . abhi merry hasti hee kya hai kii muhurat clap doon. . . peechhe say chidiya hamare pair mein chonch maar cur kahane luggy, yahee too fayda hota hai hiro heroine kaa bhaai honey kaa.
# text_en = The muhurat clap ceremony was assigned to Govinda's brother Kirti and they blushed. These people trapped me well... what is my identity now... the bird pecked at our feet from behind and said... this is the benefit of being the brother of the hero-heroine.
