# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ai1_P2_S88
# text = हमें बड़ा अचरज हुआ इस बात से क्योंकि `शिवा शक्ति के निर्माता निर्देशक आनंद ने ही पहली बार अपने भांजे गोविंदा को हीरो का चांस दिया था `तन बदन में और तब उस फिल्म की जो पार्टी मोहन स्टूडियो में आयोजित की गयी थी उसमें मामा और भांजा दोनों की शाम छह बजे से ही पत्रकारों की अगवानी के लिए गेट पर खड़े दिखाई पड़े थे. . . और आज `शिवा शक्ति की पार्टी में उसी भांजे की प्रतीक्षा आनंद को करनी पड़ रही थी.
# translit_iast = hameṃ bar̤ā acaraja huā isa bāta se kyoṃki `śivā śakti ke nirmātā nirdeśaka ānaṃda ne hī pahalī bāra apane bhāṃje goviṃdā ko hīro kā cāṃsa diyā thā `tana badana meṃ aura taba usa philma kī jo pārṭī mohana sṭūḍiyo meṃ āyojita kī gayī thī usameṃ māmā aura bhāṃjā donoṃ kī śāma chaha baje se hī patrakāroṃ kī agavānī ke lie geṭa para khar̤e dikhāī par̤e the. . . aura āja `śivā śakti kī pārṭī meṃ usī bhāṃje kī pratīkṣā ānaṃda ko karanī par̤a rahī thī.
# translit_itrans = hameM ba.DA acharaja huA isa bAta se kyoMki `shivA shakti ke nirmAtA nirdeshaka AnaMda ne hI pahalI bAra apane bhAMje goviMdA ko hIro kA chAMsa diyA thA `tana badana meM aura taba usa philma kI jo pArTI mohana sTUDiyo meM Ayojita kI gayI thI usameM mAmA aura bhAMjA donoM kI shAma Chaha baje se hI patrakAroM kI agavAnI ke lie geTa para kha.De dikhAI pa.De the. . . aura Aja `shivA shakti kI pArTI meM usI bhAMje kI pratIkShA AnaMda ko karanI pa.Da rahI thI.
# translit_indicxlit = hamein badha acharaj hua iss baat say kyonki `shiva shakti key nirmaata nirdeshak anand nay hee pahali baar apane bhanje govinda coo hiro kaa chance diya tha `than badan mein aur tab usa film key zoo party mohan studio mein aayojit key gayee thee usamen mama aur bhanja dono key sham chhah baje say hee patrakaron key agwani key lie get para khade dikhai padey they. . . aur aaj `shiva shakti key party mein usee bhanje key prateeksha anand coo karni parh rahee thee.
# text_en = We were surprised because it was director Anand, the producer of Jagdishiva Shakti, who first offered his nephew Govinda the chance to be the hero in Jagathan Badan and then at the party that was held at Mohan Studios for that film, both Mama and Bhanja were seen standing at the gate to receive the journalists from 6 pm... and today at Jagdishiva Shakti's party, Anand had to wait for the same nephew.
