# translit_indicxlit = hairani isaliye kii pichhale hee dinn mukhyamantri shankarrao chavhan aur film udyog key pratinidhiyon key beach godbol kamiti key report para honey waali charcha mein any netaaon key alawa kewal amitabh bachchan upasthit they aur suneel datt key baare mein kahaa gaya tha kii way goa mein shooting cur rahe hain isaliye unakaa bambai aana sambhav nahin hai.
# text_en = Surprisingly, the very next day, in a discussion between Chief Minister Shankarrao Chavan and representatives of the film industry on the Godbole Committee report, only Amitabh Bachchan was present, besides other leaders, and Sunil Dutt was told that he was shooting in Goa, so it was not possible for him to come to Bombay.
