# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18e_P2_S37
# text = राजस्व विभाग के तत्कालीन उपशासन सचिव गणपतराम यादव ने 24 जनवरी, 85 को एक आदेश जारी कर राजस्थान खातेदारी अधिनियम की धारा 42 के विपरीत होते हुए भी नाम मात्र की राशि लेकर राजा - महाराजाओं की जमीनों को रूपांतरित करने का प्रावधान रख, भ्रष्टाचार पर ऐतिहासिक मार्ग खोला.
# translit_iast = rājasva vibhāga ke tatkālīna upaśāsana saciva gaṇapatarāma yādava ne 24 janavarī, 85 ko eka ādeśa jārī kara rājasthāna khātedārī adhiniyama kī dhārā 42 ke viparīta hote hue bhī nāma mātra kī rāśi lekara rājā - mahārājāoṃ kī jamīnoṃ ko rūpāṃtarita karane kā prāvadhāna rakha, bhraṣṭācāra para aitihāsika mārga kholā.
# translit_itrans = rAjasva vibhAga ke tatkAlIna upashAsana sachiva gaNapatarAma yAdava ne 24 janavarI, 85 ko eka Adesha jArI kara rAjasthAna khAtedArI adhiniyama kI dhArA 42 ke viparIta hote hue bhI nAma mAtra kI rAshi lekara rAjA - mahArAjAoM kI jamInoM ko rUpAMtarita karane kA prAvadhAna rakha, bhraShTAchAra para aitihAsika mArga kholA.
# translit_indicxlit = rajaswa vibhaag key tatkalin upshaasan sachiv ganapatram yadav nay 24 janwari, 85 coo ack aadesh jaari cur rajasthan khatedari adhiniyam key dhara 42 key vipareet hote hue bhi naam matra key raashi lakers raja - maharajaon key jameenon coo rupaantarit karane kaa praavdhaan rakh, bhrashtachar para aitihaasik marg khola.
# text_en = Ganpatram Yadav, the then Deputy Administrative Secretary of the Revenue Department, issued an order on 24 January 1985, opening the historic path on corruption by making a provision for converting the lands of the Rajas and Maharajas by taking a nominal amount, though contrary to Section 42 of the Rajasthan Accountancy Act.
