# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18e_P2_S49
# text = यूं तो इस आदेश का कोई सरकारी अधिकारियों ने खूब फायदा उठाया, लेकिन सबसे ज्यादा फायदा जयपुर के तत्कालीन अतिरिक्त कलेक्टर (भूमि रूपांतरण) रामजीवन मीणा ने उठाया, पूर्व उपमंत्री श्रीमती कमला भील के पति मीणा ने `मोती भवन गृह निर्माण सहकारी समिति की हनुमान नगर - योजना की करीब डेढ़ सौ एकड़ जमीन को रूपांतरित कर दिया, जबकि इस जमीन के संबंध में सरकार ने उच्च न्यायालय में अपील कर रखी थी.
# translit_iast = yūṃ to isa ādeśa kā koī sarakārī adhikāriyoṃ ne khūba phāyadā uṭhāyā, lekina sabase jyādā phāyadā jayapura ke tatkālīna atirikta kalekṭara (bhūmi rūpāṃtaraṇa) rāmajīvana mīṇā ne uṭhāyā, pūrva upamaṃtrī śrīmatī kamalā bhīla ke pati mīṇā ne `motī bhavana gṛha nirmāṇa sahakārī samiti kī hanumāna nagara - yojanā kī karība ḍer̤ha sau ekar̤a jamīna ko rūpāṃtarita kara diyā, jabaki isa jamīna ke saṃbaṃdha meṃ sarakāra ne ucca nyāyālaya meṃ apīla kara rakhī thī.
# translit_itrans = yUM to isa Adesha kA koI sarakArI adhikAriyoM ne khUba phAyadA uThAyA, lekina sabase jyAdA phAyadA jayapura ke tatkAlIna atirikta kalekTara (bhUmi rUpAMtaraNa) rAmajIvana mINA ne uThAyA, pUrva upamaMtrI shrImatI kamalA bhIla ke pati mINA ne `motI bhavana gRRiha nirmANa sahakArI samiti kI hanumAna nagara - yojanA kI karIba De.Dha sau eka.Da jamIna ko rUpAMtarita kara diyA, jabaki isa jamIna ke saMbaMdha meM sarakAra ne uchcha nyAyAlaya meM apIla kara rakhI thI.
# translit_indicxlit = youn too iss aadesh kaa koi sarkari adhikaariyon nay khoob fayda uthaaya, lekin sabse zyada fayda jaipur key tatkalin atirikt collector (bhoomi roopaantaran) ramjeevan meenaa nay uthaaya, poorv upmantri shrimati kamala bhil key pati meenaa nay `moti bhawan griha nirmaan sahakaari samiti key hanuman nagar - yojana key karib dedh sou ekad jameen coo rupaantarit cur diya, jabaki iss jameen key sambandh mein sarkar nay uchch nyayalaya mein appeal cur rakhi thee.
# text_en = Though the order was well taken advantage of by some government officials, the biggest beneficiary was Ramjeevan Meena, the then Additional Collector ( Land Conversion ) of Jaipur. Meena, the husband of former Deputy Minister Mrs. Kamla Bhil, converted about 150 acres of land belonging to the Hanuman Nagar-scheme of the Jagamoti Building Construction Cooperative Society, while the government had appealed in the High Court regarding this land.
