# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18e_P2_S80
# text = इस जमीन छुड़ाई के सौदे में मोटी रकम का लेन-देन हुआ है, भूमि एवं भवन कर विभाग की करीब 85 लाख वर्ग मीटर जमीन से जेडीए ने 22 लाख वर्ग मीटर जमीन पर बकायदा कब्जा भी ले लिया, लेकिन कब्जाशुदा जमीन में से जेडीए के पास सिर्फ एक-दो लाख वर्ग मीटर जमीन ही कब्जे में रही, बाकी जमीन पर धन्ना सेठों ने नाजायज कब्जा जमा लिया; कुछ अफसरों की मेहरबानी से गृह निर्माण सहकारी समितियों को मिल गयी.
# translit_iast = isa jamīna chur̤āī ke saude meṃ moṭī rakama kā lena-dena huā hai, bhūmi evaṃ bhavana kara vibhāga kī karība 85 lākha varga mīṭara jamīna se jeḍīe ne 22 lākha varga mīṭara jamīna para bakāyadā kabjā bhī le liyā, lekina kabjāśudā jamīna meṃ se jeḍīe ke pāsa sirpha eka-do lākha varga mīṭara jamīna hī kabje meṃ rahī, bākī jamīna para dhannā seṭhoṃ ne nājāyaja kabjā jamā liyā; kucha aphasaroṃ kī meharabānī se gṛha nirmāṇa sahakārī samitiyoṃ ko mila gayī.
# translit_itrans = isa jamIna Chu.DAI ke saude meM moTI rakama kA lena-dena huA hai, bhUmi evaM bhavana kara vibhAga kI karIba 85 lAkha varga mITara jamIna se jeDIe ne 22 lAkha varga mITara jamIna para bakAyadA kabjA bhI le liyA, lekina kabjAshudA jamIna meM se jeDIe ke pAsa sirpha eka-do lAkha varga mITara jamIna hI kabje meM rahI, bAkI jamIna para dhannA seThoM ne nAjAyaja kabjA jamA liyA; kuCha aphasaroM kI meharabAnI se gRRiha nirmANa sahakArI samitiyoM ko mila gayI.
# translit_indicxlit = iss jameen chhudaai key saude mein moti rakam kaa laine-daine hua hai, bhoomi aivam bhawan cur vibhaag key karib 85 lakh varg meter jameen say jda nay 22 lakh varg meter jameen para bakaayada kabza bhi lay lia, lekin kabjashuda jameen mein say jda key paas sirf ack-doe lakh varg meter jameen hee kabje mein rahee, baaki jameen para dhanna sethon nay najayaj kabza jamaa lia; kuchha afsaron key meharbani say griha nirmaan sahakaari samitiyon coo mill gayee.
# text_en = The land recovery deal involved a huge amount of money. Out of about 85 lakh square metres of land belonging to the Land and Building Tax Department, the JDA also took over 22 lakh square metres of land. But out of the occupied land, the JDA was left with only one-two lakh square metres of land and the remaining land was illegally occupied by the Dhanna Seths. the housing cooperatives got the favours of some officials.
