# text = पिछले 7 जुलाई को नगरीय विकास एवं आवासन विभाग के राज्यमंत्री सुजानसिंह यादव की अध्यक्षता में हुई एक उच्चस्तरीय बैठक में इस बात पर गहरा आक्रोश वयक्त किया गया कि 1976 से लागू अलसर एक्ट पर अमल दस साल बाद भी काफी असंतोषजनक है.
# translit_iast = pichale 7 julāī ko nagarīya vikāsa evaṃ āvāsana vibhāga ke rājyamaṃtrī sujānasiṃha yādava kī adhyakṣatā meṃ huī eka uccastarīya baiṭhaka meṃ isa bāta para gaharā ākrośa vayakta kiyā gayā ki 1976 se lāgū alasara ekṭa para amala dasa sāla bāda bhī kāphī asaṃtoṣajanaka hai.
# translit_itrans = piChale 7 julAI ko nagarIya vikAsa evaM AvAsana vibhAga ke rAjyamaMtrI sujAnasiMha yAdava kI adhyakShatA meM huI eka uchchastarIya baiThaka meM isa bAta para gaharA Akrosha vayakta kiyA gayA ki 1976 se lAgU alasara ekTa para amala dasa sAla bAda bhI kAphI asaMtoShajanaka hai.
# translit_indicxlit = pichhale 7 julaai coo nagariya vikas aivam awasan vibhaag key rajyamantri sujansingh yadav key adhyakshata mein hui ack uchchastariya baithak mein iss baat para gahara aakrosh vayakt kiya gaya kii 1976 say lagu alsar act para amal dasa saal baad bhi kaafee asantoshjanak hai.
# text_en = On 7th July last, a high level meeting chaired by Sujan Singh Yadav, Minister of State for Urban Development and Housing, expressed deep anguish that the implementation of the Al-Sar Act, in force since 1976, was still unsatisfactory ten years later.
