# text = बकाया पड़ी जमीनों के बारे में जेडीए का जवाब `डिप्लोमेटिक था कि जमीन का कब्जा इसलिए नहीं लिया क्योंकि वह उनकी योजना के अनुरूप नहीं थी, हकीकत यह है कि अधिकांश जमीन पर तो जेडीए के अफसरों ने ही कब्जा कराया था.
# translit_iast = bakāyā par̤ī jamīnoṃ ke bāre meṃ jeḍīe kā javāba `ḍiplomeṭika thā ki jamīna kā kabjā isalie nahīṃ liyā kyoṃki vaha unakī yojanā ke anurūpa nahīṃ thī, hakīkata yaha hai ki adhikāṃśa jamīna para to jeḍīe ke aphasaroṃ ne hī kabjā karāyā thā.
# translit_itrans = bakAyA pa.DI jamInoM ke bAre meM jeDIe kA javAba `DiplomeTika thA ki jamIna kA kabjA isalie nahIM liyA kyoMki vaha unakI yojanA ke anurUpa nahIM thI, hakIkata yaha hai ki adhikAMsha jamIna para to jeDIe ke aphasaroM ne hI kabjA karAyA thA.
# translit_indicxlit = bakaaya padi jameenon key baare mein jda kaa jawab `diplomatic tha kii jameen kaa kabza isaliye nahin lia kyonki wah unaki yojana key anuroop nahin thee, hakikat yeah hai kii adhikansh jameen para too jda key afsaron nay hee kabza karaaya tha.
# text_en = The JDA's response to the outstanding lands was diplomatic : the land was not taken over because it did not fit their scheme ; in fact, most of the land was occupied by JDA officials.
