# text = जब इस मामले की शिकायत होने लगी तथा जांच की प्रक्रिया सामने आयी तो माथुर ने एकदम अनजान बनते हुए अतिरिक्त कलेक्टर जयपुर को लिखा कि `जयपुर विकास प्राधिकरण द्वारा जिलाधीश कार्यालय को कुछ ऐसी योजनाओं की कृषि भूमि रूपांतरण के लिए सिफारिश कर दी गयी है, जो भूमि सरकारी है तथा प्राधिकरण द्वारा इन पर कब्जा भी लिया जा चुका है.
# translit_iast = jaba isa māmale kī śikāyata hone lagī tathā jāṃca kī prakriyā sāmane āyī to māthura ne ekadama anajāna banate hue atirikta kalekṭara jayapura ko likhā ki `jayapura vikāsa prādhikaraṇa dvārā jilādhīśa kāryālaya ko kucha aisī yojanāoṃ kī kṛṣi bhūmi rūpāṃtaraṇa ke lie siphāriśa kara dī gayī hai, jo bhūmi sarakārī hai tathā prādhikaraṇa dvārā ina para kabjā bhī liyā jā cukā hai.
# translit_itrans = jaba isa mAmale kI shikAyata hone lagI tathA jAMcha kI prakriyA sAmane AyI to mAthura ne ekadama anajAna banate hue atirikta kalekTara jayapura ko likhA ki `jayapura vikAsa prAdhikaraNa dvArA jilAdhIsha kAryAlaya ko kuCha aisI yojanAoM kI kRRiShi bhUmi rUpAMtaraNa ke lie siphArisha kara dI gayI hai, jo bhUmi sarakArI hai tathA prAdhikaraNa dvArA ina para kabjA bhI liyA jA chukA hai.
# translit_indicxlit = jab iss mamle key shikayat honey luggy tathaa jaanch key prakriya saamane aayi too mathur nay ekdam anjaan banate hue atirikt collector jaipur coo likhaa kii `jaipur vikas pradhikaran dwara jiladhish karyalaya coo kuchha aisee yojanaon key krishi bhoomi roopaantaran key lie sifarish cur dee gayee hai, zoo bhoomi sarkari hai tathaa pradhikaran dwara inn para kabza bhi lia jaa chuka hai.
# text_en = When the matter was complained and the process of investigation was revealed, Mathur, quite unaware, wrote to the Additional Collector Jaipur that the Collector's office had been recommended by the Jaipur Development Authority for conversion of certain plots of agricultural land which were government owned and had been taken over by the Authority.
