# text = आखिरी इसलिए क्योंकि अपने साथ हुए हादसे को अपनी नियति मानकर वह पचा नहीं गयी, बल्कि पप्पू सिंह के खिलाफ खुली जंग में उतर आयी, उसने पप्पू सिंह पर बलात्कार का आरोप लगाते हुए पुलिस में रपट लिखा दी और फिर `महिला मंच की सक्रियता और गांव की औरतों के लड़ाई में उतर आने पर पूरा गांव भी शपथ खाकर पप्पू सिंह के अत्याचारों के खिलाफ चल रही जंग में शामिल हो गया.
# translit_iast = ākhirī isalie kyoṃki apane sātha hue hādase ko apanī niyati mānakara vaha pacā nahīṃ gayī, balki pappū siṃha ke khilāpha khulī jaṃga meṃ utara āyī, usane pappū siṃha para balātkāra kā āropa lagāte hue pulisa meṃ rapaṭa likhā dī aura phira `mahilā maṃca kī sakriyatā aura gāṃva kī auratoṃ ke lar̤āī meṃ utara āne para pūrā gāṃva bhī śapatha khākara pappū siṃha ke atyācāroṃ ke khilāpha cala rahī jaṃga meṃ śāmila ho gayā.
# translit_itrans = AkhirI isalie kyoMki apane sAtha hue hAdase ko apanI niyati mAnakara vaha pachA nahIM gayI, balki pappU siMha ke khilApha khulI jaMga meM utara AyI, usane pappU siMha para balAtkAra kA Aropa lagAte hue pulisa meM rapaTa likhA dI aura phira `mahilA maMcha kI sakriyatA aura gAMva kI auratoM ke la.DAI meM utara Ane para pUrA gAMva bhI shapatha khAkara pappU siMha ke atyAchAroM ke khilApha chala rahI jaMga meM shAmila ho gayA.
# translit_indicxlit = aakhiri isaliye kyonki apane saath hue hadse coo apni niyati mankar wah pachaa nahin gayee, bulky pappu singh key khilaf khuli jung mein utar aayi, usane pappu singh para balatkar kaa aarop lagaate hue police mein rapat likhaa dee aur fir `mahila munch key sakriyata aur gaon key auraton key ladaai mein utar aane para pura gaon bhi shapath khaakar pappu singh key atyacharon key khilaf chal rahee jung mein shamil how gaya.
# text_en = Lastly, because she did not accept the accident as her destiny, she instead entered into an open war against Pappu Singh, she wrote a report to the police accusing Pappu Singh of rape, and then, with the activism of the Jagat Mahila Manch and the women of the village coming into the fight, the entire village also joined the war against Pappu Singh's atrocities.
