# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot19ar.txt_P2_S71
# text = वरना दूर संचार के देशी आधार को बनाने की सी डाट नामक कोशिश का तो कबाड़ा हो ही जाता साथ साथ लक्ष्मी वेंकटरमण समेत संचार मंत्रालय के कई अफसर और उससे जुड़े नेता मालामाल हो जाते क्योंकि अमेरिकी बहुराष्ट्रीय कंपनी अपने सर्वे में उपकरण खरीदने की सिफारिश करती और कई बहुराष्ट्रीय कंपनियों, उनके देशी एजेंटो उससे जुड़े नेताओं और अफसरोंके हाथ में कमीशन रिश्वत `किक बैक की रकम पहुच जाती, नुकसान किसका होता - सरकार का यानी टेक्स अदा करने वाली जनता का, लक्ष्मी वेंकटरमण तत्कालीन उपराष्ट्रपति की बेटी थी इसलिए प्रधानमंत्री सचिवालय से लेकर संचार मंत्री राम विलास मिर्धा तक उनके हक में खड़े थे.
# translit_iast = varanā dūra saṃcāra ke deśī ādhāra ko banāne kī sī ḍāṭa nāmaka kośiśa kā to kabār̤ā ho hī jātā sātha sātha lakṣmī veṃkaṭaramaṇa sameta saṃcāra maṃtrālaya ke kaī aphasara aura usase jur̤e netā mālāmāla ho jāte kyoṃki amerikī bahurāṣṭrīya kaṃpanī apane sarve meṃ upakaraṇa kharīdane kī siphāriśa karatī aura kaī bahurāṣṭrīya kaṃpaniyoṃ, unake deśī ejeṃṭo usase jur̤e netāoṃ aura aphasaroṃke hātha meṃ kamīśana riśvata `kika baika kī rakama pahuca jātī, nukasāna kisakā hotā - sarakāra kā yānī ṭeksa adā karane vālī janatā kā, lakṣmī veṃkaṭaramaṇa tatkālīna uparāṣṭrapati kī beṭī thī isalie pradhānamaṃtrī sacivālaya se lekara saṃcāra maṃtrī rāma vilāsa mirdhā taka unake haka meṃ khar̤e the.
# translit_itrans = varanA dUra saMchAra ke deshI AdhAra ko banAne kI sI DATa nAmaka koshisha kA to kabA.DA ho hI jAtA sAtha sAtha lakShmI veMkaTaramaNa sameta saMchAra maMtrAlaya ke kaI aphasara aura usase ju.De netA mAlAmAla ho jAte kyoMki amerikI bahurAShTrIya kaMpanI apane sarve meM upakaraNa kharIdane kI siphArisha karatI aura kaI bahurAShTrIya kaMpaniyoM, unake deshI ejeMTo usase ju.De netAoM aura aphasaroMke hAtha meM kamIshana rishvata `kika baika kI rakama pahucha jAtI, nukasAna kisakA hotA - sarakAra kA yAnI Teksa adA karane vAlI janatA kA, lakShmI veMkaTaramaNa tatkAlIna uparAShTrapati kI beTI thI isalie pradhAnamaMtrI sachivAlaya se lekara saMchAra maMtrI rAma vilAsa mirdhA taka unake haka meM kha.De the.
# translit_indicxlit = varna door sanchaar key deshi aadhar coo banaane key see daat namak koshish kaa too kabaada how hee jaataa saath saath lakshmi venkataraman samet sanchaar mantralaya key kaee afsar aur usase jure neta malamal how jaate kyonki american bahurashtriya company apane survey mein upkaran khareedane key sifarish karati aur kaee bahurashtriya companiyon, unake deshi agento usase jure netaaon aur afsaronke haath mein commission rishwat `kick back key rakam pahuch jaati, nuksan kiska hota - sarkar kaa yaani takes adaa karane waali janata kaa, lakshmi venkataraman tatkalin uparaashtrapati key batty thee isaliye pradhaanmantri sachivalaya say lakers sanchaar mantri rama villas mirdha tuck unake hack mein khade they.
# text_en = Otherwise, the efforts of C. Datt to build an indigenous base of telecommunications would have been ruined and many officials of the Ministry of Communications, including Lakshmi Venkataraman, and its leaders would have been rich because the American multinational company would have recommended the purchase of equipment in its survey and many multinational companies and their domestic agents would have paid commission bribes to the leaders and officials associated with it.
