# text = तीन साल पहले नैहर से ही पेट में बच्चा लेकर आने के कारण जब बिरादरी वालों ने मिठुआ की औरत के खिलाफ पंचायत की और मिठुआ को पन्द्रह आना करके बिरादरी से निकाल दिया, तब उसने डाँड़ भरने और बिरादरी को भोज देने की गरज से औरत का पाँच सौ का गहना दो सौ रुपए लेकर रामनारायण साहू के यहाँ बन्धक रख दिया।
# translit_iast = tīna sāla pahale naihara se hī peṭa meṃ baccā lekara āne ke kāraṇa jaba birādarī vāloṃ ne miṭhuā kī aurata ke khilāpha paṃcāyata kī aura miṭhuā ko pandraha ānā karake birādarī se nikāla diyā, taba usane ḍā~r̤a bharane aura birādarī ko bhoja dene kī garaja se aurata kā pā~ca sau kā gahanā do sau rupae lekara rāmanārāyaṇa sāhū ke yahā~ bandhaka rakha diyā|
# translit_itrans = tIna sAla pahale naihara se hI peTa meM bachchA lekara Ane ke kAraNa jaba birAdarI vAloM ne miThuA kI aurata ke khilApha paMchAyata kI aura miThuA ko pandraha AnA karake birAdarI se nikAla diyA, taba usane DA.N.Da bharane aura birAdarI ko bhoja dene kI garaja se aurata kA pA.Ncha sau kA gahanA do sau rupae lekara rAmanArAyaNa sAhU ke yahA.N bandhaka rakha diyA|
# translit_indicxlit = teen saal pehle naihar say hee pett mein bachcha lakers aane key kaaran jab biradari vaalon nay mithua key aurat key khilaf panchayat key aur mithua coo pandrah aana karke biradari say nikal diya, tab usane danda bharane aur biradari coo bhoj dene key garaj say aurat kaa paanch sou kaa gahana doe sou rupaye lakers ramnarayan saahuu key yahaan bandhak rakh diya.
# text_en = Three years ago, when the biradari people held a panchayat against Mithua's wife for bringing a child from Naihar and Mithua was expelled from the biradari for fifteen annas, she took the woman's jewel of five hundred rupees and mortgaged it to Ramnarayan Sahu in order to fill the danda and give a feast to the biradari.
