# translit_indicxlit = aatankvaadiyon nay jab akaal takhat key jatthedaar darshansingh raagi coo swarnamandir say khadeda too sikh samaj nay iska koi virodh nahin kiya aur naa jasbirsinh rode key jatthedaar banaae jaane para khushi prakat key manna galat nahin hoga kii yeye sabhi sangathan sikh samaj key lie aprasangik how chuke hain.
