# translit_indicxlit = rajya star para madhyapradesh kaa churhat lottery ghotala aur taut patti ghotala, paschim bengal kaa alipur khazana ghotala kaand, odissa kaa saal beej ghotala, utter pradesh mein tedu patte key vyaapaar mein chal rahe ghotale coo madhyavarti star key rajneeti mein bhrashtachar key prakop kaa prateek maanaa jaa sakta hai.
