# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot19a_P2_S37
# text = नेता जी उन दिनों मनीराम बागड़ी के घर में रहते थे, उन्होंने रिपोर्ट लिखाने की जहमत भी नहीं उठायी, समाजवादी हल्कों में चर्चा गर्म थी कि राजनारायण जी कम से कम दो वारदातों में 10 लाख रुपये से हाथ धो बैठे, वैसे भी उनके बारे में मशहूर था कि `नेता जी जब स्नान कर रहे हों उनकी तलाशी लेने पर शरीर के किसी न किसी अंग से कम से कम 60 हजार रुपये निकल आयेंगे.
# translit_iast = netā jī una dinoṃ manīrāma bāgar̤ī ke ghara meṃ rahate the, unhoṃne riporṭa likhāne kī jahamata bhī nahīṃ uṭhāyī, samājavādī halkoṃ meṃ carcā garma thī ki rājanārāyaṇa jī kama se kama do vāradātoṃ meṃ 10 lākha rupaye se hātha dho baiṭhe, vaise bhī unake bāre meṃ maśahūra thā ki `netā jī jaba snāna kara rahe hoṃ unakī talāśī lene para śarīra ke kisī na kisī aṃga se kama se kama 60 hajāra rupaye nikala āyeṃge.
# translit_itrans = netA jI una dinoM manIrAma bAga.DI ke ghara meM rahate the, unhoMne riporTa likhAne kI jahamata bhI nahIM uThAyI, samAjavAdI halkoM meM charchA garma thI ki rAjanArAyaNa jI kama se kama do vAradAtoM meM 10 lAkha rupaye se hAtha dho baiThe, vaise bhI unake bAre meM mashahUra thA ki `netA jI jaba snAna kara rahe hoM unakI talAshI lene para sharIra ke kisI na kisI aMga se kama se kama 60 hajAra rupaye nikala AyeMge.
# translit_indicxlit = neta jee una dino maniram baagadi key ghar mein rehte they, unhone report likhaane key jahmat bhi nahin uthaayi, samajwadi halkon mein charcha germ thee kii rajnarayan jee cum say cum doe vaardaaton mein 10 lakh rupaye say haath dho baithe, vaise bhi unake baare mein mashur tha kii `neta jee jab snan cur rahe hone unaki talashi lene para shareer key kissy naa kissy ang say cum say cum 60 hazaar rupaye nickel aayenge.
# text_en = Netaji was living in Maniram Bagdi's house at that time and he did not even bother to write a report. There was a discussion in the socialist circles that Rajnarayan ji had lost Rs 10 lakh in at least two incidents. However, it was known about him that if Netaji was frisked while taking a bath, at least 60 thousand rupees would come out of one or another part of his body.
