# translit_itrans = bhraShTAchAra ke isa rAShTrIya vikAsa kI kahAnI atyaMta saMkShepa meM vishvanAtha pratApasiMha ne kalakattA meM sunAyI, shabda arthashAstrI rAjakRRiShNa ke the, hamArI pUrI rAjanaitika vyavasthA pUMjI poShita ho gayI hai.
