# translit_indicxlit = bhrashtachar key suffer kaa ack aur udaaharan maujooda rashtrapati aar. venkataraman jinn dino tamilanadu mein udyogmantri they, una dino japani firm key madad say aathakpada milein sthaapit honey key silsile mein unase vidhan sabha mein poochha gaya tha kii kya isamen kissy kism kaa commission key jagah hamane nauvin mill sthaapit key hai.
