# text = धारावाहिक गणदेवता में दुर्गा की भूमिका निभाने वाली रुपा गांगुली महाभारत की मुख्य महिला पात्र द्रौपदी के रुप में छोटे परदे पर अपने स्वयंवर में दिखीं तथा अब तक महाभारत में द्रौपदी के सशक्त चरित्र को जिस प्रभावशाली ढंग से निभाया है उस की दर्शकों ने मुक्त कंठ से सराहना की है.
# translit_iast = dhārāvāhika gaṇadevatā meṃ durgā kī bhūmikā nibhāne vālī rupā gāṃgulī mahābhārata kī mukhya mahilā pātra draupadī ke rupa meṃ choṭe parade para apane svayaṃvara meṃ dikhīṃ tathā aba taka mahābhārata meṃ draupadī ke saśakta caritra ko jisa prabhāvaśālī ḍhaṃga se nibhāyā hai usa kī darśakoṃ ne mukta kaṃṭha se sarāhanā kī hai.
# translit_itrans = dhArAvAhika gaNadevatA meM durgA kI bhUmikA nibhAne vAlI rupA gAMgulI mahAbhArata kI mukhya mahilA pAtra draupadI ke rupa meM ChoTe parade para apane svayaMvara meM dikhIM tathA aba taka mahAbhArata meM draupadI ke sashakta charitra ko jisa prabhAvashAlI DhaMga se nibhAyA hai usa kI darshakoM ne mukta kaMTha se sarAhanA kI hai.
# translit_indicxlit = dharavahik ganadevata mein durga key bhoomika nibhaane waali rupa ganguli mahabharat key mukhya mahila patra draupadi key roop mein chhote parade para apane swayamvar mein dikhin tathaa ab tuck mahabharat mein draupadi key sashakt charitra coo jis prabhaavshaali dhang say nibhaaya hai usa key darshakon nay mukt kantha say sarahana key hai.
# text_en = Roopa Ganguly, who played the role of Durga in the serial Ganadevata, appeared in her Swayamvar on the small screen as Draupadi, the main female character of Mahabharata, and has so far been praised by the audience for the powerful character of Draupadi in Mahabharata.
