# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ak_P2_S39
# text = एक इतिहास होता है, जो कागज पर लिखा जाता है, और खुदा जाने उस में कितना सच होता है और कितना झूठ. . एक इतिहास होता है, जो इंसान के बदन पर लिखा जाता है और जाने उस में कितना दर्द है, पर दुनिया यह कभी नहीं जान पाती.
# translit_iast = eka itihāsa hotā hai, jo kāgaja para likhā jātā hai, aura khudā jāne usa meṃ kitanā saca hotā hai aura kitanā jhūṭha. . eka itihāsa hotā hai, jo iṃsāna ke badana para likhā jātā hai aura jāne usa meṃ kitanā darda hai, para duniyā yaha kabhī nahīṃ jāna pātī.
# translit_itrans = eka itihAsa hotA hai, jo kAgaja para likhA jAtA hai, aura khudA jAne usa meM kitanA sacha hotA hai aura kitanA jhUTha. . eka itihAsa hotA hai, jo iMsAna ke badana para likhA jAtA hai aura jAne usa meM kitanA darda hai, para duniyA yaha kabhI nahIM jAna pAtI.
# translit_indicxlit = ack itihas hota hai, zoo kagaj para likhaa jaataa hai, aur khuda jaane usa mein kitna such hota hai aur kitna jhooth. . ack itihas hota hai, zoo insaan key badan para likhaa jaataa hai aur jaane usa mein kitna dard hai, para duniya yeah kabhi nahin jaan paati.
# text_en = There is a history, which is written on paper and God knows how much of it is true and how much of it is false. There is a history, which is written on the human body and how much pain is there in it. But the world never knows.
