# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ak_P2_S43
# text = जब दिल्ली में पहली एशियन राइटर्ज कांफ्रेंस हुई थी. . . कांफ्रेंस ने बड़े-बड़े मसलों की बात करनी थी, लेकिन कुछ छोटे-छोटे प्यारे-प्यारे मसले भी थे, जो कांफ्रेंस की औट लेकर हल किए जा रहे थे--मसलन--उर्दू के अदीब कृश्न चंदर की अभी सलमा सिद्दीकी से रस्म के मुताबिक शादी नहीं हुई थी, लेकिन यह कांफ्रेस जी भर कर मिलने का एक बहुत बड़ी ओट थी और एक दिन छोटा सा हंगामा हो गया--कृश्न चंदर और तीन-चार अदीब एक कमरे में बैठे चाय पी रहे थे, वहां मैं भी थी और सलमा भी कि कृश्न चंदर के लिए किसी का फोन आ गया.
# translit_iast = jaba dillī meṃ pahalī eśiyana rāiṭarja kāṃphreṃsa huī thī. . . kāṃphreṃsa ne bar̤e-bar̤e masaloṃ kī bāta karanī thī, lekina kucha choṭe-choṭe pyāre-pyāre masale bhī the, jo kāṃphreṃsa kī auṭa lekara hala kie jā rahe the--masalana--urdū ke adība kṛśna caṃdara kī abhī salamā siddīkī se rasma ke mutābika śādī nahīṃ huī thī, lekina yaha kāṃphresa jī bhara kara milane kā eka bahuta bar̤ī oṭa thī aura eka dina choṭā sā haṃgāmā ho gayā--kṛśna caṃdara aura tīna-cāra adība eka kamare meṃ baiṭhe cāya pī rahe the, vahāṃ maiṃ bhī thī aura salamā bhī ki kṛśna caṃdara ke lie kisī kā phona ā gayā.
# translit_itrans = jaba dillI meM pahalI eshiyana rAiTarja kAMphreMsa huI thI. . . kAMphreMsa ne ba.De-ba.De masaloM kI bAta karanI thI, lekina kuCha ChoTe-ChoTe pyAre-pyAre masale bhI the, jo kAMphreMsa kI auTa lekara hala kie jA rahe the--masalana--urdU ke adIba kRRishna chaMdara kI abhI salamA siddIkI se rasma ke mutAbika shAdI nahIM huI thI, lekina yaha kAMphresa jI bhara kara milane kA eka bahuta ba.DI oTa thI aura eka dina ChoTA sA haMgAmA ho gayA--kRRishna chaMdara aura tIna-chAra adIba eka kamare meM baiThe chAya pI rahe the, vahAM maiM bhI thI aura salamA bhI ki kRRishna chaMdara ke lie kisI kA phona A gayA.
# translit_indicxlit = jab dilly mein pahali asean reuters conference hui thee. . . conference nay badey-badey masalon key baat karni thee, lekin kuchha chhote-chhote pyaare-pyaare masale bhi they, zoo conference key out lakers hall kiye jaa rahe they--masalan--urdu key adeeb krishna chander key abhi salma siddiqi say rasm key mutabik shaadi nahin hui thee, lekin yeah comfress jee bhar cur milane kaa ack bahut badee out thee aur ack dinn chhota sha hangama how gaya--krishna chander aur teen-chaar adeeb ack kamare mein baithe chaya pie rahe they, vahan main bhi thee aur salma bhi kii krishna chander key lie kissy kaa phone aa gaya.
# text_en = When the first Asian Writers Conference was held in Delhi... the conference was supposed to talk about big issues but there were small, sweet-hearted issues that were being sorted out by the conference -- Mussalna -- Adeeb Krishan Chander of Urdu was not yet married to Salma Siddiqui as per the ceremony. But it was a big ode to meet-up with the conference and one day there was a small commotion -- Krishan Chander and Teen Char Adeeb were sitting in a room drinking tea and there was me and Salma that someone called for Krishan Chander.
