# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ak_P2_S63
# text = मुझे कहने लगा-- अमृता जी, मैं नहीं जानता था कि यह बीवियां अपने मर्दों के कोट की जेब भी सूंघती हैं. . . आप को मालूम है, मैं जेब में सिगरेट रखता था आक्साना के लिए, लेकिन मेरी बीवी ने मेरे कोट की जेब सूंघ ली और मुझ पर इल्जाम लगाने लगी कि मैं अब सिगरेट पीने लगा हूं, और घर में खासा हंगामा कर दिया.
# translit_iast = mujhe kahane lagā-- amṛtā jī, maiṃ nahīṃ jānatā thā ki yaha bīviyāṃ apane mardoṃ ke koṭa kī jeba bhī sūṃghatī haiṃ. . . āpa ko mālūma hai, maiṃ jeba meṃ sigareṭa rakhatā thā āksānā ke lie, lekina merī bīvī ne mere koṭa kī jeba sūṃgha lī aura mujha para iljāma lagāne lagī ki maiṃ aba sigareṭa pīne lagā hūṃ, aura ghara meṃ khāsā haṃgāmā kara diyā.
# translit_itrans = mujhe kahane lagA-- amRRitA jI, maiM nahIM jAnatA thA ki yaha bIviyAM apane mardoM ke koTa kI jeba bhI sUMghatI haiM. . . Apa ko mAlUma hai, maiM jeba meM sigareTa rakhatA thA AksAnA ke lie, lekina merI bIvI ne mere koTa kI jeba sUMgha lI aura mujha para iljAma lagAne lagI ki maiM aba sigareTa pIne lagA hUM, aura ghara meM khAsA haMgAmA kara diyA.
# translit_indicxlit = mujhe kahane lagaa-- amrita jee, main nahin janta tha kii yeah beeviyan apane mardon key coat key jeb bhi soonghati hain. . . aap coo maloom hai, main jeb mein sigaret rakhta tha axana key lie, lekin merry biwi nay mere coat key jeb soongh lie aur mujh para iljam lagaane luggy kii main ab sigaret pine lagaa hoon, aur ghar mein khaasa hangama cur diya.
# text_en = Amrita ji said to me -- I did not know that these wives even smell the pockets of their men's coats. You know, I used to keep a cigarette in my pocket for Aksana. But my wife smelled the pockets of my coat and started accusing me that I have started smoking cigarettes now and created a lot of ruckus in the house.
