# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ak_P2_S71
# text = कुछ वाक्यात सही मायनों में वाक्यात भी नहीं कहे जा सकते, और न उन के पास कुछ कहने को होता है, लेकिन यूं ही जब कभी याद आ जाए तो एक रोमांस सा हो आता है. . . ऐसा ही एक वाक्या था जब नेपाल अबसी ने कुछ डैलीगेट्स को दावत दी, और नेपाल की टोपियां तोहफे के तौर पर पेश कीं--सिर्फ पेश नहीं कीं, हमारे सिरों पर पहनाई, और तस्वीरें उतारी. . . हम लोग बार-बार आईना देख रहे थे. . . उस समय की श्री हरिवंश राय बच्चन के साथ मेरे पास एक यादगारी तस्वीर है.
# translit_iast = kucha vākyāta sahī māyanoṃ meṃ vākyāta bhī nahīṃ kahe jā sakate, aura na una ke pāsa kucha kahane ko hotā hai, lekina yūṃ hī jaba kabhī yāda ā jāe to eka romāṃsa sā ho ātā hai. . . aisā hī eka vākyā thā jaba nepāla abasī ne kucha ḍailīgeṭsa ko dāvata dī, aura nepāla kī ṭopiyāṃ tohaphe ke taura para peśa kīṃ--sirpha peśa nahīṃ kīṃ, hamāre siroṃ para pahanāī, aura tasvīreṃ utārī. . . hama loga bāra-bāra āīnā dekha rahe the. . . usa samaya kī śrī harivaṃśa rāya baccana ke sātha mere pāsa eka yādagārī tasvīra hai.
# translit_itrans = kuCha vAkyAta sahI mAyanoM meM vAkyAta bhI nahIM kahe jA sakate, aura na una ke pAsa kuCha kahane ko hotA hai, lekina yUM hI jaba kabhI yAda A jAe to eka romAMsa sA ho AtA hai. . . aisA hI eka vAkyA thA jaba nepAla abasI ne kuCha DailIgeTsa ko dAvata dI, aura nepAla kI TopiyAM tohaphe ke taura para pesha kIM--sirpha pesha nahIM kIM, hamAre siroM para pahanAI, aura tasvIreM utArI. . . hama loga bAra-bAra AInA dekha rahe the. . . usa samaya kI shrI harivaMsha rAya bachchana ke sAtha mere pAsa eka yAdagArI tasvIra hai.
# translit_indicxlit = kuchha vaakyaat sahi mayanon mein vaakyaat bhi nahin kahey jaa sakate, aur naa una key paas kuchha kahane coo hota hai, lekin youn hee jab kabhi yaad aa jaye too ack romance sha how aata hai. . . aisaa hee ack vakya tha jab nepal absi nay kuchha delegates coo dawat dee, aur nepal key topiyaan tohfe key tour para pesh keen--sirf pesh nahin keen, hamare siron para pehnai, aur tasveeren utaari. . . humm log baar-baar ina dekh rahe they. . . usa samay key shree harivansh rae bachchan key saath mere paas ack yadgari tasveer hai.
# text_en = Some sentences cannot be truly said, and they have nothing to say, but just as often as they are remembered, there is a romance... there was this one incident when the Nepal Abasi gave a feast to some delegates and presented Nepal caps as gifts... not just presented... we wore them on our heads and took pictures... we were looking at the mirror again and again... I have a memorable picture with Shri Harivansh Rai Bachchan of that time.
