# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ak_P2_S88
# text = यह तो 1966 में जब में जार्जिया गई, वहां के शायर शोता-रुस्ता वैली की आठ सौ बरसी पर, तो मुझे खास तौर पर ईराकली आबाशीदजे की बीवी ने अपने घर बुलाया, दुभाषिए की मदद से छोटी-छोटी बातें करती रहीं, और फिर कहने लगी--आज मेरा खौफ दूर हुआ है.
# translit_iast = yaha to 1966 meṃ jaba meṃ jārjiyā gaī, vahāṃ ke śāyara śotā-rustā vailī kī āṭha sau barasī para, to mujhe khāsa taura para īrākalī ābāśīdaje kī bīvī ne apane ghara bulāyā, dubhāṣie kī madada se choṭī-choṭī bāteṃ karatī rahīṃ, aura phira kahane lagī--āja merā khaupha dūra huā hai.
# translit_itrans = yaha to 1966 meM jaba meM jArjiyA gaI, vahAM ke shAyara shotA-rustA vailI kI ATha sau barasI para, to mujhe khAsa taura para IrAkalI AbAshIdaje kI bIvI ne apane ghara bulAyA, dubhAShie kI madada se ChoTI-ChoTI bAteM karatI rahIM, aura phira kahane lagI--Aja merA khaupha dUra huA hai.
# translit_indicxlit = yeah too 1966 mein jab mein georgia gayee, vahan key shayar shota-rusta valley key aath sou barsi para, too mujhe khaas tour para irakali abashidze key biwi nay apane ghar bulaaya, dubhaashiye key madad say chhoti-chhoti baatein karati raheen, aur fir kahane luggy--aaj mera khauf door hua hai.
# text_en = This was in 1966 when I went to Georgia to celebrate the eight hundredth anniversary of the poet Shota-Rusta Valley, and the wife of the especially Irakli Abashidze called me to her house, and with the help of an interpreter, she kept on talking small things and then said -- Today my fear has been removed.
