# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ak_P2_S92
# text = इसी तरह इस कांफ्रेंस में भी जब हम सब के नाम के बैज हमारे कोटों पर लगाए गए, तो साहिर ने मेरे पास हो कर मेरे कोट से मेरे नाम का बैज उतार लिया, और अपने कोट पर लगा लिया.
# translit_iast = isī taraha isa kāṃphreṃsa meṃ bhī jaba hama saba ke nāma ke baija hamāre koṭoṃ para lagāe gae, to sāhira ne mere pāsa ho kara mere koṭa se mere nāma kā baija utāra liyā, aura apane koṭa para lagā liyā.
# translit_itrans = isI taraha isa kAMphreMsa meM bhI jaba hama saba ke nAma ke baija hamAre koToM para lagAe gae, to sAhira ne mere pAsa ho kara mere koTa se mere nAma kA baija utAra liyA, aura apane koTa para lagA liyA.
# translit_indicxlit = isi tarah iss conference mein bhi jab humm sub key naam key baij hamare coats para lagaae gaye, too sahir nay mere paas how cur mere coat say mere naam kaa baij utaar lia, aur apane coat para lagaa lia.
# text_en = Similarly, at this conference, when we had badges of our names on our coats, Sahir walked up to me, took the badge of my name off my coat and put it on his coat.
