# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ak_P2_S94
# text = . . देविंदर मेरे और साहिर के दोस्त थे, इसलिए एक जगह जहां साहिर और मैं खड़े थे, वह पास आ गए और जाने किस तरह उन की नजर साहिर के कोट पर लगे बैज पर पड़ी, तो कहने लगे--अरे, यह तो अमृता के नाम का बैज है. . . साहिर ने बैज की ओर देखते हुए कहा--यह कांफ्रेंस के जो लोग बैज लगा रहे थे उन्होंने गलती से लगा दिया होगा.
# translit_iast = . . deviṃdara mere aura sāhira ke dosta the, isalie eka jagaha jahāṃ sāhira aura maiṃ khar̤e the, vaha pāsa ā gae aura jāne kisa taraha una kī najara sāhira ke koṭa para lage baija para par̤ī, to kahane lage--are, yaha to amṛtā ke nāma kā baija hai. . . sāhira ne baija kī ora dekhate hue kahā--yaha kāṃphreṃsa ke jo loga baija lagā rahe the unhoṃne galatī se lagā diyā hogā.
# translit_itrans = . . deviMdara mere aura sAhira ke dosta the, isalie eka jagaha jahAM sAhira aura maiM kha.De the, vaha pAsa A gae aura jAne kisa taraha una kI najara sAhira ke koTa para lage baija para pa.DI, to kahane lage--are, yaha to amRRitA ke nAma kA baija hai. . . sAhira ne baija kI ora dekhate hue kahA--yaha kAMphreMsa ke jo loga baija lagA rahe the unhoMne galatI se lagA diyA hogA.
# translit_indicxlit = . . devinder mere aur sahir key dost they, isaliye ack jagah jahaan sahir aur main khade they, wah paas aa gaye aur jaane kiss tarah una key nazar sahir key coat para lagey baij para padi, too kahane lagey--array, yeah too amrita key naam kaa baij hai. . . sahir nay baij key or dekhate hue kahaa--yeah conference key zoo log baij lagaa rahe they unhone galati say lagaa diya hoga.
# text_en = Devinder was friends with me and Sahir, so at a place where Sahir and I were standing, he came near and saw how he was looking at the badge on Sahir's coat and said - " Yes, it is a badge in Amrita's name. "
