# translit_iast = 24 julāī ko mukhyamaṃtrī baṃsīlāla ke gṛhanagara bhivānī meṃ `paṃjāba samajhaute kā eka varṣa pūrā hone para virodhī daloṃ kī `hariyāṇā saṃgharṣa samiti dvārā āyojita aitihāsika āmasabhā ke sātha una ākramaka khela kī pahalī pārī pūrī ho cukī hai, jisakī śuruāta do mahīne pahale baṃsīlāla ne bhivānī meṃ hī kī thī.
# translit_itrans = 24 julAI ko mukhyamaMtrI baMsIlAla ke gRRihanagara bhivAnI meM `paMjAba samajhaute kA eka varSha pUrA hone para virodhI daloM kI `hariyANA saMgharSha samiti dvArA Ayojita aitihAsika AmasabhA ke sAtha una Akramaka khela kI pahalI pArI pUrI ho chukI hai, jisakI shuruAta do mahIne pahale baMsIlAla ne bhivAnI meM hI kI thI.
# translit_indicxlit = 24 julaai coo mukhyamantri bansilal key grihnagar bhiwani mein `punjab samjhaute kaa ack varsh pura honey para virodhi dalon key `haryana sangharsh samiti dwara aayojit aitihaasik aamsabha key saath una aakramak khel key pahali paari puri how chuki hai, jisaki shuruat doe maheene pehle bansilal nay bhiwani mein hee key thee.
