# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot19ac.txt_P2_S1
# text = जब किसी देश का शासक वर्ग देश की किसी ब़ड़ी समस्या का जन्मदाता होता है और जनता के व्यापक हितों की अनदेखी करके उस समस्या को हल करने की बजाए उसे और भी उलझाता है या अपने तुच्छ स्वार्थों की सिद्धि के लिए उसे लटकाए रखता है, तब उस समस्या को हल करने की जिम्मेदारी उस देश की जनता के कंधों पर आ जाती है और प्रकृति के नियम के अनुसार दुनिया में ऐसी कोई समस्या नहीं होती, जिसका समाधान न हो सके, बशर्ते कि आम जनता भी उसमें दिलचस्पी ले और समस्या को गहराई से समझकर उसके हल को खोज निकाले।
# translit_iast = jaba kisī deśa kā śāsaka varga deśa kī kisī ba़r̤ī samasyā kā janmadātā hotā hai aura janatā ke vyāpaka hitoṃ kī anadekhī karake usa samasyā ko hala karane kī bajāe use aura bhī ulajhātā hai yā apane tuccha svārthoṃ kī siddhi ke lie use laṭakāe rakhatā hai, taba usa samasyā ko hala karane kī jimmedārī usa deśa kī janatā ke kaṃdhoṃ para ā jātī hai aura prakṛti ke niyama ke anusāra duniyā meṃ aisī koī samasyā nahīṃ hotī, jisakā samādhāna na ho sake, baśarte ki āma janatā bhī usameṃ dilacaspī le aura samasyā ko gaharāī se samajhakara usake hala ko khoja nikāle|
# translit_itrans = jaba kisI desha kA shAsaka varga desha kI kisI ba़.DI samasyA kA janmadAtA hotA hai aura janatA ke vyApaka hitoM kI anadekhI karake usa samasyA ko hala karane kI bajAe use aura bhI ulajhAtA hai yA apane tuchCha svArthoM kI siddhi ke lie use laTakAe rakhatA hai, taba usa samasyA ko hala karane kI jimmedArI usa desha kI janatA ke kaMdhoM para A jAtI hai aura prakRRiti ke niyama ke anusAra duniyA meM aisI koI samasyA nahIM hotI, jisakA samAdhAna na ho sake, basharte ki Ama janatA bhI usameM dilachaspI le aura samasyA ko gaharAI se samajhakara usake hala ko khoja nikAle|
# translit_indicxlit = jab kissy desh kaa shaasak varg desh key kissy badee samasya kaa janmadaata hota hai aur janata key vyaapak hiton key andekhi karke usa samasya coo hall karane key bajaaye use aur bhi ulajhaata hai yaa apane tuchchh swaarthon key siddhi key lie use latakaae rakhta hai, tab usa samasya coo hall karane key jimmedaari usa desh key janata key kandhon para aa jaati hai aur prakriti key niyam key anusaar duniya mein aisee koi samasya nahin hoti, jiska samadhan naa how sake, basharte kii aam janata bhi usamen dilchaspi lay aur samasya coo gaharaai say samajhkar usake hall coo khoj nikaale.
# text_en = When the ruling class of a country is the originator of a major problem in the country and instead of solving it by ignoring the larger interests of the people, it complicates the problem further or keeps it hanging for the accomplishment of its own petty interests, then the responsibility of solving that problem falls on the shoulders of the people of that country and according to the law of nature, there is no problem in the world which cannot be solved, provided the general public also takes an interest in it and understands the problem deeply and finds its solution.
