# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot19ac.txt_P2_S7
# text = इसी उद्देश्य से पिछले दिनों क्रांतिकारी स्मारक समिति, उत्तर प्रदेश के तत्त्वावधान में जनता के विभिन्न तबकों के नेताओं, बुद्धिजीवियों, लेखकों और कलाकारों का एक जत्था 13 अप्रैल को अमृतसर गया, जहां उसने जलियावाला बाग के शहीदों को श्रद्धांजलि अर्पित की और सिखों की विभिन्न संस्थाओं के प्रतिनिधियों तथा बुद्धिजीवियों से पंजाब समस्या के सभी पहलुओं पर बातचीत की।
# translit_iast = isī uddeśya se pichale dinoṃ krāṃtikārī smāraka samiti, uttara pradeśa ke tattvāvadhāna meṃ janatā ke vibhinna tabakoṃ ke netāoṃ, buddhijīviyoṃ, lekhakoṃ aura kalākāroṃ kā eka jatthā 13 apraila ko amṛtasara gayā, jahāṃ usane jaliyāvālā bāga ke śahīdoṃ ko śraddhāṃjali arpita kī aura sikhoṃ kī vibhinna saṃsthāoṃ ke pratinidhiyoṃ tathā buddhijīviyoṃ se paṃjāba samasyā ke sabhī pahaluoṃ para bātacīta kī|
# translit_itrans = isI uddeshya se piChale dinoM krAMtikArI smAraka samiti, uttara pradesha ke tattvAvadhAna meM janatA ke vibhinna tabakoM ke netAoM, buddhijIviyoM, lekhakoM aura kalAkAroM kA eka jatthA 13 apraila ko amRRitasara gayA, jahAM usane jaliyAvAlA bAga ke shahIdoM ko shraddhAMjali arpita kI aura sikhoM kI vibhinna saMsthAoM ke pratinidhiyoM tathA buddhijIviyoM se paMjAba samasyA ke sabhI pahaluoM para bAtachIta kI|
# translit_indicxlit = isi uddeshya say pichhale dino krantikari smaarak samiti, utter pradesh key tattvavadhan mein janata key vibhinn tabakon key netaaon, buddhijiviyon, lekhakon aur kalakaron kaa ack jattha 13 aprail coo amritsar gaya, jahaan usane jaliawala baag key shahidon coo shraddhanjali arpit key aur sikhon key vibhinn sansthaon key pratinidhiyon tathaa buddhijiviyon say punjab samasya key sabhi pahaluon para baatchit key.
# text_en = With this objective, a group of leaders, intellectuals, writers and artists from different sections of the people under the aegis of Krantikari Smarak Samiti, Uttar Pradesh, visited Amritsar on 13 April where they paid homage to the martyrs of Jallianwala Bagh and interacted with representatives of various Sikh bodies and intellectuals on all aspects of the Punjab problem.
