# text = इस प्रश्न पर उत्पादकों का कहना है सरकार अगर 335(प्रति टिन 15 किलोग्राम) के नियंत्रित मूल्य पर ही वनस्पति बिकवाना चाहती है तो उसे आयातित खाद्य तेलों का रेगुलर कोटा कुल जरुरत का कम से कम 65 प्रतिशत करना चाहिए तथा 20 प्रतिशत कामर्शियल(ऐच्छिक) लेकिन 50-20 के मौजूदा कोटे पर 350-355 रुपए तो उत्पादन लागत बैठ रही है।
# translit_iast = isa praśna para utpādakoṃ kā kahanā hai sarakāra agara 335(prati ṭina 15 kilogrāma) ke niyaṃtrita mūlya para hī vanaspati bikavānā cāhatī hai to use āyātita khādya teloṃ kā regulara koṭā kula jarurata kā kama se kama 65 pratiśata karanā cāhie tathā 20 pratiśata kāmarśiyala(aicchika) lekina 50-20 ke maujūdā koṭe para 350-355 rupae to utpādana lāgata baiṭha rahī hai|
# translit_itrans = isa prashna para utpAdakoM kA kahanA hai sarakAra agara 335(prati Tina 15 kilogrAma) ke niyaMtrita mUlya para hI vanaspati bikavAnA chAhatI hai to use AyAtita khAdya teloM kA regulara koTA kula jarurata kA kama se kama 65 pratishata karanA chAhie tathA 20 pratishata kAmarshiyala(aichChika) lekina 50-20 ke maujUdA koTe para 350-355 rupae to utpAdana lAgata baiTha rahI hai|
# translit_indicxlit = iss prashn para utpadakon kaa kahana hai sarkar agar 335(prati tinn 15 kilogram) key niyantrit moolya para hee vanaspati bikwana chaahati hai too use aayatit khaadya telon kaa regular kota kula jarurat kaa cum say cum 65 pratishat karna chaahiye tathaa 20 pratishat commercial(aichhik) lekin 50-20 key maujooda kote para 350-355 rupaye too utpaadan laagat baith rahee hai.
# text_en = To this question, the growers say that if the government wants to sell the vegetable at a controlled price of Rs 335 ( 15 kg per tin ), it should increase the regular quota of imported edible oils to at least 65 per cent of the total requirement and 20 per cent commercial ( optional ) but at the current quota of Rs 50-20, the cost of production is Rs 350-355.
