# text = स्त्रियां इस क्षेत्र मे दो कदम आगे ही है अपने यौवन काल मे प्रविष्ट होते ही मैने भावी जीवन मे बड़ी बहू बनने के ही सपने संयोजे थे,सो ईश्वर की कृपा से मुझे वही दर्जा मिला ससुराल के आंगन मे उतरते ही मुझे यह अहसास कराया गया कि तुम घर की बड़ी बहू हो।
# translit_iast = striyāṃ isa kṣetra me do kadama āge hī hai apane yauvana kāla me praviṣṭa hote hī maine bhāvī jīvana me bar̤ī bahū banane ke hī sapane saṃyoje the,so īśvara kī kṛpā se mujhe vahī darjā milā sasurāla ke āṃgana me utarate hī mujhe yaha ahasāsa karāyā gayā ki tuma ghara kī bar̤ī bahū ho|
# translit_itrans = striyAM isa kShetra me do kadama Age hI hai apane yauvana kAla me praviShTa hote hI maine bhAvI jIvana me ba.DI bahU banane ke hI sapane saMyoje the,so Ishvara kI kRRipA se mujhe vahI darjA milA sasurAla ke AMgana me utarate hI mujhe yaha ahasAsa karAyA gayA ki tuma ghara kI ba.DI bahU ho|
# translit_indicxlit = striyaan iss kshetra may doe kadam age hee hai apane yauvan call may pravisht hote hee maine bhaavi jeevan may badee bahu banane key hee sapane sanyoje they,soo ishwar key kripa say mujhe vahee darja milaa sasural key aangan may utarate hee mujhe yeah ahsas karaaya gaya kii tum ghar key badee bahu how.
# text_en = Women are two steps ahead in this field. As soon as I entered my youth, I had dreams of becoming a big daughter-in-law in future life. So by the grace of God, I got the same status. As soon as I entered the in-laws'courtyard, I was made to feel that you are the big daughter-in-law of the house.
