# translit_itrans = parantu ina a.Dachano ko dUra karane me merI mAM kI dI huI shikShA kAma AI ki la.Dakiyo ko sasurAla me jAkara apane-Apako kuCha badalanA bhI pa.De to dukhI na honA chAhie aura apanI sabhI jimmedAriyo ko bakhUbI nibAhanA chAhie|
# translit_indicxlit = parantu inn adchano coo door karane may merry maan key dee hui shiksha kaam aai kii ladakiyo coo sasural may jaakar apane-aapko kuchha badalana bhi padey too dukhi naa honah chaahiye aur apni sabhi jimmedariyo coo bakhubi nibahana chaahiye.
# text_en = But my mother's teaching came in handy to overcome these obstacles : girls should not be unhappy if they have to go to their in-laws'house and change something and should handle all their responsibilities well.
