# translit_itrans = Aja taka kisI taraha kI pareshAnI nahIM huI merI apekShAeM kuCha bhI nahIM haiM, kyoMki shurU se hI sabhI ichChAeM mere vinA kahe pUrI hotI rahI haiM apekShAeM to vahIM kI jAtI haiM, jahAM ApasI vyavahAra meM sAmaMjasya na ho aura kisI chIja kA abhAva ho|
# translit_indicxlit = aaj tuck kissy tarah key pareshani nahin hui merry apekshaaen kuchha bhi nahin hain, kyonki shuru say hee sabhi ichchhaaen mere vinaa kahey puri hoti rahee hain apekshaaen too vaheen key jaati hain, jahaan aapsi vyavhaar mein samanjasya naa how aur kissy cheese kaa abhaav how.
