# translit_indicxlit = shashi bhatnagar ae.jee.office may kaaryarat shree matee shashi bhatnagar nay apni nanad kii vidaa key taiyariyon may vyast hote hue bhi mere prashno key jawab dete hue kahaa, iss prakaar key bhavna kii mai kissy ghar key badee bahu banoon, mere dimag may kabhi nahi thee, kintu sayog say jab usa pada para locker khadaa cur diya gaya too kissy bhi prakaar key kathinaaee mahsoos nahin hui.
