# translit_indicxlit = pichhale dino slark key neta general sha maang nay rakshaamantri kaa apna pada chhod diya hai aur adhikatar paryavekshakon kaa anuman hai kii shuru mein hee sainik shasson kaa netritva karate aa rahe 63 varsheeya general maang nay avkash grahan karane key taiyari shuru cur dee hai kyonki udhar unakaa swaasthya bhi kuchha kharab rahane lagaa hai.
