# text_en = In these huts, full of old men, children, women and the sick, they may not feel the sunshine, but when the air temperature goes above 43 ° C at the third hour of the day, their condition becomes like boiling rice in a handi, but these people who have escaped tyranny and oppression feel less of all these problems.
