# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18d_P2_S17
# text = आयोग को सहायता दे रही थी श्रीमती गांधी की हत्या की जांच कर रही आनंदराम टीम लगभग 200 गवाहियां, हजारों पृष्ठों तक फैले दस्तावेजों, बीसियों दर्जनों फाइलों के बीच से गुजरते हुए आयोग ने अपनी लगभग 300 पृष्ठों की पहली रिपोर्ट 19 नवंबर, 1985 को पेश की और दूसरी रिपोर्ट 27 फरवरी 1986 को. आयोग की दोनों रिपोर्ट चूंकि गोपनीय हैं और फिलहाल उनके सार्वजनिक बनाये जाने का कोई प्रश्न भी नहीं है.
# translit_iast = āyoga ko sahāyatā de rahī thī śrīmatī gāṃdhī kī hatyā kī jāṃca kara rahī ānaṃdarāma ṭīma lagabhaga 200 gavāhiyāṃ, hajāroṃ pṛṣṭhoṃ taka phaile dastāvejoṃ, bīsiyoṃ darjanoṃ phāiloṃ ke bīca se gujarate hue āyoga ne apanī lagabhaga 300 pṛṣṭhoṃ kī pahalī riporṭa 19 navaṃbara, 1985 ko peśa kī aura dūsarī riporṭa 27 pharavarī 1986 ko. āyoga kī donoṃ riporṭa cūṃki gopanīya haiṃ aura philahāla unake sārvajanika banāye jāne kā koī praśna bhī nahīṃ hai.
# translit_itrans = Ayoga ko sahAyatA de rahI thI shrImatI gAMdhI kI hatyA kI jAMcha kara rahI AnaMdarAma TIma lagabhaga 200 gavAhiyAM, hajAroM pRRiShThoM taka phaile dastAvejoM, bIsiyoM darjanoM phAiloM ke bIcha se gujarate hue Ayoga ne apanI lagabhaga 300 pRRiShThoM kI pahalI riporTa 19 navaMbara, 1985 ko pesha kI aura dUsarI riporTa 27 pharavarI 1986 ko. Ayoga kI donoM riporTa chUMki gopanIya haiM aura philahAla unake sArvajanika banAye jAne kA koI prashna bhI nahIM hai.
# translit_indicxlit = aayog coo sahaayata dei rahee thee shrimati gandhi key hatyaa key jaanch cur rahee anandram team lagbhag 200 gavaahiyaan, hajaaron prishthon tuck faile dastavejon, beesiyon darjanon files key beach say gujarate hue aayog nay apni lagbhag 300 prishthon key pahali report 19 november, 1985 coo pesh key aur doosri report 27 farwari 1986 coo. aayog key dono report choonki gopaniya hain aur filhal unake saarvajanik banaye jaane kaa koi prashn bhi nahin hai.
# text_en = The Commission was assisted by the Anandram team investigating the assassination of Mrs Gandhi, which went through nearly 200 witnesses and documents running into thousands of pages and passing through twenty-two files, submitted its first report of nearly 300 pages on 19 November 1985 and the second report on 27 February 1986. Both the reports of the Commission are confidential and there is no question of making them public at present.
