# translit_indicxlit = samvedana key talash mein anaadi say bhatakane waali naari apane prati, vyangya, katuta aur avishvaas say, apni maryada bhool baithati hai aur tab akasmaat usake bheetar say ack aisee nagin kaa gadurbhaav hota hai, zoo jeevan key pran coo dansati hai, aur chhatpataate manushya key karaah coo, been marker, kundli maare fafukaarati rahati hai.
