# text = पांच-छह दिन तक शहर में अखबारों के माध्यम से बघेरे का आतंक फैलता रहा, घना प्रशासन की सतर्कता और बघेरे की हिंसा की खबरें छपती रहीं, पर घना के 29 वर्ग किलोमीटर क्षेत्र में वन विभाग के 150 से अधिक कर्मचारी उस बघेरे को ढूंढ कर नहीं मार सके और वह बघेरा सैकड़ों जानवरों की हत्या करके स्वयं ही गायब हो गया।
# translit_iast = pāṃca-chaha dina taka śahara meṃ akhabāroṃ ke mādhyama se baghere kā ātaṃka phailatā rahā, ghanā praśāsana kī satarkatā aura baghere kī hiṃsā kī khabareṃ chapatī rahīṃ, para ghanā ke 29 varga kilomīṭara kṣetra meṃ vana vibhāga ke 150 se adhika karmacārī usa baghere ko ḍhūṃḍha kara nahīṃ māra sake aura vaha bagherā saikar̤oṃ jānavaroṃ kī hatyā karake svayaṃ hī gāyaba ho gayā|
# translit_itrans = pAMcha-Chaha dina taka shahara meM akhabAroM ke mAdhyama se baghere kA AtaMka phailatA rahA, ghanA prashAsana kI satarkatA aura baghere kI hiMsA kI khabareM ChapatI rahIM, para ghanA ke 29 varga kilomITara kShetra meM vana vibhAga ke 150 se adhika karmachArI usa baghere ko DhUMDha kara nahIM mAra sake aura vaha bagherA saika.DoM jAnavaroM kI hatyA karake svayaM hI gAyaba ho gayA|
# translit_indicxlit = panch-chhah dinn tuck shahar mein akhbaaron key madhyam say baghere kaa aatank failata raha, ghanaa prashaasan key satarkata aur baghere key hinsa key khabaren chhapati raheen, para ghanaa key 29 varg kilometres kshetra mein wana vibhaag key 150 say adhik karmachari usa baghere coo dhoondh cur nahin maar sake aur wah baghera saikadon jaanvaron key hatyaa karke swayam hee gayab how gaya.
# text_en = For five-six days, the tiger terror spread through newspapers in the city ; reports of vigilance of the Ghana administration and tiger violence were published ; but over 150 forest department personnel in a 29 square kilometer area of Ghana could not find and kill the tiger and the tiger disappeared on its own after killing hundreds of animals.
