# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot20an_P2_S103
# text = ऐसे में जब अभयारण्यों में पेड़ लगातार कट रहे हों, जानवरों की संख्या कम हो रही है, कर्मचारियों और अधिकारियों की संख्या के साथ-साथ विभाग का बजट बढ़ता जा रहा हो, अधिकारियों और कर्मचारियों की लापरवाही तथा मिलीभगत का जंगलराज चल रहा हो, सुदृढ़ प्रशासन के कागजी दावे किये जा रहे हों, वन-कर्मियों का लक्ष्य पर्यावरण सुरक्षा न होकर बंगलों,कारों और बैंक बैलेंसों में निहित हो, तो यही सिद्ध होता है कि यह अभयारण्य जानवरों के लिए नहीं बल्कि अफसरों के लिए है और राज्य सरकार उनके इस खुले खेल को अनदेखा कर रही है।
# translit_iast = aise meṃ jaba abhayāraṇyoṃ meṃ per̤a lagātāra kaṭa rahe hoṃ, jānavaroṃ kī saṃkhyā kama ho rahī hai, karmacāriyoṃ aura adhikāriyoṃ kī saṃkhyā ke sātha-sātha vibhāga kā bajaṭa bar̤hatā jā rahā ho, adhikāriyoṃ aura karmacāriyoṃ kī lāparavāhī tathā milībhagata kā jaṃgalarāja cala rahā ho, sudṛr̤ha praśāsana ke kāgajī dāve kiye jā rahe hoṃ, vana-karmiyoṃ kā lakṣya paryāvaraṇa surakṣā na hokara baṃgaloṃ,kāroṃ aura baiṃka baileṃsoṃ meṃ nihita ho, to yahī siddha hotā hai ki yaha abhayāraṇya jānavaroṃ ke lie nahīṃ balki aphasaroṃ ke lie hai aura rājya sarakāra unake isa khule khela ko anadekhā kara rahī hai|
# translit_itrans = aise meM jaba abhayAraNyoM meM pe.Da lagAtAra kaTa rahe hoM, jAnavaroM kI saMkhyA kama ho rahI hai, karmachAriyoM aura adhikAriyoM kI saMkhyA ke sAtha-sAtha vibhAga kA bajaTa ba.DhatA jA rahA ho, adhikAriyoM aura karmachAriyoM kI lAparavAhI tathA milIbhagata kA jaMgalarAja chala rahA ho, sudRRi.Dha prashAsana ke kAgajI dAve kiye jA rahe hoM, vana-karmiyoM kA lakShya paryAvaraNa surakShA na hokara baMgaloM,kAroM aura baiMka baileMsoM meM nihita ho, to yahI siddha hotA hai ki yaha abhayAraNya jAnavaroM ke lie nahIM balki aphasaroM ke lie hai aura rAjya sarakAra unake isa khule khela ko anadekhA kara rahI hai|
# translit_indicxlit = aise mein jab abhayaranyon mein paid lagaatar cut rahe hone, jaanvaron key sankhya cum how rahee hai, karmchaariyon aur adhikaariyon key sankhya key saath-saath vibhaag kaa bajat badhata jaa raha how, adhikaariyon aur karmchaariyon key laparwahi tathaa milibhagat kaa jangalraj chal raha how, sudridh prashaasan key kagji daave kiye jaa rahe hone, wana-karmiyon kaa lakshya paryaavaran suraksha naa hocker bungles,kaaron aur bank balances mein nihit how, too yahee siddha hota hai kii yeah abhayaranya jaanvaron key lie nahin bulky afsaron key lie hai aur rajya sarkar unake iss khule khel coo andekha cur rahee hai.
# text_en = In such a situation, when the number of animals in the sanctuaries is continuously decreasing, the budget of the department is increasing along with the number of employees and officers, the jungle raj of negligence and collusion of the officials and employees is going on, paper claims of strong administration are being made, and the goal of the forest-workers is not environmental protection but to settle in bungalows and bank balances, then it is proved that this sanctuary is not for the animals but for the officers and the state government is ignoring this open game of theirs.
