# translit_indicxlit = savdhani cassie! london kaa khufiya daftar too chaahata hee yeah tha kii kissy naa kissy prakaar yeah yuddh-naksha germany key jasuson key haath lug jaye aur wah use germany bheja den, taaki vahan vaalon coo yakeen how jaye kii mitrashaktiyan narmandi mein nahin, bulky halland mein apni senaaen utaarane key taiyariyan cur rahee hain.
