# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot19at.txt_P2_S99
# text = आज अमेरिका में उपभोक्ता संस्थाओं के कामों की देखरेख करती है, बीसियों पत्रिकाएं ग्राहकों को हर तरह के नये सामान के गुणों के बारे में बताती है. . अमरिका की उपभोक्ता संस्थाएं ग्राहक आंदोलन को मजबूत बनाने में काफी सफल हुई है, इस क्षेत्र के विशेषज्ञ जैफरी बेरी का कहना है कि ये संस्थाएं नीतियां बनाने वाले सरकारी कर्मचारियों के आसपास का वातावरण बदलने की कोशिश करती है.
# translit_iast = āja amerikā meṃ upabhoktā saṃsthāoṃ ke kāmoṃ kī dekharekha karatī hai, bīsiyoṃ patrikāeṃ grāhakoṃ ko hara taraha ke naye sāmāna ke guṇoṃ ke bāre meṃ batātī hai. . amarikā kī upabhoktā saṃsthāeṃ grāhaka āṃdolana ko majabūta banāne meṃ kāphī saphala huī hai, isa kṣetra ke viśeṣajña jaipharī berī kā kahanā hai ki ye saṃsthāeṃ nītiyāṃ banāne vāle sarakārī karmacāriyoṃ ke āsapāsa kā vātāvaraṇa badalane kī kośiśa karatī hai.
# translit_itrans = Aja amerikA meM upabhoktA saMsthAoM ke kAmoM kI dekharekha karatI hai, bIsiyoM patrikAeM grAhakoM ko hara taraha ke naye sAmAna ke guNoM ke bAre meM batAtI hai. . amarikA kI upabhoktA saMsthAeM grAhaka AMdolana ko majabUta banAne meM kAphI saphala huI hai, isa kShetra ke visheShaj~na jaipharI berI kA kahanA hai ki ye saMsthAeM nItiyAM banAne vAle sarakArI karmachAriyoM ke AsapAsa kA vAtAvaraNa badalane kI koshisha karatI hai.
# translit_indicxlit = aaj america mein upabhokta sansthaon key kaamon key dekhrekh karati hai, beesiyon patrikaaen grahakon coo hear tarah key naye saman key gunon key baare mein bataati hai. . amrika key upabhokta sansthaaen graahak andolan coo majboot banaane mein kaafee safal hui hai, iss kshetra key visheshagya jaffery berry kaa kahana hai kii yeye sansthaaen neetiyaan banaane waale sarkari karmchaariyon key aspas kaa vatavaran badalane key koshish karati hai.
# text_en = Today, consumer organizations in the United States oversee the work of twenty-two magazines that tell consumers about the merits of every new product. American consumer organizations have been very successful in strengthening the consumer movement. Jeffrey Berry, an expert in this field, says that these organizations try to change the environment around government employees who make policies.
