# text = डाक विभाग को अलग करने का उद्देश्य यही है कि इसे सरकार व्यावसायिक आधार पर चलाना चाहती है और इसके लिए पूँजीवादी बाजार की शर्तो के अनुसार मशीनीकरण, डाक सेवा दर में वृद्धि जैसे उपायों के लिए तैयार है।
# translit_iast = ḍāka vibhāga ko alaga karane kā uddeśya yahī hai ki ise sarakāra vyāvasāyika ādhāra para calānā cāhatī hai aura isake lie pū~jīvādī bājāra kī śarto ke anusāra maśīnīkaraṇa, ḍāka sevā dara meṃ vṛddhi jaise upāyoṃ ke lie taiyāra hai|
# translit_itrans = DAka vibhAga ko alaga karane kA uddeshya yahI hai ki ise sarakAra vyAvasAyika AdhAra para chalAnA chAhatI hai aura isake lie pU.NjIvAdI bAjAra kI sharto ke anusAra mashInIkaraNa, DAka sevA dara meM vRRiddhi jaise upAyoM ke lie taiyAra hai|
# translit_indicxlit = dock vibhaag coo alag karane kaa uddeshya yahee hai kii ise sarkar vyaavsaayik aadhar para chalaana chaahati hai aur isake lie poonjivaadi bazar key sharto key anusaar mashinikaran, dock seva darr mein vriddhi jaise upaayon key lie taiyar hai.
# text_en = The purpose of separating the postal department is that the government wants to run it on a commercial basis and is ready for measures like mechanization and increase in postal service rate according to the conditions of the capitalist market.
