# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot20a_P2_S34
# text = यह कहना सही है कि डाक विभाग का आधुनिकीकरण होना चाहिए लेकिन बगैर किसी योजना के जिस तरह आधुनिकरण के नाम पर कम्प्यूटरी-~ करण या मशीनीकरण का माहौल बनाया जा रहा है, उससे मजदूरों में बेचैनी बढ़ रही है और उनकी यूनियनों ने इसका विरोध करना शुरू कर दिया है।
# translit_iast = yaha kahanā sahī hai ki ḍāka vibhāga kā ādhunikīkaraṇa honā cāhie lekina bagaira kisī yojanā ke jisa taraha ādhunikaraṇa ke nāma para kampyūṭarī-~ karaṇa yā maśīnīkaraṇa kā māhaula banāyā jā rahā hai, usase majadūroṃ meṃ becainī bar̤ha rahī hai aura unakī yūniyanoṃ ne isakā virodha karanā śurū kara diyā hai|
# translit_itrans = yaha kahanA sahI hai ki DAka vibhAga kA AdhunikIkaraNa honA chAhie lekina bagaira kisI yojanA ke jisa taraha AdhunikaraNa ke nAma para kampyUTarI-~ karaNa yA mashInIkaraNa kA mAhaula banAyA jA rahA hai, usase majadUroM meM bechainI ba.Dha rahI hai aura unakI yUniyanoM ne isakA virodha karanA shurU kara diyA hai|
# translit_indicxlit = yeah kahana sahi hai kii dock vibhaag kaa aadhunikikaran honah chaahiye lekin bugger kissy yojana key jis tarah aadhunikaran key naam para computery-~ karann yaa mashinikaran kaa mahaul banaaya jaa raha hai, usase majdooron mein bechaini badha rahee hai aur unaki unions nay iska virodh karna shuru cur diya hai.
# text_en = It is true that the postal department should be modernized, but the way the environment of computerization or mechanization is being created in the name of modernization without any plan, is increasing the discontent among the workers and their unions have started opposing it.
