# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot20ao_P2_S5
# text = महाराष्ट्र में शिवसेना-भाजपा से मोर्चा लेने का दम भरते शरद पवार, गुजरात में खुद अपनी ही पार्टी के असंतुष्टों से मोर्चा लेते अमर सिंह चौधरी , राजस्थान में जोशी और पहाड़िया समर्थकों का हमला झेलते शिवचरण माथुर, मध्य प्रदेश में मोतीलाल वोरा से लेकर उड़ीसा के जानकी बल्लभ पटनायक तक सात मुख्यमंत्रियों की इस सूची में शायद ही कोई हो जिस पर शंकासंदेह और असंतोष का ग्रहण न लगता रहा हो।
# translit_iast = mahārāṣṭra meṃ śivasenā-bhājapā se morcā lene kā dama bharate śarada pavāra, gujarāta meṃ khuda apanī hī pārṭī ke asaṃtuṣṭoṃ se morcā lete amara siṃha caudharī , rājasthāna meṃ jośī aura pahār̤iyā samarthakoṃ kā hamalā jhelate śivacaraṇa māthura, madhya pradeśa meṃ motīlāla vorā se lekara ur̤īsā ke jānakī ballabha paṭanāyaka taka sāta mukhyamaṃtriyoṃ kī isa sūcī meṃ śāyada hī koī ho jisa para śaṃkāsaṃdeha aura asaṃtoṣa kā grahaṇa na lagatā rahā ho|
# translit_itrans = mahArAShTra meM shivasenA-bhAjapA se morchA lene kA dama bharate sharada pavAra, gujarAta meM khuda apanI hI pArTI ke asaMtuShToM se morchA lete amara siMha chaudharI , rAjasthAna meM joshI aura pahA.DiyA samarthakoM kA hamalA jhelate shivacharaNa mAthura, madhya pradesha meM motIlAla vorA se lekara u.DIsA ke jAnakI ballabha paTanAyaka taka sAta mukhyamaMtriyoM kI isa sUchI meM shAyada hI koI ho jisa para shaMkAsaMdeha aura asaMtoSha kA grahaNa na lagatA rahA ho|
# translit_indicxlit = maharashtra mein shivsena-bhajpa say morcha lene kaa dum bharate shared pavaar, gujarat mein khud apni hee party key asantushton say morcha lete amar singh chaudhari , rajasthan mein joshi aur pahaadiya samarthakon kaa hamla jhelate shivcharan mathur, madhya pradesh mein motilal vora say lakers udeesaa key jaanaki ballabh patnayak tuck saat mukhyamantriyon key iss soochi mein shayed hee koi how jis para shankasandeh aur asantosh kaa grahan naa lagata raha how.
# text_en = From Sharad Pawar, who is banking on a Shiv Sena-BJP alliance in Maharashtra ; Amar Singh Chaudhary, who is taking on his own party dissidents in Gujarat ; Shiv Charan Mathur, who is under attack from Joshi and Pahadia supporters in Rajasthan ; and Motilal Vora in Madhya Pradesh to Janaki Ballabh Patnaik in Orissa, there is hardly anyone in this list of seven chief ministers who has not been receiving the heat of suspicion and discontent.
