# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot20ao_P2_S19
# text = इनमें से किसी भी मुख्यमंत्री के जरी सा भी स्थापित होते ही खुद कांग्रेसियों द्वारा उसके खिलाफ आरोपों की भरमार शुरू कर देना, असंतुष्ट गतिविधियों को दिल्ली से संरक्षण मिलना शुरू हो जाना, क्या प्रधानमंत्री के इर्द-गिर्द बैठे सलाहकारों की आपनी प्रतिद्वंदिता का नतीजा भर है या यह सब कुछ खुद राजीव गांधी के अपने असुरक्षाबोध के चलते अपनायी, सोची-समझी केंद्रीय रणनीति का हिस्सा है ?
# translit_iast = inameṃ se kisī bhī mukhyamaṃtrī ke jarī sā bhī sthāpita hote hī khuda kāṃgresiyoṃ dvārā usake khilāpha āropoṃ kī bharamāra śurū kara denā, asaṃtuṣṭa gatividhiyoṃ ko dillī se saṃrakṣaṇa milanā śurū ho jānā, kyā pradhānamaṃtrī ke irda-girda baiṭhe salāhakāroṃ kī āpanī pratidvaṃditā kā natījā bhara hai yā yaha saba kucha khuda rājīva gāṃdhī ke apane asurakṣābodha ke calate apanāyī, socī-samajhī keṃdrīya raṇanīti kā hissā hai ?
# translit_itrans = inameM se kisI bhI mukhyamaMtrI ke jarI sA bhI sthApita hote hI khuda kAMgresiyoM dvArA usake khilApha AropoM kI bharamAra shurU kara denA, asaMtuShTa gatividhiyoM ko dillI se saMrakShaNa milanA shurU ho jAnA, kyA pradhAnamaMtrI ke irda-girda baiThe salAhakAroM kI ApanI pratidvaMditA kA natIjA bhara hai yA yaha saba kuCha khuda rAjIva gAMdhI ke apane asurakShAbodha ke chalate apanAyI, sochI-samajhI keMdrIya raNanIti kA hissA hai ?
# translit_indicxlit = inmein say kissy bhi mukhyamantri key jaree sha bhi sthaapit hote hee khud congressies dwara usake khilaf aaropon key bharmar shuru cur denaa, asantusht gatividhiyon coo dilly say sanrakshan milna shuru how jaanaa, kya pradhaanmantri key ird-gird baithe salaahkaaron key aapani pratidvandita kaa natija bhar hai yaa yeah sub kuchha khud rajeev gandhi key apane asurakshabodh key chalte apanaayi, sochi-samajhi kendriya ranneeti kaa hissa hai ?
# text_en = The Congressmen themselves, as soon as any of these chief ministers were installed, started making a barrage of accusations against him, and dissident activities began to receive patronage from Delhi.
