# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot20ao_P2_S54
# text = पर मोटे तौर पर दोनों ही पक्ष(शरद पवार पर शक करने औऱ शक ने करने वाले) इससे सहमत हैं कि इस पूरे घटनाक्रम औऱ एपनी केरयशैली से शरद पवार ने महाराष्ट्र में अपनी एक ज्यादा मजबूत और क्षेत्रीय स्वाफामान को बल देने वाली छवि बनायी है, जिसका कांग्रेस को ही एतिरिक्त लाभ मिलेगा।
# translit_iast = para moṭe taura para donoṃ hī pakṣa(śarada pavāra para śaka karane auṟa śaka ne karane vāle) isase sahamata haiṃ ki isa pūre ghaṭanākrama auṟa epanī kerayaśailī se śarada pavāra ne mahārāṣṭra meṃ apanī eka jyādā majabūta aura kṣetrīya svāphāmāna ko bala dene vālī chavi banāyī hai, jisakā kāṃgresa ko hī etirikta lābha milegā|
# translit_itrans = para moTe taura para donoM hI pakSha(sharada pavAra para shaka karane auRa shaka ne karane vAle) isase sahamata haiM ki isa pUre ghaTanAkrama auRa epanI kerayashailI se sharada pavAra ne mahArAShTra meM apanI eka jyAdA majabUta aura kShetrIya svAphAmAna ko bala dene vAlI Chavi banAyI hai, jisakA kAMgresa ko hI etirikta lAbha milegA|
# translit_indicxlit = para mote tour para dono hee paksh(shared pavaar para shuck karane auay shuck nay karane waale) isase sahmat hain kii iss pure ghatanakram auay apney kerayashaili say shared pavaar nay maharashtra mein apni ack zyada majboot aur kshetriya swafaman coo ball dene waali chhavi banaayi hai, jiska congress coo hee etirikt laabh milega.
# text_en = But broadly, both sides ( those who doubt and doubt Sharad Pawar ) agree that with this whole episode and his style of functioning, Sharad Pawar has built a stronger and more regional-oriented image in Maharashtra, which will only benefit the Congress.
