# text = उन्होंने चिकित्सा करना इसलिये छोड़ दिया था, क्योंकि उन्होने देखा कि वे और अन्य चिकित्सक जिस विधि से रोगियों की चिकित्सा करते हैं उनका कोई सिद्धान्त नहीं है और वह अमानवीय होने के साथ ही अनैतिक भी हैं, क्योंकि उससे एक रोग ठीक होता है तो दूसरा हो जाता है।
# translit_iast = unhoṃne cikitsā karanā isaliye chor̤a diyā thā, kyoṃki unhone dekhā ki ve aura anya cikitsaka jisa vidhi se rogiyoṃ kī cikitsā karate haiṃ unakā koī siddhānta nahīṃ hai aura vaha amānavīya hone ke sātha hī anaitika bhī haiṃ, kyoṃki usase eka roga ṭhīka hotā hai to dūsarā ho jātā hai|
# translit_itrans = unhoMne chikitsA karanA isaliye Cho.Da diyA thA, kyoMki unhone dekhA ki ve aura anya chikitsaka jisa vidhi se rogiyoM kI chikitsA karate haiM unakA koI siddhAnta nahIM hai aura vaha amAnavIya hone ke sAtha hI anaitika bhI haiM, kyoMki usase eka roga ThIka hotA hai to dUsarA ho jAtA hai|
# translit_indicxlit = unhone chikitsa karna isaliye chhod diya tha, kyonki unhone dekhaa kii way aur any chikitsak jis vidhi say rogiyon key chikitsa karate hain unakaa koi siddhaant nahin hai aur wah amanviya honey key saath hee anaitik bhi hain, kyonki usase ack roga theek hota hai too doosra how jaataa hai.
# text_en = He had given up medicine because he saw that the methods by which he and other physicians treated patients had no principle and were inhuman as well as immoral, since they cured one disease and caused another.
