# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot20am_P2_S22
# text = बीस मई, 1887 को वोरा ने तत्कालीन प्रदेशाध्यक्ष दिग्विजय सिंह को पत्र लिखा कि वे अतिक्रमण हटाने तथा भवन निर्माण के लिए जिलाधिकारी के सम्मुख आवेदन देने और नक्शे के आधार पर नापजोख कराकर अतिक्रमण हटाने की कार्रवाई के लिए किसी पदाधिकारी को निर्देशित करें।
# translit_iast = bīsa maī, 1887 ko vorā ne tatkālīna pradeśādhyakṣa digvijaya siṃha ko patra likhā ki ve atikramaṇa haṭāne tathā bhavana nirmāṇa ke lie jilādhikārī ke sammukha āvedana dene aura nakśe ke ādhāra para nāpajokha karākara atikramaṇa haṭāne kī kārravāī ke lie kisī padādhikārī ko nirdeśita kareṃ|
# translit_itrans = bIsa maI, 1887 ko vorA ne tatkAlIna pradeshAdhyakSha digvijaya siMha ko patra likhA ki ve atikramaNa haTAne tathA bhavana nirmANa ke lie jilAdhikArI ke sammukha Avedana dene aura nakshe ke AdhAra para nApajokha karAkara atikramaNa haTAne kI kArravAI ke lie kisI padAdhikArI ko nirdeshita kareM|
# translit_indicxlit = bees maee, 1887 coo vora nay tatkalin pradeshadhyaksh digvijaya singh coo patra likhaa kii way atikraman hataane tathaa bhawan nirmaan key lie jilaadhikaari key sammukh aavedan dene aur nakshe key aadhar para napjokh karakar atikraman hataane key kaarravaai key lie kissy padadhikari coo nirdeshit karein.
# text_en = On 20 May 1887, Vora wrote to the then state president Digvijay Singh to direct an officer to apply to the district magistrate for removal of encroachments and construction of buildings and to take action to remove encroachments by making a map.
