# text = जवाहर भवन की समूची कथा का सबसे दिलचस्प,महत्वपूर्ण और रेखांकित पहलू यह है कि कांग्रेस की प्रांतीय कार्यकारिणी के समक्ष यह मुद्दा कभी विचारार्थ प्रस्तुत ही नहीं हुआ कि रोशनपुरा में लाखों रुपए की जमीन पर कांग्रेस का भवन कैसे बने, किसकी देखरेख में बने और बनने के बाद उसकी व्यवस्था कैसी हो ?
# translit_iast = javāhara bhavana kī samūcī kathā kā sabase dilacaspa,mahatvapūrṇa aura rekhāṃkita pahalū yaha hai ki kāṃgresa kī prāṃtīya kāryakāriṇī ke samakṣa yaha muddā kabhī vicārārtha prastuta hī nahīṃ huā ki rośanapurā meṃ lākhoṃ rupae kī jamīna para kāṃgresa kā bhavana kaise bane, kisakī dekharekha meṃ bane aura banane ke bāda usakī vyavasthā kaisī ho ?
# translit_itrans = javAhara bhavana kI samUchI kathA kA sabase dilachaspa,mahatvapUrNa aura rekhAMkita pahalU yaha hai ki kAMgresa kI prAMtIya kAryakAriNI ke samakSha yaha muddA kabhI vichArArtha prastuta hI nahIM huA ki roshanapurA meM lAkhoM rupae kI jamIna para kAMgresa kA bhavana kaise bane, kisakI dekharekha meM bane aura banane ke bAda usakI vyavasthA kaisI ho ?
# translit_indicxlit = jawahar bhawan key samoochi katha kaa sabse dilchasp,mahatvapurna aur rekhaankit pahalu yeah hai kii congress key praantiya karyakarini key samaksh yeah mudda kabhi vichararth prastut hee nahin hua kii roshanpura mein laakhon rupaye key jameen para congress kaa bhawan kaise bane, kisaki dekhrekh mein bane aur banane key baad usaki vyavastha cassie how ?
# text_en = The most interesting and important aspect of the whole story of Jawahar Bhawan is that the issue of how to build a Congress Bhawan in Roshanpura on a land worth lakhs of rupees and under whose supervision and after its construction was it arranged was never presented to the Congress Provincial Executive Committee for discussion.
