# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot19g.txt_P2_S40
# text = वे भला माननीय सिनहा जैसे सख्त, अनमनीय जज के घर अवकाश प्राप्ति के बाद सपत्नीक जाते और वे भी निर्णय को अपने पक्ष में करवाने के लिए!परन्तु जब चौधरी चरणसिंह जी ने माननीय सिनहा से इस विषय पर पत्र लिखकर पूछा तो श्री सिनहा ने श्री नायर के कथन की पुष्टि की और कहा कि श्री धात्री-शरण माथुर सपत्नीक उनसे मिलने आए थे और तब उनसे बातों ही बातों में कहा था याचिका श्रीमती गांधी के पक्ष में निर्णीत करने से जज को बड़ा लाभ होगा।
# translit_iast = ve bhalā mānanīya sinahā jaise sakhta, anamanīya jaja ke ghara avakāśa prāpti ke bāda sapatnīka jāte aura ve bhī nirṇaya ko apane pakṣa meṃ karavāne ke lie!parantu jaba caudharī caraṇasiṃha jī ne mānanīya sinahā se isa viṣaya para patra likhakara pūchā to śrī sinahā ne śrī nāyara ke kathana kī puṣṭi kī aura kahā ki śrī dhātrī-śaraṇa māthura sapatnīka unase milane āe the aura taba unase bātoṃ hī bātoṃ meṃ kahā thā yācikā śrīmatī gāṃdhī ke pakṣa meṃ nirṇīta karane se jaja ko bar̤ā lābha hogā|
# translit_itrans = ve bhalA mAnanIya sinahA jaise sakhta, anamanIya jaja ke ghara avakAsha prApti ke bAda sapatnIka jAte aura ve bhI nirNaya ko apane pakSha meM karavAne ke lie!parantu jaba chaudharI charaNasiMha jI ne mAnanIya sinahA se isa viShaya para patra likhakara pUChA to shrI sinahA ne shrI nAyara ke kathana kI puShTi kI aura kahA ki shrI dhAtrI-sharaNa mAthura sapatnIka unase milane Ae the aura taba unase bAtoM hI bAtoM meM kahA thA yAchikA shrImatI gAMdhI ke pakSha meM nirNIta karane se jaja ko ba.DA lAbha hogA|
# translit_indicxlit = way bhalaa maananiya sinaha jaise sakht, anmaniya jaj key ghar avkash praapti key baad sapatneek jaate aur way bhi nirnay coo apane paksh mein karvaane key lie!parantu jab chaudhari charansingh jee nay maananiya sinaha say iss vishay para patra likhakar poochha too shree sinaha nay shree naayar key kathan key pushti key aur kahaa kii shree dhatri-sharan mathur sapatneek unase milane aye they aur tab unase baton hee baton mein kahaa tha yachika shrimati gandhi key paksh mein nirneet karane say jaj coo badha laabh hoga.
# text_en = He might have married after retirement to a strict and unyielding judge like Hon. Sinha and he also wanted to get the decision in his favour. But when Chaudhary Charan Singh ji wrote to Hon. Sinha on this subject, Shri Sinha confirmed Shri Nair's statement and said that Shri Dhatri-Sharan Mathur's wife had come to meet him and had then told him in conversation that the judge would be greatly benefited by deciding the petition in favour of Mrs. Gandhi.
