# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot19g.txt_P2_S58
# text = फरीदपुर पार्टी के पोलिंग अफ्सर अपना `बैलट पेपर दफ्तर में भूलकर छोड़ गए हैं तुरन्त आकर ले जाएँ !. . . इस घोषणा के बाद `लाउडस्पीकर से बहुत ही कर्कश ध्वनि वातावरण को मानों चीर जाती है- लाउड-स्पीकर की खराबी से उत्पन्न आवाज! फरीदपुर पार्टी तुरन्त सूचित करें कि उनके केन्द्र अधिकारी निजी गाड़ी पर तो फरीदपुर कहीं नहीं चले गए!
# translit_iast = pharīdapura pārṭī ke poliṃga aphsara apanā `bailaṭa pepara daphtara meṃ bhūlakara chor̤a gae haiṃ turanta ākara le jāe~ !. . . isa ghoṣaṇā ke bāda `lāuḍaspīkara se bahuta hī karkaśa dhvani vātāvaraṇa ko mānoṃ cīra jātī hai- lāuḍa-spīkara kī kharābī se utpanna āvāja! pharīdapura pārṭī turanta sūcita kareṃ ki unake kendra adhikārī nijī gār̤ī para to pharīdapura kahīṃ nahīṃ cale gae!
# translit_itrans = pharIdapura pArTI ke poliMga aphsara apanA `bailaTa pepara daphtara meM bhUlakara Cho.Da gae haiM turanta Akara le jAe.N !. . . isa ghoShaNA ke bAda `lAuDaspIkara se bahuta hI karkasha dhvani vAtAvaraNa ko mAnoM chIra jAtI hai- lAuDa-spIkara kI kharAbI se utpanna AvAja! pharIdapura pArTI turanta sUchita kareM ki unake kendra adhikArI nijI gA.DI para to pharIdapura kahIM nahIM chale gae!
# translit_indicxlit = faridpur party key polling afsar apna `ballot paper daftar mein bhulkar chhod gaye hain turant aakar lay jaaen !. . . iss ghoshana key baad `loudspeaker say bahut hee karkash dhwani vatavaran coo mano cheer jaati hai- loud-speaker key kharabi say utpann aavaaj! faridpur party turant soochit karein kii unake kendra adhikaari niji gaadi para too faridpur kahin nahin chale gaye!
# text_en = Faridpur party polling officers have forgotten to leave their ballot papers in the office, come and take them immediately!... After this announcement, a very loud sound from the Faridpur loudspeaker rips the atmosphere.
