# translit_indicxlit = isaliye akaaran hee cigar pie-picker bechaare prateeksha karate hain kii cub unaki baari aye!sarkari seva agar kissy duty say ghabraate hain too wah hai nirvaachan key duty! aarambh mein doe-teen nirvachanon mein matdan chhote-chhote (ack rupaye waale note jaise) patron dwara kiya jaataa tha.
