# text = विष्णु नीचे से ऊपर आते-आते मां से टकराया व हड़बड़ाकर बोला-`गजब करती हो. . . देखो तो आपके कितने मिलने-जुलने वाले इकट्ठे हो गये हैं. . . डैडी तो बात कर नहीं पा रहे. . . जरा जल्दी से पहुंच जाइये न! वैजंती नीचे आयी तो श्रीमती भंडार-कर ने गले से लगा लिया.
# translit_iast = viṣṇu nīce se ūpara āte-āte māṃ se ṭakarāyā va har̤abar̤ākara bolā-`gajaba karatī ho. . . dekho to āpake kitane milane-julane vāle ikaṭṭhe ho gaye haiṃ. . . ḍaiḍī to bāta kara nahīṃ pā rahe. . . jarā jaldī se pahuṃca jāiye na! vaijaṃtī nīce āyī to śrīmatī bhaṃḍāra-kara ne gale se lagā liyā.
# translit_itrans = viShNu nIche se Upara Ate-Ate mAM se TakarAyA va ha.Daba.DAkara bolA-`gajaba karatI ho. . . dekho to Apake kitane milane-julane vAle ikaTThe ho gaye haiM. . . DaiDI to bAta kara nahIM pA rahe. . . jarA jaldI se pahuMcha jAiye na! vaijaMtI nIche AyI to shrImatI bhaMDAra-kara ne gale se lagA liyA.
# translit_indicxlit = vishnu niche say oopar aate-aate maan say takaraaya v hadbadaakar bolaa-`gajab karati how. . . dekho too aapke kitane milane-julane waale ikatthe how gaye hain. . . daddy too baat cur nahin paa rahe. . . zara jaldi say pahunch jaaiye naa! vaijanti niche aayi too shrimati bhandar-cur nay gale say lagaa lia.
# text_en = Vishnu came up from the bottom and bumped into his mother and said, " You are talking... look how many of your friends have gathered... Daddy is not able to talk...
