# text = वैजंती बचपन से बहुत नाजुक मिजाज है, वह इस मिजाज के लिए कितनी दोषी है, नहीं जानती. . . क्योंकि बचपन से ही मां और पिता उसे गलत आदतों के लिए डांटते रहे हैं. . . एक बार बचपन में उसने शीघ्रता में आंगन में पेशाब कर दी थी. . . बस उसे डांट तो पड़ी ही. . . इसके साथ ही उसे टॉफी एक हफ्ते तक नहीं दी गयी।
# translit_iast = vaijaṃtī bacapana se bahuta nājuka mijāja hai, vaha isa mijāja ke lie kitanī doṣī hai, nahīṃ jānatī. . . kyoṃki bacapana se hī māṃ aura pitā use galata ādatoṃ ke lie ḍāṃṭate rahe haiṃ. . . eka bāra bacapana meṃ usane śīghratā meṃ āṃgana meṃ peśāba kara dī thī. . . basa use ḍāṃṭa to par̤ī hī. . . isake sātha hī use ṭaॉphī eka haphte taka nahīṃ dī gayī|
# translit_itrans = vaijaMtI bachapana se bahuta nAjuka mijAja hai, vaha isa mijAja ke lie kitanI doShI hai, nahIM jAnatI. . . kyoMki bachapana se hI mAM aura pitA use galata AdatoM ke lie DAMTate rahe haiM. . . eka bAra bachapana meM usane shIghratA meM AMgana meM peshAba kara dI thI. . . basa use DAMTa to pa.DI hI. . . isake sAtha hI use TaॉphI eka haphte taka nahIM dI gayI|
# translit_indicxlit = vaijanti bachpan say bahut najuk mijaz hai, wah iss mijaz key lie kitni doshi hai, nahin jaanati. . . kyonki bachpan say hee maan aur pita use galat aadton key lie daantate rahe hain. . . ack baar bachpan mein usane sheeghrata mein aangan mein peshab cur dee thee. . . bus use daunt too padi hee. . . isake saath hee use toffee ack hafte tuck nahin dee gayee.
# text_en = Vaijanti has a very delicate temperament since childhood and she does not know how much she is guilty of this temperament... because since childhood, mother and father have been scolding her for her wrong habits... once in her childhood, she urinated in the courtyard in a hurry... only to be scolded... with this, toffee was not given to her for a week.
