# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot20ar_P2_S12
# text = यद्यपि यह सच है कि हमारे यहां चुनावों में घोषणापत्रों से अधिक महत्व सामयिक मुद्दों का ही रहता आया है, तेकिन इधर जब से पूर्व प्रधानमंत्री विश्वनाथ प्रताप सिंह और उनकी राष्ट्रीय मोर्चा सरकार ने मंडल कमीशन की रिपोर्ट लागू करने और भूमि सुधार कानूनों की न्यायिक समीक्षा पर रोक लगाने के लिए उन्हें संविधान की नवीं अनुसूची में शामिल करने जैसे अपने चुनावी वादों को पूरा करने की कोशिशें की है, तब से चुनाव घोषणापत्रों का महत्व कुछ बढ़ चला है।
# translit_iast = yadyapi yaha saca hai ki hamāre yahāṃ cunāvoṃ meṃ ghoṣaṇāpatroṃ se adhika mahatva sāmayika muddoṃ kā hī rahatā āyā hai, tekina idhara jaba se pūrva pradhānamaṃtrī viśvanātha pratāpa siṃha aura unakī rāṣṭrīya morcā sarakāra ne maṃḍala kamīśana kī riporṭa lāgū karane aura bhūmi sudhāra kānūnoṃ kī nyāyika samīkṣā para roka lagāne ke lie unheṃ saṃvidhāna kī navīṃ anusūcī meṃ śāmila karane jaise apane cunāvī vādoṃ ko pūrā karane kī kośiśeṃ kī hai, taba se cunāva ghoṣaṇāpatroṃ kā mahatva kucha bar̤ha calā hai|
# translit_itrans = yadyapi yaha sacha hai ki hamAre yahAM chunAvoM meM ghoShaNApatroM se adhika mahatva sAmayika muddoM kA hI rahatA AyA hai, tekina idhara jaba se pUrva pradhAnamaMtrI vishvanAtha pratApa siMha aura unakI rAShTrIya morchA sarakAra ne maMDala kamIshana kI riporTa lAgU karane aura bhUmi sudhAra kAnUnoM kI nyAyika samIkShA para roka lagAne ke lie unheM saMvidhAna kI navIM anusUchI meM shAmila karane jaise apane chunAvI vAdoM ko pUrA karane kI koshisheM kI hai, taba se chunAva ghoShaNApatroM kA mahatva kuCha ba.Dha chalA hai|
# translit_indicxlit = yadyapi yeah such hai kii hamare yahaan chunaavon mein ghoshanapatron say adhik mahatva saamyik muddon kaa hee rahata aaya hai, tekin idhar jab say poorv pradhaanmantri vishwanath prataap singh aur unaki rashtriya morcha sarkar nay mandal commission key report lagu karane aur bhoomi sudhaar kaanoonon key nyaayik sameeksha para rock lagaane key lie unhein samvidhaan key naveen anusuchi mein shamil karane jaise apane chunavi vaadon coo pura karane key koshishen key hai, tab say chunaav ghoshanapatron kaa mahatva kuchha badha chalaa hai.
# text_en = While it is true that topical issues have always been more important than manifestos in our elections, they have gained in importance since the time former Prime Minister Vishwanath Pratap Singh and his National Front government tried to fulfil their election promises, such as implementing the Mandal Commission report and including the land reform laws in the Ninth Schedule of the Constitution to prevent judicial review of them.
