# translit_itrans = AtaMkavAda ke viruddha bhI hara rAjanItika dala ne khUba lAvA ugalA auRa use samApta karane kA apanA dRRi.Dha saMkalpa bhI bAraMbAra doharAyA, lekina maje kI bAta yaha rahI ki isameM se kisI ne isa bAta para kahIM koI prakAsha nahIM DAlA ki paMjAba auRa jammU kashmIra jaise AtaMkagrasta rAjyoM meM sthiti sAmAnya banAne ke lie unakI yojanA kyA hai ?
# translit_indicxlit = aatankvaad key viruddh bhi hear raajneetik dull nay khoob lava ugala auay use samaapt karane kaa apna dridh sankalp bhi barambar dohraya, lekin maze key baat yeah rahee kii isamen say kissy nay iss baat para kahin koi prakaash nahin daala kii punjab auay jammu kashmir jaise aatankgrast raajyon mein sthiti samanya banaane key lie unaki yojana kya hai ?
