# text = इन सब सम्बन्धों से यह तो पूर्णतया स्पष्ट ही है कि बाबा रामसिंह जी जहां एक ओर अपनी शक्ति इकट्ठा कर रहे थे, वहां दूसरी ओर अपने निकट के स्वतंत्र और अर्द्धस्वतंत्र राज्यों से अपना सम्बन्ध स्थापित कर रहे थे जिससे उन्हें भविष्य की योजनाओं को कार्यान्वित करने में सहायता प्राप्त हो सके।
# translit_iast = ina saba sambandhoṃ se yaha to pūrṇatayā spaṣṭa hī hai ki bābā rāmasiṃha jī jahāṃ eka ora apanī śakti ikaṭṭhā kara rahe the, vahāṃ dūsarī ora apane nikaṭa ke svataṃtra aura arddhasvataṃtra rājyoṃ se apanā sambandha sthāpita kara rahe the jisase unheṃ bhaviṣya kī yojanāoṃ ko kāryānvita karane meṃ sahāyatā prāpta ho sake|
# translit_itrans = ina saba sambandhoM se yaha to pUrNatayA spaShTa hI hai ki bAbA rAmasiMha jI jahAM eka ora apanI shakti ikaTThA kara rahe the, vahAM dUsarI ora apane nikaTa ke svataMtra aura arddhasvataMtra rAjyoM se apanA sambandha sthApita kara rahe the jisase unheM bhaviShya kI yojanAoM ko kAryAnvita karane meM sahAyatA prApta ho sake|
# translit_indicxlit = inn sub sambandhon say yeah too purnataya spasht hee hai kii baba ramsingh jee jahaan ack or apni shakti ikattha cur rahe they, vahan doosri or apane nikat key swatantra aur ardhaswatantra raajyon say apna sambandh sthaapit cur rahe they jisase unhein bhavishya key yojanaon coo karyanvit karane mein sahaayata praapt how sake.
# text_en = It is quite clear from all these connections that while Baba Ram Singh Ji was gathering his strength on the one hand, he was establishing his relations with the independent and semi-independent states near him on the other hand so that he could be helped in implementing his future plans.
