# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot19h.txt_P2_S28
# text = संघर्ष की शुरूआतबाबा रामसिंह जी जिस योग्यता और धैर्य से अपने संगठन का संचालन कर रहे थे, शायद उनके अनुयायियों को उसका अहसास नहीं हो सका और इसीलिए उन्होंने अपने क्षाणिक जोश के आवेश में ऐसे अनेक कार्य कर दिये जो संगठन की दृष्टि से उपयोगी सिद्ध नहीं हुए और सम्पूर्ण प्रयास अपनी निश्चित योजना पर पहुंचने से पूर्व ही छिन्न-भिन्न कर दिया गया।
# translit_iast = saṃgharṣa kī śurūātabābā rāmasiṃha jī jisa yogyatā aura dhairya se apane saṃgaṭhana kā saṃcālana kara rahe the, śāyada unake anuyāyiyoṃ ko usakā ahasāsa nahīṃ ho sakā aura isīlie unhoṃne apane kṣāṇika jośa ke āveśa meṃ aise aneka kārya kara diye jo saṃgaṭhana kī dṛṣṭi se upayogī siddha nahīṃ hue aura sampūrṇa prayāsa apanī niścita yojanā para pahuṃcane se pūrva hī chinna-bhinna kara diyā gayā|
# translit_itrans = saMgharSha kI shurUAtabAbA rAmasiMha jI jisa yogyatA aura dhairya se apane saMgaThana kA saMchAlana kara rahe the, shAyada unake anuyAyiyoM ko usakA ahasAsa nahIM ho sakA aura isIlie unhoMne apane kShANika josha ke Avesha meM aise aneka kArya kara diye jo saMgaThana kI dRRiShTi se upayogI siddha nahIM hue aura sampUrNa prayAsa apanI nishchita yojanA para pahuMchane se pUrva hI Chinna-bhinna kara diyA gayA|
# translit_indicxlit = sangharsh key shuruatbaba ramsingh jee jis yogyata aur dhairya say apane sangathan kaa sanchaalan cur rahe they, shayed unake anuyaayiyon coo uska ahsas nahin how sakaa aur isiliye unhone apane kshaanik josh key avesh mein aise anek kaary cur diye zoo sangathan key drishti say upayogi siddha nahin hue aur sampoorn prayaas apni nishchit yojana para pahunchane say poorv hee chhinn-bhinn cur diya gaya.
# text_en = The struggle began with the ability and patience with which Baba Ram Singh Ji was conducting his organisation and perhaps his followers did not realise it and therefore, in his zeal for the cause, he did many things which did not prove to be useful from the point of view of organisation and the whole effort was shattered before reaching its definite plan.
