# translit_indicxlit = sikh samrajya key videshi karmchaariyon aur samrajya key seema say nikalane waali kissy bhi videshi sena coo kissy bhi dasha mein gohatya karane key aagya nahin thee kintu angrezi samrajya sthaapit hote hee go-hatyaa kaa yeah pratibandh samaapt cur diya gaya aur sthan-sthan para boochadkhaane kholane key anumati dei dee gayee.
