# translit_indicxlit = utter pradesh key samasyaon key niraakaran key liye udaaharan key drishti say dekhein too punjab key punargathan mein punjab, haryana, himanchal pradesh banane key baduski pragati say siddha how chuka hai kii jis prakaar aaj chhota parivarsukhi parivar hai, usee prakaar chhota rajya hee sukhi rajya hota hai.
