# text = यही कारण है कि जसवन्त सिंह आयोग द्वारादी गई रिपोर्ट कि इस क्षेत्र की जनता की भावनाओं और सस्ते न्याय हेतुहाई कोर्ट इलाहाबाद की एक बैंच की स्थापना आगरा में की जाये, को पूरबके केन्द्र और प्रान्त की सरकार में बैठे लोग वहां की जनता (जो पश्चिमी उत्तरप्रदेश की जनता के सहारे फल-फूल रही है) के हित में दबाये बैठे हैं।
# translit_iast = yahī kāraṇa hai ki jasavanta siṃha āyoga dvārādī gaī riporṭa ki isa kṣetra kī janatā kī bhāvanāoṃ aura saste nyāya hetuhāī korṭa ilāhābāda kī eka baiṃca kī sthāpanā āgarā meṃ kī jāye, ko pūrabake kendra aura prānta kī sarakāra meṃ baiṭhe loga vahāṃ kī janatā (jo paścimī uttarapradeśa kī janatā ke sahāre phala-phūla rahī hai) ke hita meṃ dabāye baiṭhe haiṃ|
# translit_itrans = yahI kAraNa hai ki jasavanta siMha Ayoga dvArAdI gaI riporTa ki isa kShetra kI janatA kI bhAvanAoM aura saste nyAya hetuhAI korTa ilAhAbAda kI eka baiMcha kI sthApanA AgarA meM kI jAye, ko pUrabake kendra aura prAnta kI sarakAra meM baiThe loga vahAM kI janatA (jo pashchimI uttarapradesha kI janatA ke sahAre phala-phUla rahI hai) ke hita meM dabAye baiThe haiM|
# translit_indicxlit = yahee kaaran hai kii jaswant singh aayog dwaradi gayee report kii iss kshetra key janata key bhaavanaon aur saste nyay hetuhai court allahabad key ack bench key sthaapana aagara mein key jaye, coo purabke kendra aur praant key sarkar mein baithe log vahan key janata (zoo paschimi uttarpradesh key janata key sahaare full-fool rahee hai) key hit mein dabaye baithe hain.
# text_en = That is why the report of the Jaswant Singh Commission that a Bench of the High Court of Allahabad should be established at Agra to assuage the feelings of the people of the region and to provide cheap justice has been suppressed by the Central and State Governments in the East in the interest of the people of the State ( which is flourishing with the help of the people of Western Uttar Pradesh ).
