# translit_itrans = Adi shaMkarAchArya ne chANakya ke lie AdhArabhUmi taiyAra kI, jinhoMne maurya sAmrAjya kI nIMva rakhavAyI ( chANakya kA aMgrejoM dvArA nirdhArita kAla mujhe mAnya nahIM) dakShiNa meM vijaya nagara sAmrAjya 350 barasa chalA.
# translit_indicxlit = aadi shankaracharya nay chanakya key lie adharbhumi taiyar key, jinhone maurya samrajya key neenv rakhvaayi ( chanakya kaa angrejon dwara nirdhaarit call mujhe many nahin) dakshina mein veejay nagar samrajya 350 baras chalaa.
