# text = साथ-साथ अर्थव्यवस्था के प्राथमिक और सहायक क्षेत्रों में जहां अब तक शारीरिक श्रम करनेवाले कर्मचारियों का बहुमत है, धीरे-धीरे कई कामों का मशीनीकरण और कम्प्यूटरीकरण करने की प्रक्रिया शुरू हुई है जिससे कर्मचारियों के काम की प्रकृति में परिवर्तन आएगा और समय के साथ इस क्षेत्र में भी सफेदपोश कर्मचारियों की संख्या में काफी वृद्धि होगी।
# translit_iast = sātha-sātha arthavyavasthā ke prāthamika aura sahāyaka kṣetroṃ meṃ jahāṃ aba taka śārīrika śrama karanevāle karmacāriyoṃ kā bahumata hai, dhīre-dhīre kaī kāmoṃ kā maśīnīkaraṇa aura kampyūṭarīkaraṇa karane kī prakriyā śurū huī hai jisase karmacāriyoṃ ke kāma kī prakṛti meṃ parivartana āegā aura samaya ke sātha isa kṣetra meṃ bhī saphedapośa karmacāriyoṃ kī saṃkhyā meṃ kāphī vṛddhi hogī|
# translit_itrans = sAtha-sAtha arthavyavasthA ke prAthamika aura sahAyaka kShetroM meM jahAM aba taka shArIrika shrama karanevAle karmachAriyoM kA bahumata hai, dhIre-dhIre kaI kAmoM kA mashInIkaraNa aura kampyUTarIkaraNa karane kI prakriyA shurU huI hai jisase karmachAriyoM ke kAma kI prakRRiti meM parivartana AegA aura samaya ke sAtha isa kShetra meM bhI saphedaposha karmachAriyoM kI saMkhyA meM kAphI vRRiddhi hogI|
# translit_indicxlit = saath-saath arthavyavastha key praathamik aur sahayak kshetras mein jahaan ab tuck shaaririk shram karnewale karmchaariyon kaa bahumat hai, dhire-dhire kaee kaamon kaa mashinikaran aur computerization karane key prakriya shuru hui hai jisase karmchaariyon key kaam key prakriti mein parivartan aayega aur samay key saath iss kshetra mein bhi safedposh karmchaariyon key sankhya mein kaafee vriddhi hogi.
# text_en = Simultaneously, the primary and ancillary sectors of the economy, which have hitherto been dominated by manual workers, have gradually begun to mechanise and computerise many of the jobs that will change the nature of the work of the employees and, over time, the white-collar workforce in this sector will also increase significantly.
