# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot20c_P2_S57
# text = हमारे लिए इससे बढ़कर दुर्भाग्यपूर्ण बात और क्या हो सकती है कि 1955-56 में राष्ट्रीय फाइलेरिएल नियंत्रण, कार्यक्रम शुरू किए जाने के बावजूद रोग का प्रसार कम होने की बजाय बढ़ता गया है(एक रिपोर्ट के अनुसार 1963 में 25 करोड़ लोग फाइलेरिएसिस-संक्रमण के माहौल में रह रहे थे) और स्वयं भारतीय आयुर्विज्ञान अनुसंधान परिषद् ने अगस्त 1986 के अपने प्रकाशन में कहा है कि राष्ट्रीय फाइलेरिएसिस नियंत्रण कार्यक्रम विभिन्न कारणों से इस रोग के नियंत्रण में कोई उल्लेखनीय कामयाबी हासिल नहीं कर पाया है।
# translit_iast = hamāre lie isase bar̤hakara durbhāgyapūrṇa bāta aura kyā ho sakatī hai ki 1955-56 meṃ rāṣṭrīya phāileriela niyaṃtraṇa, kāryakrama śurū kie jāne ke bāvajūda roga kā prasāra kama hone kī bajāya bar̤hatā gayā hai(eka riporṭa ke anusāra 1963 meṃ 25 karor̤a loga phāileriesisa-saṃkramaṇa ke māhaula meṃ raha rahe the) aura svayaṃ bhāratīya āyurvijñāna anusaṃdhāna pariṣad ne agasta 1986 ke apane prakāśana meṃ kahā hai ki rāṣṭrīya phāileriesisa niyaṃtraṇa kāryakrama vibhinna kāraṇoṃ se isa roga ke niyaṃtraṇa meṃ koī ullekhanīya kāmayābī hāsila nahīṃ kara pāyā hai|
# translit_itrans = hamAre lie isase ba.Dhakara durbhAgyapUrNa bAta aura kyA ho sakatI hai ki 1955-56 meM rAShTrIya phAileriela niyaMtraNa, kAryakrama shurU kie jAne ke bAvajUda roga kA prasAra kama hone kI bajAya ba.DhatA gayA hai(eka riporTa ke anusAra 1963 meM 25 karo.Da loga phAileriesisa-saMkramaNa ke mAhaula meM raha rahe the) aura svayaM bhAratIya Ayurvij~nAna anusaMdhAna pariShad ne agasta 1986 ke apane prakAshana meM kahA hai ki rAShTrIya phAileriesisa niyaMtraNa kAryakrama vibhinna kAraNoM se isa roga ke niyaMtraNa meM koI ullekhanIya kAmayAbI hAsila nahIM kara pAyA hai|
# translit_indicxlit = hamare lie isase badhkar durbhagyapurna baat aur kya how sakati hai kii 1955-56 mein rashtriya filarial niyantran, karyakram shuru kiye jaane key bavjood roga kaa prasaar cum honey key bajaay badhata gaya hai(ack report key anusaar 1963 mein 25 karod log filariasis-sankraman key mahaul mein rah rahe they) aur swayam bhaaratiya aayurvigyan anusandhaan parishad nay agast 1986 key apane prakaashan mein kahaa hai kii rashtriya filariasis niyantran karyakram vibhinn karanon say iss roga key niyantran mein koi ullekhaniya kamyabi hassil nahin cur paya hai.
# text_en = What can be more unfortunate for us that despite the introduction of the National Filarial Control Programme in 1955-56, the spread of the disease has increased rather than decreased ( according to one report, 250 million people were living in filariasis-infection environments in 1963 ) and the Indian Council of Medical Research itself has stated in its August 1986 publication that the National Filariasis Control Programme has not achieved any significant success in controlling the disease for various reasons.
