# translit_indicxlit = tapedik aur kushth roga key tarah filariasis kissy khaas aarthik samooh tuck seemit nahin hai,lekin vegyaanik vishleshan bataate hain kii ashiksha ,gharon key aspas ghatiya paryaavaranik paristhitiyaan aur amanviya awas-vyavastha iss roga key pramukh karaka tatva hain.
