# text = हालाँकि यह रही है कि फाइलेरिएसिस शारीरिक विकृतियाँ पैदा करता है और और अनेक मामलों में रोगियों को अशक्त,विगलांग व कामकाज के लिए नाकाबिल बना देता है, लेकिन चूँकि तपेदिक की तरह न तो यह जीनव के लिए खतरा पैदा करता है और न ही कुष्ठ रोग की तरह सामाजिक लांछन,तिरस्कार एवं बहिस्कार को आमंत्रित करता है।
# translit_iast = hālā~ki yaha rahī hai ki phāileriesisa śārīrika vikṛtiyā~ paidā karatā hai aura aura aneka māmaloṃ meṃ rogiyoṃ ko aśakta,vigalāṃga va kāmakāja ke lie nākābila banā detā hai, lekina cū~ki tapedika kī taraha na to yaha jīnava ke lie khatarā paidā karatā hai aura na hī kuṣṭha roga kī taraha sāmājika lāṃchana,tiraskāra evaṃ bahiskāra ko āmaṃtrita karatā hai|
# translit_itrans = hAlA.Nki yaha rahI hai ki phAileriesisa shArIrika vikRRitiyA.N paidA karatA hai aura aura aneka mAmaloM meM rogiyoM ko ashakta,vigalAMga va kAmakAja ke lie nAkAbila banA detA hai, lekina chU.Nki tapedika kI taraha na to yaha jInava ke lie khatarA paidA karatA hai aura na hI kuShTha roga kI taraha sAmAjika lAMChana,tiraskAra evaM bahiskAra ko AmaMtrita karatA hai|
# translit_indicxlit = haalaanki yeah rahee hai kii filariasis shaaririk vikritiyaan paida karta hai aur aur anek mamalon mein rogiyon coo ashakt,viglang v kamkaj key lie nakabil banaa deta hai, lekin choonki tapedik key tarah naa too yeah jeenav key lie khatra paida karta hai aur naa hee kushth roga key tarah samajik laanchhan,tiraskar aivam bahiskaar coo aamantrit karta hai.
# text_en = Although it has been observed that filariasis causes physical deformities and in many cases makes patients disabled, disabled and incapable of functioning ; but unlike tuberculosis, it neither poses a threat to the organism nor invites social stigma and discrimination like leprosy.
