# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ai_P2_S42
# text = इनका ध्यान आपके हाथों में पड़े मिष्ठान-पात्र पर होता है और आप इनकी दुरभिसंधि से सर्वथा अनभिज्ञ सीढ़ियों की दो-चार दस पंक्तियां पार नहीं कर पाते हैं कि ये कई ओर से आप पर इस तरह टूटते हैं कि आप किं-कर्त्तव्य-विमूढ़, इनके मुंह ताकने लगते हैं और ये आपके हाथ की मिठाई पहले की आप समझें कि आप के साथ क्या घटित हो गया, आपकी बगल का आदमी आपको अपने कर्त्तव्य की याद दिलाने सामने आ जाता है-- अब जाइये दूसरा `दोना लाइये.
# translit_iast = inakā dhyāna āpake hāthoṃ meṃ par̤e miṣṭhāna-pātra para hotā hai aura āpa inakī durabhisaṃdhi se sarvathā anabhijña sīr̤hiyoṃ kī do-cāra dasa paṃktiyāṃ pāra nahīṃ kara pāte haiṃ ki ye kaī ora se āpa para isa taraha ṭūṭate haiṃ ki āpa kiṃ-karttavya-vimūr̤ha, inake muṃha tākane lagate haiṃ aura ye āpake hātha kī miṭhāī pahale kī āpa samajheṃ ki āpa ke sātha kyā ghaṭita ho gayā, āpakī bagala kā ādamī āpako apane karttavya kī yāda dilāne sāmane ā jātā hai-- aba jāiye dūsarā `donā lāiye.
# translit_itrans = inakA dhyAna Apake hAthoM meM pa.De miShThAna-pAtra para hotA hai aura Apa inakI durabhisaMdhi se sarvathA anabhij~na sI.DhiyoM kI do-chAra dasa paMktiyAM pAra nahIM kara pAte haiM ki ye kaI ora se Apa para isa taraha TUTate haiM ki Apa kiM-karttavya-vimU.Dha, inake muMha tAkane lagate haiM aura ye Apake hAtha kI miThAI pahale kI Apa samajheM ki Apa ke sAtha kyA ghaTita ho gayA, ApakI bagala kA AdamI Apako apane karttavya kI yAda dilAne sAmane A jAtA hai-- aba jAiye dUsarA `donA lAiye.
# translit_indicxlit = inca dhyan aapke haathon mein padey mishthaan-patra para hota hai aur aap inki durbhisandhi say sarvatha anabhigya seedhiyon key doe-chaar dasa panktiyan paar nahin cur paate hain kii yeye kaee or say aap para iss tarah tootate hain kii aap keen-kartvya-vimoodh, inke muh taakane lagte hain aur yeye aapke haath key mithai pehle key aap samajhen kii aap key saath kya ghatit how gaya, aapaki bagel kaa aadmi aapko apane kartvya key yaad dilaane saamane aa jaataa hai-- ab jaaiye doosra `donna laaiye.
# text_en = Their attention is on the candy box in your hand and you are not able to cross two-four-ten rows of stairs completely unaware of their mischief that they break on you from many sides in such a way that you start looking at them and they start looking at your handcuffs and the candy in your hand before you understand what has happened to you and the man next to you comes forward to remind you of your duty -- now go get another candy.
