# text = प्रमुखता इसकी इस अर्थ में है कि लखनऊ या इसके आस-पास अथवा दूर-दराज के भी किसी मंदिर में मेरी मूर्ति स्थापित हो रही हो तो उसकी प्राण-प्रतिष्ठा तब तक अपूर्ण मानी जायेगी जब तक मंदिर से प्राप्त सिंदूर और लंगोटे का प्रयोग नहीं हो.
# translit_iast = pramukhatā isakī isa artha meṃ hai ki lakhanaū yā isake āsa-pāsa athavā dūra-darāja ke bhī kisī maṃdira meṃ merī mūrti sthāpita ho rahī ho to usakī prāṇa-pratiṣṭhā taba taka apūrṇa mānī jāyegī jaba taka maṃdira se prāpta siṃdūra aura laṃgoṭe kā prayoga nahīṃ ho.
# translit_itrans = pramukhatA isakI isa artha meM hai ki lakhanaU yA isake Asa-pAsa athavA dUra-darAja ke bhI kisI maMdira meM merI mUrti sthApita ho rahI ho to usakI prANa-pratiShThA taba taka apUrNa mAnI jAyegI jaba taka maMdira se prApta siMdUra aura laMgoTe kA prayoga nahIM ho.
# translit_indicxlit = pramukhta isaki iss earth mein hai kii lakhanau yaa isake aas-paas athwa door-daraaj key bhi kissy mandir mein merry murti sthaapit how rahee how too usaki pran-pratishtha tab tuck apoorna maani jaayegi jab tuck mandir say praapt sindoor aur langote kaa prayog nahin how.
# text_en = The significance of this is in the sense that if my idol is being installed in a temple in Lucknow or its vicinity or even in a distant place, its consecration will be considered incomplete unless the vermilion and loincloth obtained from the temple are used.
