# translit_itrans = bhaktoM kI AsthA kA eka apUrva udAharaNa taba milatA hai jaba mere se eka saptAha pUrva se hI shata-sahasra vyakti lAla laMgoTA pahane sa.DakoM para peTa ke bala khisakate---praNAma nivedita karate-----maMdira kI ora ba.Dhate haiM.
# translit_indicxlit = bhakton key aastha kaa ack apoorv udaaharan tab milata hai jab mere say ack saptah poorv say hee shat-sahasr vyakti laal langota pahane sadakon para pett key ball khisakate---pranam nivedit karate-----mandir key or badhate hain.
