# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ai_P2_S148
# text = वर्षों से इस स्थान पर फलता-बढ़ता लोगों का अदम्य विश्वास, उनकी अपार श्रद्धा, विश्वास के इस घनीभूत स्वरुप का सहारा पा लड़खड़ाता विश्वास भी अगर सशक्त हो आपकी मनोकांछा-पूर्ति का बहाना बन आता है तो श्रेय मुझे नहीं आपकी श्रद्धा, आपके विश्वास को ही मिलान चाहिए.
# translit_iast = varṣoṃ se isa sthāna para phalatā-bar̤hatā logoṃ kā adamya viśvāsa, unakī apāra śraddhā, viśvāsa ke isa ghanībhūta svarupa kā sahārā pā lar̤akhar̤ātā viśvāsa bhī agara saśakta ho āpakī manokāṃchā-pūrti kā bahānā bana ātā hai to śreya mujhe nahīṃ āpakī śraddhā, āpake viśvāsa ko hī milāna cāhie.
# translit_itrans = varShoM se isa sthAna para phalatA-ba.DhatA logoM kA adamya vishvAsa, unakI apAra shraddhA, vishvAsa ke isa ghanIbhUta svarupa kA sahArA pA la.Dakha.DAtA vishvAsa bhI agara sashakta ho ApakI manokAMChA-pUrti kA bahAnA bana AtA hai to shreya mujhe nahIM ApakI shraddhA, Apake vishvAsa ko hI milAna chAhie.
# translit_indicxlit = varshon say iss sthan para falataa-badhata logon kaa adamya vishwaas, unaki apaar shraddha, vishwaas key iss ghanibhut swarup kaa sahaara paa ladkhadaataa vishwaas bhi agar sashakt how aapaki manokanchha-poorti kaa bahaana bn aata hai too shreya mujhe nahin aapaki shraddha, aapke vishwaas coo hee milan chaahiye.
# text_en = The unshakable faith of the people that has flourished in this place for years, their immense reverence, and the faltering faith that has been supported by this condensed form of faith, if it is strong enough to become an excuse for your wish-fulfillment, then the credit should not go to me, but to your reverence and your faith.
