# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ai_P2_S150
# text = उनकी प्रतिमा का एक मात्र साधन-- भवानी शंकरौ बंदे, श्रद्धा विश्वास रुपिणौ. तो जो विश्वास साक्षात् शिव के साक्षात्कार का आधार बन सकता है, जो श्रद्धा स्वयं भवानी को अनुकूल कर सकती है, उस श्रद्धा, उस विश्वास के समक्ष अप्राप्य क्या रहता है, असंभव क्या बचता है?
# translit_iast = unakī pratimā kā eka mātra sādhana-- bhavānī śaṃkarau baṃde, śraddhā viśvāsa rupiṇau. to jo viśvāsa sākṣāt śiva ke sākṣātkāra kā ādhāra bana sakatā hai, jo śraddhā svayaṃ bhavānī ko anukūla kara sakatī hai, usa śraddhā, usa viśvāsa ke samakṣa aprāpya kyā rahatā hai, asaṃbhava kyā bacatā hai?
# translit_itrans = unakI pratimA kA eka mAtra sAdhana-- bhavAnI shaMkarau baMde, shraddhA vishvAsa rupiNau. to jo vishvAsa sAkShAt shiva ke sAkShAtkAra kA AdhAra bana sakatA hai, jo shraddhA svayaM bhavAnI ko anukUla kara sakatI hai, usa shraddhA, usa vishvAsa ke samakSha aprApya kyA rahatA hai, asaMbhava kyA bachatA hai?
# translit_indicxlit = unaki pratima kaa ack matra saadhan-- bhawani shankarau bandey, shraddha vishwaas rupinau. too zoo vishwaas sakshaat shiv key sakshatkar kaa aadhar bn sakta hai, zoo shraddha swayam bhawani coo anukool cur sakati hai, usa shraddha, usa vishwaas key samaksh apraapya kya rahata hai, asambhav kya bachata hai?
# text_en = The only means of their image---Bhavani Shankaru Bande and Shraddha Vishwas Rupinu. So the faith which can become the basis of realization of Shiva directly, the faith which can adapt itself to Bhavani, that faith, what remains unattainable before that faith, what remains impossible.
