# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ai_P2_S187
# text = श्रद्धा-विश्वास की तरंगामित लहरों ने जा छुआ नवाब के कुछ दरबारियों के मन-प्राणों को और उनमें एक नवाब को एक विचित्र प्रस्ताव दे बैठा---- बेगम साहिबा के मान को रोशन करना हो तो पुतवा दीजिए पूरे कैसर महल को कैसर-कसतूरी से. पूरा इलाका गम-गम कर उठेगा केसरिया गंध से और सार्थक हो जायेगा कैसर-बाग नाम भी.
# translit_iast = śraddhā-viśvāsa kī taraṃgāmita laharoṃ ne jā chuā navāba ke kucha darabāriyoṃ ke mana-prāṇoṃ ko aura unameṃ eka navāba ko eka vicitra prastāva de baiṭhā---- begama sāhibā ke māna ko rośana karanā ho to putavā dījie pūre kaisara mahala ko kaisara-kasatūrī se. pūrā ilākā gama-gama kara uṭhegā kesariyā gaṃdha se aura sārthaka ho jāyegā kaisara-bāga nāma bhī.
# translit_itrans = shraddhA-vishvAsa kI taraMgAmita laharoM ne jA ChuA navAba ke kuCha darabAriyoM ke mana-prANoM ko aura unameM eka navAba ko eka vichitra prastAva de baiThA---- begama sAhibA ke mAna ko roshana karanA ho to putavA dIjie pUre kaisara mahala ko kaisara-kasatUrI se. pUrA ilAkA gama-gama kara uThegA kesariyA gaMdha se aura sArthaka ho jAyegA kaisara-bAga nAma bhI.
# translit_indicxlit = shraddha-vishwaas key tarangamit laharon nay jaa chhuaa nawab key kuchha darbaariyon key mann-praanon coo aur unamen ack nawab coo ack vichitra prastaav dei baithaa---- begum sahiba key maan coo roshan karna how too putwa deejiye pure casser mahal coo casser-kasturi say. pura ilaka gum-gum cur uthega kesariya gandh say aur saarthak how jayega casser-baag naam bhi.
# text_en = The ripples of reverence touched the hearts of some of the Nawab's courtiers and one of them made a strange proposal to the Nawab---If you want to glorify Begum Sahiba, then paint the entire Qaiser Mahal with Qaiser-Qassturi. The whole area will smell saffron and the name Qaiser-Bagh will also be meaningful.
