# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ai_P2_S188
# text = भा गयी नवाब को दरबारियों की बात और बिक गया जटमल का सारा केसर. मैंने उसके लिए कुछ किया या नहीं पर दोनों हाथों से धन उलीचा था उस सौदागर ने इस मंदिर के नाम. मूर्ति के ऊपर सोने का छत्र चढ़ाया जो आज तक वर्तमान है.
# translit_iast = bhā gayī navāba ko darabāriyoṃ kī bāta aura bika gayā jaṭamala kā sārā kesara. maiṃne usake lie kucha kiyā yā nahīṃ para donoṃ hāthoṃ se dhana ulīcā thā usa saudāgara ne isa maṃdira ke nāma. mūrti ke ūpara sone kā chatra car̤hāyā jo āja taka vartamāna hai.
# translit_itrans = bhA gayI navAba ko darabAriyoM kI bAta aura bika gayA jaTamala kA sArA kesara. maiMne usake lie kuCha kiyA yA nahIM para donoM hAthoM se dhana ulIchA thA usa saudAgara ne isa maMdira ke nAma. mUrti ke Upara sone kA Chatra cha.DhAyA jo Aja taka vartamAna hai.
# translit_indicxlit = bhaa gayee nawab coo darbaariyon key baat aur bic gaya jatmal kaa saaraa kesar. maine usake lie kuchha kiya yaa nahin para dono haathon say dhan ulicha tha usa saudagar nay iss mandir key naam. murti key oopar sone kaa chhatra chadhaaya zoo aaj tuck vartamaan hai.
# text_en = The Nawab was struck by the courtiers and sold all the saffron of Jatmal. Whether I did anything for him or not, the merchant who had taken the money with both hands offered a gold umbrella over the name of this temple. the idol is present to this day.
