# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ai_P2_S189
# text = स्थान का नव-निर्माण हुआ और ऐसा उत्सव-आयोजन संपन्न हुआ यहां की हजारों लोगों की भीड़ उमड़-उमड़ पड़ी कई दिनों तक. मेले का महत्व तब से निरंतर बढ़ता गया और आज यहां के ज्येष्ठ मासीय मेले का महत्व दूर-दराज तक विख्यात है और उसकी हनुमान-भक्ति अधूरी ही मानते हैं आप जिसने अलीगंज के मंदिर में माथा नहीं टेका हो और इसके मेले में भाग नहीं लिया हो.
# translit_iast = sthāna kā nava-nirmāṇa huā aura aisā utsava-āyojana saṃpanna huā yahāṃ kī hajāroṃ logoṃ kī bhīr̤a umar̤a-umar̤a par̤ī kaī dinoṃ taka. mele kā mahatva taba se niraṃtara bar̤hatā gayā aura āja yahāṃ ke jyeṣṭha māsīya mele kā mahatva dūra-darāja taka vikhyāta hai aura usakī hanumāna-bhakti adhūrī hī mānate haiṃ āpa jisane alīgaṃja ke maṃdira meṃ māthā nahīṃ ṭekā ho aura isake mele meṃ bhāga nahīṃ liyā ho.
# translit_itrans = sthAna kA nava-nirmANa huA aura aisA utsava-Ayojana saMpanna huA yahAM kI hajAroM logoM kI bhI.Da uma.Da-uma.Da pa.DI kaI dinoM taka. mele kA mahatva taba se niraMtara ba.DhatA gayA aura Aja yahAM ke jyeShTha mAsIya mele kA mahatva dUra-darAja taka vikhyAta hai aura usakI hanumAna-bhakti adhUrI hI mAnate haiM Apa jisane alIgaMja ke maMdira meM mAthA nahIM TekA ho aura isake mele meM bhAga nahIM liyA ho.
# translit_indicxlit = sthan kaa nav-nirmaan hua aur aisaa utsav-ayojan sampann hua yahaan key hajaaron logon key bheed umad-umad padi kaee dino tuck. melle kaa mahatva tab say nirantar badhata gaya aur aaj yahaan key jyeshth maasiya melle kaa mahatva door-daraaj tuck vikhyaat hai aur usaki hanuman-bhakti adhuri hee maanate hain aap jisane aliganj key mandir mein matha nahin teka how aur isake melle mein bhaag nahin lia how.
# text_en = The place was renovated and such a festival was held. Thousands of people thronged here for many days. The importance of the fair increased continuously since then and today the importance of the Jyeshtha monthly fair here is known far and wide and its Hanuman-bhakti is incomplete if you have not bowed down in the temple of Aliganj and participated in its fair.
