# text = राजकुमारी-सी सजी रजनी अपने आप को गरीब, अनाथ कैसे बताती है, अगर राजीव के शरीर में नाग की आत्मा है, तो उसे नाग-जीवन याद क्यों नहीं आ रहा; रजनी जब भैंरोंनाथ के खेमें में जाती है, तभी वह उसे पिटारी में बंद क्यों नहीं करता आदि सवाल ऐसी फिल्मों में नहीं पूछे जाते!
# translit_iast = rājakumārī-sī sajī rajanī apane āpa ko garība, anātha kaise batātī hai, agara rājīva ke śarīra meṃ nāga kī ātmā hai, to use nāga-jīvana yāda kyoṃ nahīṃ ā rahā; rajanī jaba bhaiṃroṃnātha ke khemeṃ meṃ jātī hai, tabhī vaha use piṭārī meṃ baṃda kyoṃ nahīṃ karatā ādi savāla aisī philmoṃ meṃ nahīṃ pūche jāte!
# translit_itrans = rAjakumArI-sI sajI rajanI apane Apa ko garIba, anAtha kaise batAtI hai, agara rAjIva ke sharIra meM nAga kI AtmA hai, to use nAga-jIvana yAda kyoM nahIM A rahA; rajanI jaba bhaiMroMnAtha ke khemeM meM jAtI hai, tabhI vaha use piTArI meM baMda kyoM nahIM karatA Adi savAla aisI philmoM meM nahIM pUChe jAte!
# translit_indicxlit = rajkumari-see saji rajani apane aap coo garib, anath kaise bataati hai, agar rajeev key shareer mein naag key atma hai, too use naag-jeevan yaad kyon nahin aa raha; rajani jab bhainronath key khemein mein jaati hai, tabhi wah use pitari mein band kyon nahin karta aadi sawal aisee films mein nahin poochhe jaate!
# text_en = Rajkumari - How did the beautiful Rajni describe herself as poor and orphaned? If Rajiv has the spirit of a cobra in her body, why is he not remembering the life of a cobra? Why does he not lock her in a cage when Rajni goes to Bhairon Nath's camp? Such questions are not asked in films.
