# translit_itrans = dIpakoM kI jyoti eka saMkalpa kA AhvAna! isa avasara para hama ko saMkalpa lenA chAhie ki lAkhoM karoDoM logoM ke maMgala ke lie hama kAma karageM, unake jIvana meM maryAdA, mUlya sukha aura samRRiddhiba.Dhe isake lie kAma kareMge|
