# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ac_P2_S7
# text = संविधान के प्रावधानोंके अनुसार देशके सभी नाग-रिकोंके समान अधिकारोंकी व्यवस्था है, परन्तु देशके प्रक्षालित-बुध्दिके दिवास्वप्नदर्शी राजनीतिज्ञोंने संविधान के प्रावधानोंको बचाकर धर्मके नामपर विशिष्ट धार्मिक समुदायोंके लिए विशिष्ट व्यवस्थाकर दी और अन्य धार्मिक समुदायोंके लिए उदाहरण उपस्थितकर दिया अपने-अपने धार्मिक समुदायोंके लिए विशिष्ट व्यवस्थाओं की मांग करे, आन्दोलन करें, आतंकका वातावरण उत्पन्न करें औरपूरे दाशमें--विशेष रूपसे बहुसंख्यक वर्ग के लिए--असुरक्षाकी स्थिति बना दें और इसका लाभ उठाते हुए विशिष्ट क्षेत्र बनानेकी माँग करें, इनमें अपने बहुतकी स्थापना करें और इस प्रकार शक्ति-संचयके बाद अन्तत: अपने ही राज्यकी स्थापनाकी दिशामें आगे बढ़े।
# translit_iast = saṃvidhāna ke prāvadhānoṃke anusāra deśake sabhī nāga-rikoṃke samāna adhikāroṃkī vyavasthā hai, parantu deśake prakṣālita-budhdike divāsvapnadarśī rājanītijñoṃne saṃvidhāna ke prāvadhānoṃko bacākara dharmake nāmapara viśiṣṭa dhārmika samudāyoṃke lie viśiṣṭa vyavasthākara dī aura anya dhārmika samudāyoṃke lie udāharaṇa upasthitakara diyā apane-apane dhārmika samudāyoṃke lie viśiṣṭa vyavasthāoṃ kī māṃga kare, āndolana kareṃ, ātaṃkakā vātāvaraṇa utpanna kareṃ aurapūre dāśameṃ--viśeṣa rūpase bahusaṃkhyaka varga ke lie--asurakṣākī sthiti banā deṃ aura isakā lābha uṭhāte hue viśiṣṭa kṣetra banānekī mā~ga kareṃ, inameṃ apane bahutakī sthāpanā kareṃ aura isa prakāra śakti-saṃcayake bāda antata: apane hī rājyakī sthāpanākī diśāmeṃ āge bar̤he|
# translit_itrans = saMvidhAna ke prAvadhAnoMke anusAra deshake sabhI nAga-rikoMke samAna adhikAroMkI vyavasthA hai, parantu deshake prakShAlita-budhdike divAsvapnadarshI rAjanItij~noMne saMvidhAna ke prAvadhAnoMko bachAkara dharmake nAmapara vishiShTa dhArmika samudAyoMke lie vishiShTa vyavasthAkara dI aura anya dhArmika samudAyoMke lie udAharaNa upasthitakara diyA apane-apane dhArmika samudAyoMke lie vishiShTa vyavasthAoM kI mAMga kare, Andolana kareM, AtaMkakA vAtAvaraNa utpanna kareM aurapUre dAshameM--visheSha rUpase bahusaMkhyaka varga ke lie--asurakShAkI sthiti banA deM aura isakA lAbha uThAte hue vishiShTa kShetra banAnekI mA.Nga kareM, inameM apane bahutakI sthApanA kareM aura isa prakAra shakti-saMchayake bAda antata: apane hI rAjyakI sthApanAkI dishAmeM Age ba.Dhe|
# translit_indicxlit = samvidhaan key praavdhaanonke anusaar deshke sabhi naag-rikonke samaan adhikaaronki vyavastha hai, parantu deshke prakshaalit-budhdike divaswapnadarshi rajnitigyonne samvidhaan key praavdhaanonko bachaakar dharmake nampar vishisht dhaarmik samudaayonke lie vishisht vyavasthakar dee aur any dhaarmik samudaayonke lie udaaharan upasthitkar diya apane-apane dhaarmik samudaayonke lie vishisht vyavasthaon key maang karey, andolan karein, atankaka vatavaran utpann karein aurpure daashamen--vishesh roopse bahusankhyak varg key lie--asurakshaaki sthiti banaa den aur iska laabh uthaate hue vishisht kshetra banaaneki maang karein, inmein apane bahutaki sthaapana karein aur iss prakaar shakti-sanchayake baad antat: apane hee rajyaki sthaapanaaki dishaamen age badhe.
# text_en = The country has equal rights for all citizens as per the provisions of the Constitution, but the daydreaming politicians of the country's enlightened intellect saved the provisions of the Constitution, made special arrangements for specific religious communities in the name of religion, set an example for other religious communities to demand specific arrangements for their respective religious communities, agitate, create an atmosphere of terror and create a situation of security for the entire country - especially for the majority class - and take advantage of this to create specific areas and establish many of them and thus move towards the establishment of their own state after accumulating power.
