# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ac_P2_S53
# text = यह उन्मादी बहुसंख्यक वर्ग इस राज्यके प्रत्येक क्षेत्रपर छा गया, प्रत्येक क्षेत्रको केवल अपनाही अधिकार क्षेत्र बना लिया, पूरे राज्यको केवल अपनाही सत्ताका केन्द्र बना लिया, जिसमें किसी अन्य वर्ग-समुदायके लिए स्थान नहीं रहा और व्यावहारिक रुपमें एक स्वतन्त्र राज्य बना लिया, इस स्वतन्त्र राज्यको वैधानिक रुप प्रदान करने के लिए आतंक-हिंसाका नग्न प्रारम्भकर दिया और अब अल्पसंख्यकोंके निष्कासनपर तुलाहै।
# translit_iast = yaha unmādī bahusaṃkhyaka varga isa rājyake pratyeka kṣetrapara chā gayā, pratyeka kṣetrako kevala apanāhī adhikāra kṣetra banā liyā, pūre rājyako kevala apanāhī sattākā kendra banā liyā, jisameṃ kisī anya varga-samudāyake lie sthāna nahīṃ rahā aura vyāvahārika rupameṃ eka svatantra rājya banā liyā, isa svatantra rājyako vaidhānika rupa pradāna karane ke lie ātaṃka-hiṃsākā nagna prārambhakara diyā aura aba alpasaṃkhyakoṃke niṣkāsanapara tulāhai|
# translit_itrans = yaha unmAdI bahusaMkhyaka varga isa rAjyake pratyeka kShetrapara ChA gayA, pratyeka kShetrako kevala apanAhI adhikAra kShetra banA liyA, pUre rAjyako kevala apanAhI sattAkA kendra banA liyA, jisameM kisI anya varga-samudAyake lie sthAna nahIM rahA aura vyAvahArika rupameM eka svatantra rAjya banA liyA, isa svatantra rAjyako vaidhAnika rupa pradAna karane ke lie AtaMka-hiMsAkA nagna prArambhakara diyA aura aba alpasaMkhyakoMke niShkAsanapara tulAhai|
# translit_indicxlit = yeah unmaadi bahusankhyak varg iss rajyake pratyek kshetrapar chhaa gaya, pratyek kshetrako kewal apanaahi adhikaar kshetra banaa lia, pure rajyako kewal apanaahi sattaka kendra banaa lia, jisamen kissy any varg-samudaayake lie sthan nahin raha aur vyaavhaarik rupmein ack swatantra rajya banaa lia, iss swatantra rajyako vaidhaanik roop pradaan karane key lie aatank-hinsaka nagna prarambhakar diya aur ab alpasankhyakonke nishkasanpar tulaahai.
# text_en = This fanatical majority overran every region of this state and made every region its own jurisdiction and made the entire state its own seat of power with no place for any other class or community and practically created an independent state and unleashed terror and violence to legitimize this independent state and now started the expulsion of minorities.
