# text = स्वभावत: यह प्रश्न उठताहै कि बंगलादेश और पाकिस्तानसे निष्कासित करोड़ों लोगोंका कोई मुक्ति मोर्चा क्यों नहीं बनने दिया गया, और उन्हें क्यों मान्यता नहीं दी गयी,क्यों सहायता नहीं दी गयी, चटगांवसे आये बौध्द चकमाओ को, उनके मुक्तिसंर्घषको, उनकी शान्तिवाहिनीको मान्यता क्यो नहीं दीगयी?
# translit_iast = svabhāvata: yaha praśna uṭhatāhai ki baṃgalādeśa aura pākistānase niṣkāsita karor̤oṃ logoṃkā koī mukti morcā kyoṃ nahīṃ banane diyā gayā, aura unheṃ kyoṃ mānyatā nahīṃ dī gayī,kyoṃ sahāyatā nahīṃ dī gayī, caṭagāṃvase āye baudhda cakamāo ko, unake muktisaṃrghaṣako, unakī śāntivāhinīko mānyatā kyo nahīṃ dīgayī?
# translit_itrans = svabhAvata: yaha prashna uThatAhai ki baMgalAdesha aura pAkistAnase niShkAsita karo.DoM logoMkA koI mukti morchA kyoM nahIM banane diyA gayA, aura unheM kyoM mAnyatA nahIM dI gayI,kyoM sahAyatA nahIM dI gayI, chaTagAMvase Aye baudhda chakamAo ko, unake muktisaMrghaShako, unakI shAntivAhinIko mAnyatA kyo nahIM dIgayI?
# translit_indicxlit = swabhaavat: yeah prashn uthataahai kii bangladesh aur pakistanse nishkaasit karodon logonka koi mukti morcha kyon nahin banane diya gaya, aur unhein kyon maanyata nahin dee gayee,kyon sahaayata nahin dee gayee, chatgaonse aye baudhd chakmaao coo, unake muktisanrghashako, unaki shantivahiniko maanyata kyo nahin deegayi?
# text_en = Naturally, the question arises as to why no liberation front of the millions expelled from Bangladesh and Pakistan was allowed to be formed and recognised and why no aid was given to them and why the Buddhist Chakmas from Chittagong and their liberation struggle and their peacekeeping force were not recognised.
