# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot20ad_P2_S58
# text = 0 छोटेपन से ही जिन बच्चों के पालन-पोषण में पिता भाग नहीं लेते ,वे बच्चे भविष्य में परिस्थितियों के साथ समायोजन करने में ज्यादा सफल नहीं होते,जबकि वे बच्चे जिनके माता-पिता दोनों छोटेपन से ही उनके संपर्क में रहते हैं,वे छोटेपन से ही दो मित्र व्यक्तियों के भिन्न-भिन्न कार्यों से परिचित हो जाते हैं।
# translit_iast = 0 choṭepana se hī jina baccoṃ ke pālana-poṣaṇa meṃ pitā bhāga nahīṃ lete ,ve bacce bhaviṣya meṃ paristhitiyoṃ ke sātha samāyojana karane meṃ jyādā saphala nahīṃ hote,jabaki ve bacce jinake mātā-pitā donoṃ choṭepana se hī unake saṃparka meṃ rahate haiṃ,ve choṭepana se hī do mitra vyaktiyoṃ ke bhinna-bhinna kāryoṃ se paricita ho jāte haiṃ|
# translit_itrans = 0 ChoTepana se hI jina bachchoM ke pAlana-poShaNa meM pitA bhAga nahIM lete ,ve bachche bhaviShya meM paristhitiyoM ke sAtha samAyojana karane meM jyAdA saphala nahIM hote,jabaki ve bachche jinake mAtA-pitA donoM ChoTepana se hI unake saMparka meM rahate haiM,ve ChoTepana se hI do mitra vyaktiyoM ke bhinna-bhinna kAryoM se parichita ho jAte haiM|
# translit_indicxlit = 0 chhotepan say hee jinn bachchon key paalan-poshan mein pita bhaag nahin lete ,way bachche bhavishya mein paristhitiyon key saath samaayojan karane mein zyada safal nahin hote,jabaki way bachche jinake maataa-pita dono chhotepan say hee unake sampark mein rehte hain,way chhotepan say hee doe mitra vyaktiyon key bhinn-bhinn karyon say parichit how jaate hain.
# text_en = Children whose fathers do not participate in their upbringing from an early age are less successful in adjusting to circumstances in the future, while children whose parents have both been in contact with them from an early age become familiar with the different actions of two friendly individuals.
