# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot20aq_P2_S91
# text = बिहार भाजपा अध्यक्ष ताराकांत झा ने आरोप लगाया कि मधेपुरा में आडवाणी की हत्या करने की पूरी तैयारी जनतादलवालों ने कर रखी थी आडवाणी पर हमले की घटना के पहले 30 अप्रैल को उत्तर प्रदेश के मुख्यमंत्री मुलायम सिंह यादव को बिहार की अपनी चुनावी सभा में भीषण पथराव का शिकार तब होना पड़ा जब वे बेतिया के शहीद पार्क में समाजवादी जनतापार्टी के उम्मीदवार के लिए भाषण करने खड़े हुए।6 मई को मुख्यमंत्री लालू यादव जब गिरिडीह में चुनाव सभा संबोधित करने गये ,तो उन्हें भी पथराव का शिकार होना पड़ा।
# translit_iast = bihāra bhājapā adhyakṣa tārākāṃta jhā ne āropa lagāyā ki madhepurā meṃ āḍavāṇī kī hatyā karane kī pūrī taiyārī janatādalavāloṃ ne kara rakhī thī āḍavāṇī para hamale kī ghaṭanā ke pahale 30 apraila ko uttara pradeśa ke mukhyamaṃtrī mulāyama siṃha yādava ko bihāra kī apanī cunāvī sabhā meṃ bhīṣaṇa patharāva kā śikāra taba honā par̤ā jaba ve betiyā ke śahīda pārka meṃ samājavādī janatāpārṭī ke ummīdavāra ke lie bhāṣaṇa karane khar̤e hue|6 maī ko mukhyamaṃtrī lālū yādava jaba giriḍīha meṃ cunāva sabhā saṃbodhita karane gaye ,to unheṃ bhī patharāva kā śikāra honā par̤ā|
# translit_itrans = bihAra bhAjapA adhyakSha tArAkAMta jhA ne Aropa lagAyA ki madhepurA meM ADavANI kI hatyA karane kI pUrI taiyArI janatAdalavAloM ne kara rakhI thI ADavANI para hamale kI ghaTanA ke pahale 30 apraila ko uttara pradesha ke mukhyamaMtrI mulAyama siMha yAdava ko bihAra kI apanI chunAvI sabhA meM bhIShaNa patharAva kA shikAra taba honA pa.DA jaba ve betiyA ke shahIda pArka meM samAjavAdI janatApArTI ke ummIdavAra ke lie bhAShaNa karane kha.De hue|6 maI ko mukhyamaMtrI lAlU yAdava jaba giriDIha meM chunAva sabhA saMbodhita karane gaye ,to unheM bhI patharAva kA shikAra honA pa.DA|
# translit_indicxlit = bihaar bhajpa adhyaksh tarakant jhaa nay aarop lagaaya kii madhepura mein adwani key hatyaa karane key puri taiyari jantadalwalon nay cur rakhi thee adwani para hamale key ghatana key pehle 30 aprail coo utter pradesh key mukhyamantri mulayam singh yadav coo bihaar key apni chunavi sabha mein bheeshan pathraav kaa shikar tab honah padaa jab way betiya key shaheed park mein samajwadi jantaparty key ummidwar key lie bhashan karane khade hue.6 maee coo mukhyamantri lalu yadav jab giridih mein chunaav sabha sambodhit karane gaye ,too unhein bhi pathraav kaa shikar honah padaa.
# text_en = Bihar BJP president Tarakant Jha alleged that the Janata Dal had made all preparations to assassinate Advani in Madhepura. Before the attack on Advani, on 30 April, Uttar Pradesh Chief Minister Mulayam Singh Yadav was subjected to severe stone-pelting at his election meeting in Bihar when he stood up to speak for the Samajwadi Janata Party candidate at Shaheed Park in Bettiah. On 6 May, Chief Minister Lalu Yadav was also stoned when he went to address an election meeting in Giridih.
