# text = जब रामकुमार का अभिन्न मित्र सतीश सभ्य संसार और उन्नत देशों की उर्वरा भूमि में प्रस्फुटित, विकसित और उनकी दीर्घ आयास अनुभूति से परिपुष्ट आधुनिक नारी का परिष्कृत आदर्श-रूप मित्र के सामने रखता तो उसके रूप-रंग की तुलना में कुमार को सरला का सौंदर्य बिल्कुल फीका, नीरस और निस्सार लगने लगता था.
# translit_iast = jaba rāmakumāra kā abhinna mitra satīśa sabhya saṃsāra aura unnata deśoṃ kī urvarā bhūmi meṃ prasphuṭita, vikasita aura unakī dīrgha āyāsa anubhūti se paripuṣṭa ādhunika nārī kā pariṣkṛta ādarśa-rūpa mitra ke sāmane rakhatā to usake rūpa-raṃga kī tulanā meṃ kumāra ko saralā kā sauṃdarya bilkula phīkā, nīrasa aura nissāra lagane lagatā thā.
# translit_itrans = jaba rAmakumAra kA abhinna mitra satIsha sabhya saMsAra aura unnata deshoM kI urvarA bhUmi meM prasphuTita, vikasita aura unakI dIrgha AyAsa anubhUti se paripuShTa Adhunika nArI kA pariShkRRita Adarsha-rUpa mitra ke sAmane rakhatA to usake rUpa-raMga kI tulanA meM kumAra ko saralA kA sauMdarya bilkula phIkA, nIrasa aura nissAra lagane lagatA thA.
# translit_indicxlit = jab ramkumar kaa abhinn mitra satish sabhya sansar aur unnat deshon key urvara bhoomi mein prasfutit, vikasit aur unaki deergh ayas anubhooti say paripusht aadhunik naari kaa parishkrit adarsh-roop mitra key saamane rakhta too usake roop-rung key tulanaa mein kumar coo sarla kaa saundarya bilkul fika, neeras aur nissar lagane lagata tha.
# text_en = When Satish, an integral friend of Ramkumar, presented to Mitra the refined ideal of the modern woman, blossoming in the fertile soil of the civilized world and advanced countries, developed and endowed with her long sense of longevity, Kumar found Sarala's beauty dull and frivolous in comparison to her complexion.
