# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot19k.txt_P2_S77
# text = सतीश साधारण कम्यूनिस्टिक टेंपरामेंट (स्वभाव) के अनुरूप अधिक-से-अधिक पक्षपात और घृणा व्यंजक शब्दों में मध्यवर्ग की सभ्यता का जैसा खंडन करता, इन भद््दी बर्बर प्रथाओं की जैसी ऐतिहासिक व्याख्या देता, संसार के भविष्य का जो स्वर्ण-चित्र खींचता, और श्रमजीवी रूस की स्त्रियों के स्वतंत्र जीवन का जैसा अतिरंजित दृश्य आंखों के सामने खड़ा कर देता, उसे कुमार बड़े ही ध्यान पूर्वक और कभी-कभी मुग्ध-भाव से सुनता था.
# translit_iast = satīśa sādhāraṇa kamyūnisṭika ṭeṃparāmeṃṭa (svabhāva) ke anurūpa adhika-se-adhika pakṣapāta aura ghṛṇā vyaṃjaka śabdoṃ meṃ madhyavarga kī sabhyatā kā jaisā khaṃḍana karatā, ina bhaddī barbara prathāoṃ kī jaisī aitihāsika vyākhyā detā, saṃsāra ke bhaviṣya kā jo svarṇa-citra khīṃcatā, aura śramajīvī rūsa kī striyoṃ ke svataṃtra jīvana kā jaisā atiraṃjita dṛśya āṃkhoṃ ke sāmane khar̤ā kara detā, use kumāra bar̤e hī dhyāna pūrvaka aura kabhī-kabhī mugdha-bhāva se sunatā thā.
# translit_itrans = satIsha sAdhAraNa kamyUnisTika TeMparAmeMTa (svabhAva) ke anurUpa adhika-se-adhika pakShapAta aura ghRRiNA vyaMjaka shabdoM meM madhyavarga kI sabhyatA kA jaisA khaMDana karatA, ina bhaddI barbara prathAoM kI jaisI aitihAsika vyAkhyA detA, saMsAra ke bhaviShya kA jo svarNa-chitra khIMchatA, aura shramajIvI rUsa kI striyoM ke svataMtra jIvana kA jaisA atiraMjita dRRishya AMkhoM ke sAmane kha.DA kara detA, use kumAra ba.De hI dhyAna pUrvaka aura kabhI-kabhI mugdha-bhAva se sunatA thA.
# translit_indicxlit = satish sadharan communistic temperament (swabhaav) key anuroop adhik-say-adhik pakshapaat aur ghrina vyanjak shabdon mein madhyavarg key sabhyata kaa jaisa khandan karta, inn bhaddi barber prathaon key jaisi aitihaasik vyakhya deta, sansar key bhavishya kaa zoo swarna-chitra kheenchata, aur shramjeevi rouse key striyon key swatantra jeevan kaa jaisa atiranjit drishya aankho key saamane khadaa cur deta, use kumar badey hee dhyan poorvak aur kabhi-kabhi mugdh-bhaav say sunata tha.
# text_en = Kumar listened intently and sometimes fascinated by the way Satish satirically decried the middle-class civilisation, the excessive partisanship and hatred that accompanied the usual communist temperament, the historical interpretation of these hideous barbaric practices, the golden-picture drawings of the future of the world and the extravagant scenes of the free life of working-class Russian women.
