# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot19k.txt_P2_S78
# text = वाह, वह उन्मुक्त अनिल और उज्जवल आतप में पली हुई स्वतंत्र नारी मूर्ति. निर्मल आकाश जिसके नयनों को नित्य नवीन नीलिमा प्रदान करता है, सद्य: स्फुट सुमनों का सौरभ जिसकी सांसों में बसता है, पक्षियों का कलरव कंठ में कूक भरता है, उषा जिसके कपोलों में गुलाब बन जाती है, बार-बार स्वच्छ जल में तैरने से जिसके अंगों की तनिमा और सुकुमारता में सजीवता आ गयी है, छहों ऋतुएं जिसके सौंदर्य को प्रस्फुटित करने के लिए अपना सर्वस्व निछावर करती रहती हैं-
# translit_iast = vāha, vaha unmukta anila aura ujjavala ātapa meṃ palī huī svataṃtra nārī mūrti. nirmala ākāśa jisake nayanoṃ ko nitya navīna nīlimā pradāna karatā hai, sadya: sphuṭa sumanoṃ kā saurabha jisakī sāṃsoṃ meṃ basatā hai, pakṣiyoṃ kā kalarava kaṃṭha meṃ kūka bharatā hai, uṣā jisake kapoloṃ meṃ gulāba bana jātī hai, bāra-bāra svaccha jala meṃ tairane se jisake aṃgoṃ kī tanimā aura sukumāratā meṃ sajīvatā ā gayī hai, chahoṃ ṛtueṃ jisake sauṃdarya ko prasphuṭita karane ke lie apanā sarvasva nichāvara karatī rahatī haiṃ-
# translit_itrans = vAha, vaha unmukta anila aura ujjavala Atapa meM palI huI svataMtra nArI mUrti. nirmala AkAsha jisake nayanoM ko nitya navIna nIlimA pradAna karatA hai, sadya: sphuTa sumanoM kA saurabha jisakI sAMsoM meM basatA hai, pakShiyoM kA kalarava kaMTha meM kUka bharatA hai, uShA jisake kapoloM meM gulAba bana jAtI hai, bAra-bAra svachCha jala meM tairane se jisake aMgoM kI tanimA aura sukumAratA meM sajIvatA A gayI hai, ChahoM RRitueM jisake sauMdarya ko prasphuTita karane ke lie apanA sarvasva niChAvara karatI rahatI haiM-
# translit_indicxlit = wah, wah unmukt anil aur ujjawal aatap mein pully hui swatantra naari murti. nirmal akash jisake nayanon coo nitya naveen nilima pradaan karta hai, sadya: sphut sumanon kaa saurabh jisaki saanson mein basata hai, pakshiyon kaa kalrav kantha mein cook bharata hai, ushaa jisake kapolon mein gulab bn jaati hai, baar-baar swachh jal mein tairane say jisake angon key tanima aur sukumarta mein sajeevata aa gayee hai, chhahon rituen jisake saundarya coo prasfutit karane key lie apna sarvasva nichhaavar karati rahati hain-
# text_en = Wow! That free-spirited woman in an open and radiant glow. The serene sky whose eyes constantly give new blue. The fresh, fresh, fresh, the fragrance of the fresh air that lingers in her breath. The chirping of birds that fills her throat. The rose in her foreheads. The fresh, fresh, and fresh water in which her limbs are held alive by repeated swimming. The six seasons that give their all to the beauty of the bloom.
