# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot19k.txt_P2_S79
# text = वह सबल, स्वच्छ, सुंदर स्त्री के रूप का आदर्श जिसका मानसिक सौंदर्य अपनी ही अधिकता में फूटकर उसे स्त्रीत्व को अपनी उज्जवलता में छिपा लेता है, उस स्वतंत्रता के आलोक में देह-ज्ञान जैसे छाया की तरह बिलकुल पीछे पड़ जाता है- वह प्रशस्त आदर्श इन अंधरूढ़ियों की संकीर्णता से परे है.
# translit_iast = vaha sabala, svaccha, suṃdara strī ke rūpa kā ādarśa jisakā mānasika sauṃdarya apanī hī adhikatā meṃ phūṭakara use strītva ko apanī ujjavalatā meṃ chipā letā hai, usa svataṃtratā ke āloka meṃ deha-jñāna jaise chāyā kī taraha bilakula pīche par̤a jātā hai- vaha praśasta ādarśa ina aṃdharūr̤hiyoṃ kī saṃkīrṇatā se pare hai.
# translit_itrans = vaha sabala, svachCha, suMdara strI ke rUpa kA Adarsha jisakA mAnasika sauMdarya apanI hI adhikatA meM phUTakara use strItva ko apanI ujjavalatA meM ChipA letA hai, usa svataMtratA ke Aloka meM deha-j~nAna jaise ChAyA kI taraha bilakula pIChe pa.Da jAtA hai- vaha prashasta Adarsha ina aMdharU.DhiyoM kI saMkIrNatA se pare hai.
# translit_indicxlit = wah sable, swachh, sunder stree key roop kaa adarsh jiska mansik saundarya apni hee adhikta mein footkar use streetva coo apni ujjavalata mein chhipa letta hai, usa swatantrata key aalok mein deh-gyaan jaise chaya key tarah bilkul peechhe parh jaataa hai- wah prashast adarsh inn andharudhiyon key sankirnata say prey hai.
# text_en = The ideal of the strong, pure, beautiful feminine form whose mental beauty bursts forth in its own excess, hiding its femininity in its radiance, and in the light of that freedom, falling as far back as the shadow of the body-knowledge - that ideal of the sublime is beyond the narrow reach of these illusions.
