# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot19k.txt_P2_S81
# text = मानो अपने जन्म-जन्मांतर के दुव्धा-संकोच को एक ही क्षण में भगा, जिस सहज, संयत भाव से स्वामी के कमरे में प्रवेश कर, छोटी-सी मेज पर सुंदर ढंग से चाय का सामान सजा दिया, उसे देखकर रामकुमार मानों विस्मय और आनंद के मारे अवाक् हो गया.
# translit_iast = māno apane janma-janmāṃtara ke duvdhā-saṃkoca ko eka hī kṣaṇa meṃ bhagā, jisa sahaja, saṃyata bhāva se svāmī ke kamare meṃ praveśa kara, choṭī-sī meja para suṃdara ḍhaṃga se cāya kā sāmāna sajā diyā, use dekhakara rāmakumāra mānoṃ vismaya aura ānaṃda ke māre avāk ho gayā.
# translit_itrans = mAno apane janma-janmAMtara ke duvdhA-saMkocha ko eka hI kShaNa meM bhagA, jisa sahaja, saMyata bhAva se svAmI ke kamare meM pravesha kara, ChoTI-sI meja para suMdara DhaMga se chAya kA sAmAna sajA diyA, use dekhakara rAmakumAra mAnoM vismaya aura AnaMda ke mAre avAk ho gayA.
# translit_indicxlit = mano apane janma-janmaantar key duvdha-sankoch coo ack hee kshan mein bhagaa, jis sahaj, sanyat bhaav say swami key kamare mein pravesh cur, chhoti-see maze para sunder dhang say chaya kaa saman saza diya, use dekhkar ramkumar mano vismay aur anand key maare avaak how gaya.
# text_en = Ramkumar was amazed and delighted at the ease with which he entered the master's room and beautifully arranged the tea-stuff on the small table, as if he had overcome the hesitation of his birth-birthday in a single moment.
