# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18at_P2_S18
# text = जिस कविताके आधारपर संग्रह का शीर्षक रखा गयाहै, उस `दिन शीर्षक कवितामें कवि ने सौन्दर्यकी शक्तिको रेखांकित कियाहै-- हवाएं चिल्लाती रहीं सूरज अपने घोड़ोंपर चाबुक बरसाता रहा कुत्ते भूँकते रहे मशीनें रह-रहकर धक्का मारता रहीं लेकिन नहीं हिला चट्टान-सा यह दिन तभी एक फूल कहीं खिलकर मुसकरा पड़ा और न जाने क्या हुआ कि दिन थरथराकर भीतरसे पिघलने लगा।
# translit_iast = jisa kavitāke ādhārapara saṃgraha kā śīrṣaka rakhā gayāhai, usa `dina śīrṣaka kavitāmeṃ kavi ne saundaryakī śaktiko rekhāṃkita kiyāhai-- havāeṃ cillātī rahīṃ sūraja apane ghor̤oṃpara cābuka barasātā rahā kutte bhū~kate rahe maśīneṃ raha-rahakara dhakkā māratā rahīṃ lekina nahīṃ hilā caṭṭāna-sā yaha dina tabhī eka phūla kahīṃ khilakara musakarā par̤ā aura na jāne kyā huā ki dina tharatharākara bhītarase pighalane lagā|
# translit_itrans = jisa kavitAke AdhArapara saMgraha kA shIrShaka rakhA gayAhai, usa `dina shIrShaka kavitAmeM kavi ne saundaryakI shaktiko rekhAMkita kiyAhai-- havAeM chillAtI rahIM sUraja apane gho.DoMpara chAbuka barasAtA rahA kutte bhU.Nkate rahe mashIneM raha-rahakara dhakkA mAratA rahIM lekina nahIM hilA chaTTAna-sA yaha dina tabhI eka phUla kahIM khilakara musakarA pa.DA aura na jAne kyA huA ki dina tharatharAkara bhItarase pighalane lagA|
# translit_indicxlit = jis kavitaake aadhaarpar sangrah kaa sheershak rakhaa gayaahai, usa `dinn sheershak kavitaamen kavi nay saundaryaki shaktiko rekhaankit kiahai-- havaaen chillaati raheen suraj apane ghodonpar chabuk barsaataa raha kutte bhoonkate rahe machines rah-rahkar dhakka maartaa raheen lekin nahin hilaa chattan-sha yeah dinn tabhi ack fool kahin khilkar muskara padaa aur naa jaane kya hua kii dinn thartharakar bhitarse pighalane lagaa.
# text_en = In the poem on which the collection is based, titled Ekadashi Din, the poet has underlined the power of beauty -- the winds howled, the sun whipped its horses, the dogs barked, the machines kept pushing, but not the rock -- that day, a flower blossomed and smiled, and not knowing what happened, the day began to shake and melt from within.
