# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18at_P2_S71
# text = अपनी कल्पना और छंद न्यास द्वारा इस परिकल्पनाका रुयायन चार सर्गों--यथा गाथा, स्वर्ण देश, लौह देश तथा शाँति देशमें विभाजित इस प्रस्तुत प्रबन्ध-नाटिकामें लगभग इक्कीस पात्रोंकी मानसिकता से सम्बन्धित और संभावित परिस्थितियोंकी एक-दूसरेके विरुद्ध समायोजित कियाहै।
# translit_iast = apanī kalpanā aura chaṃda nyāsa dvārā isa parikalpanākā ruyāyana cāra sargoṃ--yathā gāthā, svarṇa deśa, lauha deśa tathā śā~ti deśameṃ vibhājita isa prastuta prabandha-nāṭikāmeṃ lagabhaga ikkīsa pātroṃkī mānasikatā se sambandhita aura saṃbhāvita paristhitiyoṃkī eka-dūsareke viruddha samāyojita kiyāhai|
# translit_itrans = apanI kalpanA aura ChaMda nyAsa dvArA isa parikalpanAkA ruyAyana chAra sargoM--yathA gAthA, svarNa desha, lauha desha tathA shA.Nti deshameM vibhAjita isa prastuta prabandha-nATikAmeM lagabhaga ikkIsa pAtroMkI mAnasikatA se sambandhita aura saMbhAvita paristhitiyoMkI eka-dUsareke viruddha samAyojita kiyAhai|
# translit_indicxlit = apni kalpana aur chand nyaas dwara iss parikalpanaka ruyayan chaar sargon--yathaa gaatha, swarna desh, loh desh tathaa shanti deshmein vibhajit iss prastut prabandh-naatikaamen lagbhag ikkis patronki mansikta say sambandhit aur sambhaavit paristhitiyonki ack-dusreke viruddh samaayojit kiahai.
# text_en = Divided into four cantos - Yatha Gatha, Swarna Desha, Iron Desha and Shanti Desha - the play deals with the psyche of about twenty-one characters and juxtaposes possible situations against each other.
