# text = अगर उससे शादी करनी है तो प्रशांत को उसकी मां के पास पहुंचा दो या हास्टल में रखो. मां की गोद से निकल कर पिता की बांहों में रहने के लिए आया प्रशांत, मां बाप की जिद और अपनी अपनी खुशियों की खोज में लीन गैरजिम्मेदार लोगों के कारण असहाय, निराश्रित सा हास्टल में डाल दिया जाता है.
# translit_iast = agara usase śādī karanī hai to praśāṃta ko usakī māṃ ke pāsa pahuṃcā do yā hāsṭala meṃ rakho. māṃ kī goda se nikala kara pitā kī bāṃhoṃ meṃ rahane ke lie āyā praśāṃta, māṃ bāpa kī jida aura apanī apanī khuśiyoṃ kī khoja meṃ līna gairajimmedāra logoṃ ke kāraṇa asahāya, nirāśrita sā hāsṭala meṃ ḍāla diyā jātā hai.
# translit_itrans = agara usase shAdI karanI hai to prashAMta ko usakI mAM ke pAsa pahuMchA do yA hAsTala meM rakho. mAM kI goda se nikala kara pitA kI bAMhoM meM rahane ke lie AyA prashAMta, mAM bApa kI jida aura apanI apanI khushiyoM kI khoja meM lIna gairajimmedAra logoM ke kAraNa asahAya, nirAshrita sA hAsTala meM DAla diyA jAtA hai.
# translit_indicxlit = agar usase shaadi karni hai too prashant coo usaki maan key paas pahuncha doe yaa hastle mein rakho. maan key god say nickel cur pita key banhon mein rahane key lie aaya prashant, maan baap key zid aur apni apni khushiyon key khoj mein lean gairzimmedar logon key kaaran asahaay, niraashrit sha hastle mein doll diya jaataa hai.
# text_en = If he is to be married, then send Prashant to his mother or put him in a hostel. Prashant came out of his mother's lap to live in his father's arms. Prashant is thrown into a hostel, helpless and destitute, due to his parents'stubbornness and irresponsible people who are busy in their own pursuit of happiness.
