# translit_indicxlit = jaise hee wah hastle key get para pahunchati hai, saamane say rajendra key saath aa raha prashant daud cur maan say lipat cur row padata hai, mummy, ab mujhe kabhi apane say door nahin karogi naa! tripti bhi use lipta cur row padati hai aur use vachan detee hai kii ab wah use kabhi apane say door nahin karegi.
# text_en = As she reaches the hostel gate, Prashant, who is coming with Rajendra from the front, runs and cries, hugging his mother. Mommy, will you never take me away from you now? Trupti also cries, hugging him and promising him that she will never take him away from you.
