# translit_iast = udāharaṇa ke liye karane athavā utpanna karane ke artha meṃ `ka ke yoga se janaka, pālaka, rakṣaka, bhakṣaka; śikṣaka jaise, tathā utpanna karane ke artha meṃ `ja ke yoga se jalaña, aṇḍaja, ātmaja, paṃkaja, aja jaise, aura dāna-vācaka `da ke yoga se jalada, dhanada, mukhada jaise evaṃ pālana ke vācaka `pa ke yoga se mūpa, nṛpa jaise aneka śabdoṃ kānirmāṇa saṃskṛta bhāṣā kī eka anupama viśeṣatā hai, jo kadācita hī anya kisī bhāṣā meṃ mila sakegī|
# translit_itrans = udAharaNa ke liye karane athavA utpanna karane ke artha meM `ka ke yoga se janaka, pAlaka, rakShaka, bhakShaka; shikShaka jaise, tathA utpanna karane ke artha meM `ja ke yoga se jala~na, aNDaja, Atmaja, paMkaja, aja jaise, aura dAna-vAchaka `da ke yoga se jalada, dhanada, mukhada jaise evaM pAlana ke vAchaka `pa ke yoga se mUpa, nRRipa jaise aneka shabdoM kAnirmANa saMskRRita bhAShA kI eka anupama visheShatA hai, jo kadAchita hI anya kisI bhAShA meM mila sakegI|
