# translit_iast = 8 apraila, 1929 ko bhagata siṃha ne apane sāthī baṭukeśvara datta ke sātha dillī kī seṃṭrala aseṃbalī meṃ `bahare kānoṃ ko sunāne ke lie bama pheṃkā; donoṃ vīroṃ ne darśaka-dīrghā se `iṃkalāba jiṃdābāda aura `briṭiśa sāmrājya murdābāda ke nāre lagāye aura svayaṃ ko giraphtārī ke lie peśa kara diyā.
