# translit_indicxlit = 8 aprail, 1929 coo bhagat singh nay apane saathi batukeshwar datt key saath dilly key central assembly mein `bahare kaanon coo sunaane key lie bum fenka; dono veeron nay darshak-deergha say `inklab zindabad aur `british samrajya murdabad key naare lagaaye aur swayam coo giraftari key lie pesh cur diya.
