# text = भगत सिंह ने 23 दिसंबर, 1929 को अपनी ओर से चट्टोपाध्याय को एक पत्र लिखा जो आज 51 वर्ष बाद अक्षरश: दिया जा रहा है: आपने अपने सम्मानित पत्र के दिसंबर, 1929 के अंक में एक टिप्पणी `इंकलाब जिंदाबाद शीर्षक से लिखी है और इस नारे को निरर्थक ठहराने की चेष्टा की है.
# translit_iast = bhagata siṃha ne 23 disaṃbara, 1929 ko apanī ora se caṭṭopādhyāya ko eka patra likhā jo āja 51 varṣa bāda akṣaraśa: diyā jā rahā hai: āpane apane sammānita patra ke disaṃbara, 1929 ke aṃka meṃ eka ṭippaṇī `iṃkalāba jiṃdābāda śīrṣaka se likhī hai aura isa nāre ko nirarthaka ṭhaharāne kī ceṣṭā kī hai.
# translit_itrans = bhagata siMha ne 23 disaMbara, 1929 ko apanI ora se chaTTopAdhyAya ko eka patra likhA jo Aja 51 varSha bAda akSharasha: diyA jA rahA hai: Apane apane sammAnita patra ke disaMbara, 1929 ke aMka meM eka TippaNI `iMkalAba jiMdAbAda shIrShaka se likhI hai aura isa nAre ko nirarthaka ThaharAne kI cheShTA kI hai.
# translit_indicxlit = bhagat singh nay 23 disambar, 1929 coo apni or say chattopadhyay coo ack patra likhaa zoo aaj 51 varsh baad akshrash: diya jaa raha hai: aapane apane sammaanit patra key disambar, 1929 key ank mein ack tippani `inklab zindabad sheershak say likhi hai aur iss naare coo nirathak thaharaane key cheshta key hai.
# text_en = Bhagat Singh wrote a letter to Chattopadhyay on his behalf on 23 December 1929, which is being delivered today after 51 years : You have written a comment in the December 1929 issue of your esteemed letter titled :'Jinnah : Inquilab Zindabad'and have tried to disprove this slogan.
