# text = हिन्दुस्तान में रहना है, तो हिन्दू बनकर रहना होगा, हिन्दू सिख भाई-भाई, मुस्लिम कौम कहां से आई, हम हैं मुस्लिम तीस करोड़, लेंगे तेरा खून निचोड़ , अब तो अयोध्या जाना है, बाबरी मस्जिद पाना है जैसे नारे दीवारों पर तो लिखे ही हैं, अब लोगों के दिलों में भी ये हिलोरें ले रहे हैं।
# translit_iast = hindustāna meṃ rahanā hai, to hindū banakara rahanā hogā, hindū sikha bhāī-bhāī, muslima kauma kahāṃ se āī, hama haiṃ muslima tīsa karor̤a, leṃge terā khūna nicor̤a , aba to ayodhyā jānā hai, bābarī masjida pānā hai jaise nāre dīvāroṃ para to likhe hī haiṃ, aba logoṃ ke diloṃ meṃ bhī ye hiloreṃ le rahe haiṃ|
# translit_itrans = hindustAna meM rahanA hai, to hindU banakara rahanA hogA, hindU sikha bhAI-bhAI, muslima kauma kahAM se AI, hama haiM muslima tIsa karo.Da, leMge terA khUna nicho.Da , aba to ayodhyA jAnA hai, bAbarI masjida pAnA hai jaise nAre dIvAroM para to likhe hI haiM, aba logoM ke diloM meM bhI ye hiloreM le rahe haiM|
# translit_indicxlit = hindustan mein rehna hai, too hindu bunker rehna hoga, hindu sikh bhaai-bhaai, muslim kaum kahaan say aai, humm hain muslim tees karod, lenge terra khoon nichod , ab too ayodhya jaanaa hai, babri masjid panna hai jaise naare divaaron para too likhe hee hain, ab logon key dilon mein bhi yeye hiloren lay rahe hain.
# text_en = To live in Hindustan, you have to live as a Hindu. Hindu, Sikh, Bhai, Muslim, where did the community come from? We are Muslims. Thirty crores will take your blood. Now slogans like go to Ayodhya, get Babri Masjid are written on the walls. Now these slogans are also taking place in the hearts of the people.
