# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18a_P2_S1
# text = पचपन-साठ वर्ष की उम्र का कोई व्यक्ति जो घटनाओं की तारीखें नहीं याद रख पाता हो, लेकिन जिसकी रुचि राजनीति में भी और नेहरु-परिवार में भी रही हो, शायद यही बतलाएगा कि जिस वर्ष लॉर्ड क्रिप्स के नेतृत्व में `कैबिनेट मिशन भारत आया था, उसी वर्ष संजय गान्धी की पैदाइश हुई थी।
# translit_iast = pacapana-sāṭha varṣa kī umra kā koī vyakti jo ghaṭanāoṃ kī tārīkheṃ nahīṃ yāda rakha pātā ho, lekina jisakī ruci rājanīti meṃ bhī aura neharu-parivāra meṃ bhī rahī ho, śāyada yahī batalāegā ki jisa varṣa laॉrḍa kripsa ke netṛtva meṃ `kaibineṭa miśana bhārata āyā thā, usī varṣa saṃjaya gāndhī kī paidāiśa huī thī|
# translit_itrans = pachapana-sATha varSha kI umra kA koI vyakti jo ghaTanAoM kI tArIkheM nahIM yAda rakha pAtA ho, lekina jisakI ruchi rAjanIti meM bhI aura neharu-parivAra meM bhI rahI ho, shAyada yahI batalAegA ki jisa varSha laॉrDa kripsa ke netRRitva meM `kaibineTa mishana bhArata AyA thA, usI varSha saMjaya gAndhI kI paidAisha huI thI|
# translit_indicxlit = pachpan-saath varsh key umr kaa koi vyakti zoo ghatnaaon key taareekhen nahin yaad rakh paataa how, lekin jisaki ruchi rajneeti mein bhi aur nehru-parivar mein bhi rahee how, shayed yahee batalaayega kii jis varsh lord crips key netritva mein `cabinet mission bharat aaya tha, usee varsh sanjay gandhi key paidaish hui thee.
# text_en = Someone in his fifties and sixties who cannot remember the dates of the events, but who has been interested in politics and the Nehru family, would probably say that Sanjay Gandhi was born in the year the Cabinet Mission led by Lord Cripps came to India.
