# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18a_P2_S53
# text = महत्त्वपूर्ण तथ्य यह है कि संजय गान्धी ने अनुबन्ध-पत्र मिलने पर जिस उत्साह के साथ `मारुति नामक अपनी मोटरगाड़ी बनाने के लिए 4 जून, 1971 ई. को मारुति लिमिटेड कि स्थापना की और कारखाना बनाने के लिए हरियाणा के तत्कालीन मुख्य मन्त्री वंशीलाल के सहयोग से दिल्ली-गुड़गाँव सड़क के किनारे 405 एकड़ से कुछ ज्यादा जमीन प्राप्त की।
# translit_iast = mahattvapūrṇa tathya yaha hai ki saṃjaya gāndhī ne anubandha-patra milane para jisa utsāha ke sātha `māruti nāmaka apanī moṭaragār̤ī banāne ke lie 4 jūna, 1971 ī. ko māruti limiṭeḍa ki sthāpanā kī aura kārakhānā banāne ke lie hariyāṇā ke tatkālīna mukhya mantrī vaṃśīlāla ke sahayoga se dillī-gur̤agā~va sar̤aka ke kināre 405 ekar̤a se kucha jyādā jamīna prāpta kī|
# translit_itrans = mahattvapUrNa tathya yaha hai ki saMjaya gAndhI ne anubandha-patra milane para jisa utsAha ke sAtha `mAruti nAmaka apanI moTaragA.DI banAne ke lie 4 jUna, 1971 I. ko mAruti limiTeDa ki sthApanA kI aura kArakhAnA banAne ke lie hariyANA ke tatkAlIna mukhya mantrI vaMshIlAla ke sahayoga se dillI-gu.DagA.Nva sa.Daka ke kinAre 405 eka.Da se kuCha jyAdA jamIna prApta kI|
# translit_indicxlit = mahattvapurna tathya yeah hai kii sanjay gandhi nay anubandh-patra milane para jis utsaah key saath `maruti namak apni motorgadi banaane key lie 4 juuna, 1971 ee. coo maruti limited kii sthaapana key aur karkhana banaane key lie haryana key tatkalin mukhya mantri vanshilal key sahyog say dilly-gudgaon sadak key kinare 405 ekad say kuchha zyada jameen praapt key.
# text_en = Significantly, Sanjay Gandhi, on receipt of the letter of agreement, enthusiastically set up Maruti Limited on 4 June 1971 to build his motor car called the Jeep Maruti and acquired a little over 405 acres of land along the Delhi-Gurgaon road in collaboration with the then Chief Minister of Haryana, Vanshi Lal, to build the factory.
