# translit_itrans = yaha bAta isa ilAke meM gaura karane lAyaka hai ki jagaha-jagaha para barAbarI se do taraha ke maMdira haiM-- eka sarvasAdhAraNa kA, eka rAjA kA banavAyA huA. . . lekina bhI.Da jo hai vaha unhIM maMdiroM meM dikhAI detI hai, jo saMtoM se yA sarvasAdhAraNa se ju.De hue haiM.
# translit_indicxlit = yeah baat iss ilaake mein gaur karane laayak hai kii jagah-jagah para barabari say doe tarah key mandir hain-- ack sarvasadharan kaa, ack raja kaa banavaaya hua. . . lekin bheed zoo hai wah unheen mandiron mein dikhai detee hai, zoo santon say yaa sarvasadharan say jure hue hain.
