# text = इस पेड़ पर कृष्ण ने बांसुरी है बजायी, वहां से टेर दी, यहां दधि का दान लेते थे, यहां गोपियों को छेड़ा, यहां मोर नृत्य किया, यहां महारास, यहां राधा को मनाया. . . इस पहाड़ी पर राधा का गांव, वहां उधर उनकी सखी का. . . सब के सब उठ कर खड़े हो जाते हैं.
# translit_iast = isa per̤a para kṛṣṇa ne bāṃsurī hai bajāyī, vahāṃ se ṭera dī, yahāṃ dadhi kā dāna lete the, yahāṃ gopiyoṃ ko cher̤ā, yahāṃ mora nṛtya kiyā, yahāṃ mahārāsa, yahāṃ rādhā ko manāyā. . . isa pahār̤ī para rādhā kā gāṃva, vahāṃ udhara unakī sakhī kā. . . saba ke saba uṭha kara khar̤e ho jāte haiṃ.
# translit_itrans = isa pe.Da para kRRiShNa ne bAMsurI hai bajAyI, vahAM se Tera dI, yahAM dadhi kA dAna lete the, yahAM gopiyoM ko Che.DA, yahAM mora nRRitya kiyA, yahAM mahArAsa, yahAM rAdhA ko manAyA. . . isa pahA.DI para rAdhA kA gAMva, vahAM udhara unakI sakhI kA. . . saba ke saba uTha kara kha.De ho jAte haiM.
# translit_indicxlit = iss paid para krishna nay bansuri hai bajaayi, vahan say terre dee, yahaan dadhi kaa daan lete they, yahaan gopis coo chheda, yahaan more nritya kiya, yahaan maharas, yahaan radha coo manaaya. . . iss pahadi para radha kaa gaon, vahan udhar unaki sakhi kaa. . . sub key sub uthh cur khade how jaate hain.
# text_en = On this tree Krishna played the flute, from there he threw the dadi, here he took the daadi, here he teased the gopis, here he danced the peacock, here he celebrated Radha, here he was the king of the maharsas, on this hill his village, and there his friend, everyone stood up.
