# text = कभी-कभी तो बड़ी विचित्र बातें होती हैं . . . सत्येंद्र कह रहा था--- जैसे अभी आपके साथ चल रहा हूं, पर लगता है किसी भी क्षण उस झाड़ से, या उस पेड़ के पीछे से राधा-कृष्ण उचकते-कूदते आ प्रकट होंगे. . . किसी भी पेड़ पर गोपों की टोली बैठी देखायी दे जायेगी.
# translit_iast = kabhī-kabhī to bar̤ī vicitra bāteṃ hotī haiṃ . . . satyeṃdra kaha rahā thā--- jaise abhī āpake sātha cala rahā hūṃ, para lagatā hai kisī bhī kṣaṇa usa jhār̤a se, yā usa per̤a ke pīche se rādhā-kṛṣṇa ucakate-kūdate ā prakaṭa hoṃge. . . kisī bhī per̤a para gopoṃ kī ṭolī baiṭhī dekhāyī de jāyegī.
# translit_itrans = kabhI-kabhI to ba.DI vichitra bAteM hotI haiM . . . satyeMdra kaha rahA thA--- jaise abhI Apake sAtha chala rahA hUM, para lagatA hai kisI bhI kShaNa usa jhA.Da se, yA usa pe.Da ke pIChe se rAdhA-kRRiShNa uchakate-kUdate A prakaTa hoMge. . . kisI bhI pe.Da para gopoM kI TolI baiThI dekhAyI de jAyegI.
# translit_indicxlit = kabhi-kabhi too badee vichitra baatein hoti hain . . . satyendra kh raha tha--- jaise abhi aapke saath chal raha hoon, para lagata hai kissy bhi kshan usa jhaad say, yaa usa paid key peechhe say radha-krishna uchakate-koodate aa prakat honge. . . kissy bhi paid para gopon key tolly baithi dekhaayi dei jaayegi.
# text_en = Sometimes strange things happen... Satyendra was saying --- like I am walking with you now... but it seems that at any moment Radha-Krishna will appear from that tree or from behind that tree, jumping and jumping... On any tree, a group of gopus will be seen sitting.
