# translit_indicxlit = jinn dino isai apane dharma key prasaar key lie jihad cur rahe they, iran mein ack gupta sangathan assassin naam kaa tha zoo yuvakon para dore dalkar unhein hashish khilaata tha jab unhein nashaa how jaataa too unhein aise sthan para lay jaya jaataa tha jahaan sundariyan unaki seva key lie tatpar rahatin thee.
