# text = अमृता शेरगिल या अन्य किसी कला साधिका के अस्तित्व से पहले ही ग्रामीण महिलाएं तीज-त्योहारों पर घर की दीवारों, प्रवेश के अगल-बगल अपनी धार्मिक आस्था के तहत देवी देवताओं के स्वरुप, पौराणिक गाथाएं, चांद-सूरज, व्रत, मानव, आदि प्रतीकात्मक ढंग और अनगढ़ तरीके से बनाया करती थी, और अब भी बनाती है.
# translit_iast = amṛtā śeragila yā anya kisī kalā sādhikā ke astitva se pahale hī grāmīṇa mahilāeṃ tīja-tyohāroṃ para ghara kī dīvāroṃ, praveśa ke agala-bagala apanī dhārmika āsthā ke tahata devī devatāoṃ ke svarupa, paurāṇika gāthāeṃ, cāṃda-sūraja, vrata, mānava, ādi pratīkātmaka ḍhaṃga aura anagar̤ha tarīke se banāyā karatī thī, aura aba bhī banātī hai.
# translit_itrans = amRRitA sheragila yA anya kisI kalA sAdhikA ke astitva se pahale hI grAmINa mahilAeM tIja-tyohAroM para ghara kI dIvAroM, pravesha ke agala-bagala apanI dhArmika AsthA ke tahata devI devatAoM ke svarupa, paurANika gAthAeM, chAMda-sUraja, vrata, mAnava, Adi pratIkAtmaka DhaMga aura anaga.Dha tarIke se banAyA karatI thI, aura aba bhI banAtI hai.
# translit_indicxlit = amrita shergill yaa any kissy calla sadhika key astitva say pehle hee grameen mahilaaen teej-tyohaaron para ghar key divaaron, pravesh key agal-bagel apni dhaarmik aastha key tahat devi devtaon key swarup, pauranik gaathaaen, chand-suraj, vrat, maanav, aadi prateekaatmak dhang aur angarh tareeke say banaaya karati thee, aur ab bhi banaati hai.
# text_en = Even before Amrita Shergill or any other art teacher existed, rural women used to and still do make figurative and abstract compositions in the form of gods and goddesses, mythological stories, moon-sun-baths, human beings, etc. on Teej-Fests, on the walls of the house and around the entrance.
