# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot18ai2_P2_S54
# text = चित्रकारों में जया अप्पासामी. फातिमा अहमद, अर्पिता सिंह, रेखा राव, हरविंदर बावा, गीती भट्टाचार्य, वीरबाला भाव-सार, सुनीता बिंद्रा, शैलबाला, विश्वनाथ. सूरजीत चोयल, कमला लक्ष्मी, किशोरी कौल, शनु लहिरी, प्रकाश और नरुला, मेरी डायस, माधवी पारेख, कृष्ण शंकर, मीनाक्षी काजी, प्रभा बी. डोगरे, मालीत बरदराजन, बी. प्रभा, कोमला वर्दन, आदि के नाम लिए जा सकते हैं.
# translit_iast = citrakāroṃ meṃ jayā appāsāmī. phātimā ahamada, arpitā siṃha, rekhā rāva, haraviṃdara bāvā, gītī bhaṭṭācārya, vīrabālā bhāva-sāra, sunītā biṃdrā, śailabālā, viśvanātha. sūrajīta coyala, kamalā lakṣmī, kiśorī kaula, śanu lahirī, prakāśa aura narulā, merī ḍāyasa, mādhavī pārekha, kṛṣṇa śaṃkara, mīnākṣī kājī, prabhā bī. ḍogare, mālīta baradarājana, bī. prabhā, komalā vardana, ādi ke nāma lie jā sakate haiṃ.
# translit_itrans = chitrakAroM meM jayA appAsAmI. phAtimA ahamada, arpitA siMha, rekhA rAva, haraviMdara bAvA, gItI bhaTTAchArya, vIrabAlA bhAva-sAra, sunItA biMdrA, shailabAlA, vishvanAtha. sUrajIta choyala, kamalA lakShmI, kishorI kaula, shanu lahirI, prakAsha aura narulA, merI DAyasa, mAdhavI pArekha, kRRiShNa shaMkara, mInAkShI kAjI, prabhA bI. Dogare, mAlIta baradarAjana, bI. prabhA, komalA vardana, Adi ke nAma lie jA sakate haiM.
# translit_indicxlit = chitrakaron mein jaya appasamy. fatima ahmed, arpita singh, rekha raw, harvinder baava, geetee bhattacharya, veerbala bhaav-saar, suneeta bindra, shailbala, vishwanath. surjeet choyal, kamala lakshmi, kishori kaul, shanu lahiri, prakaash aur narula, merry dias, madhvi parekh, krishna shankar, meenakshi kaaji, prabha bee. dogre, maaleet baradarajan, bee. prabha, komla vardan, aadi key naam lie jaa sakate hain.
# text_en = Among the painters, the names of Jaya Appasamy.Fatima Ahmed, Arpita Singh, Rekha Rao, Harvinder Bawa, Geeti Bhattacharya, Veerbala Bhava-Sar, Sunita Bindra, Shailbala, Vishwanath.Surjit Choyal, Kamala Lakshmi, Kishori Kaul, Shanu Lahiri, Prakash and Narula.
