# text = इस विद्या में काम करने वाली कलाकारों में शोभा ब्रूटा, दमयंती चावला, नायरा, अहमदुल्ला, मोहिनी बक्शी, रेखा कक्कड़, सोनिया डेंबला, प्रयाग झा, अनुपम सूद, चंद्रमलीलाल दोषी, शीला हीरानंदिनी, देवियानी कृष्ण, किरन राठौर, सरोज पाल गोगी और ई. संतोष के नाम प्रसिद्धि पा चुके हैं.
# translit_iast = isa vidyā meṃ kāma karane vālī kalākāroṃ meṃ śobhā brūṭā, damayaṃtī cāvalā, nāyarā, ahamadullā, mohinī bakśī, rekhā kakkar̤a, soniyā ḍeṃbalā, prayāga jhā, anupama sūda, caṃdramalīlāla doṣī, śīlā hīrānaṃdinī, deviyānī kṛṣṇa, kirana rāṭhaura, saroja pāla gogī aura ī. saṃtoṣa ke nāma prasiddhi pā cuke haiṃ.
# translit_itrans = isa vidyA meM kAma karane vAlI kalAkAroM meM shobhA brUTA, damayaMtI chAvalA, nAyarA, ahamadullA, mohinI bakshI, rekhA kakka.Da, soniyA DeMbalA, prayAga jhA, anupama sUda, chaMdramalIlAla doShI, shIlA hIrAnaMdinI, deviyAnI kRRiShNa, kirana rAThaura, saroja pAla gogI aura I. saMtoSha ke nAma prasiddhi pA chuke haiM.
# translit_indicxlit = iss vidya mein kaam karane waali kalakaron mein shobha bruta, damayanti chawla, naira, ahmadullah, mohini bakshi, rekha kakkad, sonia dembla, prayag jhaa, anupam sood, chandramalilal doshi, shila hiranandini, deviani krishna, kieran rathaur, saroj pall gogi aur ee. santosh key naam prasiddhi paa chuke hain.
# text_en = Among the artists who worked on this lore are Shobha Broota, Damayanti Chawla, Naira, Ahmedullah, Mohini Bakshi, Rekha Kakkar, Sonia Dembla, Prayag Jha, Anupam Sood, Chandramalilal Doshi, Sheela Hiranandani, Devyani Krishna, Kiran Rathore, Saroj Pal Gogi and E. Santosh.
