# sent_id = hin-w-media-lot19bp.txt_P2_S37
# text = राजीव गांधी की यह यात्रा इस आईने में देखने से और अधिक महत्वपूर्ण हो जाती है कि जिन तीन देशों ने निर्गुट सम्मेलन को एक सार्थकता प्रदान की थी उनमें युगोस्लाविया मार्शल टीटो के निधन के बाद इस दिशा में उतना मुखर नहीं रह गया, मिस्र पश्चिम एशिया की सैनिक राजनीति के चंगुल में फंस कर बिलकुल दूसरी प्राथमिकाताओं में उलझ गया है.
# translit_iast = rājīva gāṃdhī kī yaha yātrā isa āīne meṃ dekhane se aura adhika mahatvapūrṇa ho jātī hai ki jina tīna deśoṃ ne nirguṭa sammelana ko eka sārthakatā pradāna kī thī unameṃ yugoslāviyā mārśala ṭīṭo ke nidhana ke bāda isa diśā meṃ utanā mukhara nahīṃ raha gayā, misra paścima eśiyā kī sainika rājanīti ke caṃgula meṃ phaṃsa kara bilakula dūsarī prāthamikātāoṃ meṃ ulajha gayā hai.
# translit_itrans = rAjIva gAMdhI kI yaha yAtrA isa AIne meM dekhane se aura adhika mahatvapUrNa ho jAtI hai ki jina tIna deshoM ne nirguTa sammelana ko eka sArthakatA pradAna kI thI unameM yugoslAviyA mArshala TITo ke nidhana ke bAda isa dishA meM utanA mukhara nahIM raha gayA, misra pashchima eshiyA kI sainika rAjanIti ke chaMgula meM phaMsa kara bilakula dUsarI prAthamikAtAoM meM ulajha gayA hai.
# translit_indicxlit = rajeev gandhi key yeah yatra iss ine mein dekhane say aur adhik mahatvapurna how jaati hai kii jinn teen deshon nay nirgut sammelan coo ack saarthaktaa pradaan key thee unamen yugoslavia marshal teato key nidhan key baad iss disha mein utanaa mukhar nahin rah gaya, misra paschim asia key sainik rajneeti key changul mein phans cur bilkul doosri prathmikataon mein ulajh gaya hai.
# text_en = Rajiv Gandhi's visit assumes greater significance in the light of the fact that of the three countries that gave the exit conference a sense of urgency, Yugoslavia has not been as vocal in this regard since the death of Marshal Tito, and Egypt has been caught in the clutches of West Asian military politics and has been caught in a different set of priorities altogether.
